d_code\":\"PQ5Q+XR Bryce Canyon City, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599PQ5Q+XR\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.2,\"reference\":\"ChIJP3QOdQ1nNYcRzwpGD88Hq0w\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Niraj Jain\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105219085480024430035\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLFU7lmWGZajpMLYML0pLdUJ0NBdku2YlB2_HstllHT=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Food was okay, Not vegan or vegetarian Friendly. I asked them for eggless dressing on sandwich or salad, they do not have it.\\nAsked for grilled sandwich with veggies, she gave me cold sandwich with toasted bread.\\nService was okay.\\nOur server didn\\u2019t ask which bread we want for sandwich, they gave in white bread.\\nOverall, it is a decent restaurant for food in the area as there are not much restaurants.\",\"time\":1693952332,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Manuel Streib\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108815230646499577193\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJR9MQ98M94IKdH4KV6t57QMYxGiUmyGYxI-BI2z5qR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"Cheeseburger with Fries & Fried Chicken with Mashed potatoes, broccoli and gravy were very tasty. Good price for quality. One add-on for cheeseburger (BBQ sauce) was missing, but on bill. However, we had a nice waitress.\",\"time\":1694837243,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jason Bridgford\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111430347229625042024\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIXP-SRAX13ocS_aNEdTRDSf3NmV6gVHQqZvMNRAzx8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"The best of limited options in the Bryce Canyon area. We were impressed by the service and food - especially the fountain drinks (ice cold!) and apple pie.\\n\\nSat down for dinner and received top notch service throughout the evening. The server recommended I try \'Johnny\'s IPA\' from Moab Brewery which was a great pint. My wife loved her Orange Fanta fountain drink - felt home made with plenty of ice and served in a jam jar.\\n\\nFood wise we had a starter of Munchers - essentially stuffed tater tots. They were nice but we weren\'t a big fan of the sauce that accompanied them.\\n\\nFor mains we had a Bistro Burger and a turkey melt. The food was good - my wife in particular loved her burger!\\n\\nWe finished up with some apple pie which was absolutely divine! Really showed the quality of traditional American pie.\\n\\nHighly recommend visiting - all up we spent roughly $75 but it was definitely worth it. There are so many mediocre options near Bryce Canyon so this is a real diamond in the rough.\",\"time\":1692588849,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Chillis Lives\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100736503442049434057\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjX02rI565nPZPWl05W1B7mFBhzpSuN4GD9niC-LGuxxq7Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Really good food, Chicken Fried Chicken, with sweet potato fries and mashed potatoes and gravy. The Colonel has nothing on this place.\\n\\nThis is also now my favorite pie place, ever!\\n\\nNo joke, your great grandmother doesn\'t have pie this good!\",\"time\":1693759704,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Chasity Smith\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113443931237473845705\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXcNIcWt73FDiXJM416hmQSbwFsTiyID9_EzbZzTl4XJYY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"There are very few food options anywhere near Bryce Canyon so your limited to finding decent food. The burger was very good and the bun was so soft. The lemon pepper trout was good and cooked very well, but not much lemon or pepper flavor. They had several wines listed, but only had 1 on hand. I\\u2019m still giving them a good rating because they are so remote it has to be hard to get supplies regularly.\",\"time\":1682272367,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=5524517953795918543\",\"user_ratings_total\":3024,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"2476 W Utah 12, Bryce Canyon City\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/bcpines.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:33','2023-09-19 05:55:33'),(2,'Bryce Canyon Resort','googleplaces','ChIJraFlMQ1mNYcRttIYJMiM7ZI',8,'Basic lodging offering casual rooms & cabins, plus an outdoor pool, a restaurant & a gift shop.',8,0.20,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.6921784,\"lng\":-112.1545717},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.6939089302915,\"lng\":-112.1534027697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.6912109697085,\"lng\":-112.1561007302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/lodging-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#909CE1\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/hotel_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Bryce Canyon Resort\",\"openi