\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV83kkA4JqU4RIkLhtTJq1UvSxswejs0oYqnDe9nKZcrAoD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Took a little while to order but the staff. Was friendly and this was a good clean store.  Beautiful weather we ate outside under the canvas tent.\",\"time\":1685478250,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Niladri Roy\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116325512850897782772\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXy8QhI0rTlMc0BeHwfeZQdYyPsSTzzt20cnR9EMVwPcc8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"11 months ago\",\"text\":\"Just situated outside of the Bryce Canyon NP and Red Canyon Campground. Very convenient and good option for quick grab lunch and dinner. Had our dinner while visiting Bryce Canyon. Very friendly associates. They have restrooms and have seats inside and outside where you can grab your food and enjoy. Found a very nice option to grab food in the Bryce city.\",\"time\":1664726313,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tyler Rust\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108594827538940084538\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVFr02QR5rdxK3unr1wxgj3FtoPimt5AACpNbl7jbJrm1U9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"There aren\\u2019t many other food options in the area. They have sub sandwiches with many different options of lunch meat, for example ham, roast beef, Turkey, salami, roast chicken, as well as vegetarian options. You can put toppings such as lettuce, tomato, onion, pickles, green peppers, banana peppers, olives, mayonnaise, mustard, oil, vinegar, salt, pepper, oregano, and Parmesan cheese. If you haven\\u2019t ever eaten at subway, it\\u2019s worth trying one time to decide if you like it or not. This would be a good location to try if you are a first timer.\",\"time\":1680206572,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Isaac Rust\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110889090287428843633\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIWBJkEjp-jID0RMrmMukpdOGguUPbv_xLSlA7O4_CZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Good subway but the dining area was pretty dirty. Snow covered the outdoor seating.\",\"time\":1680205482,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=15147918452442007978\",\"user_ratings_total\":490,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"139 Utah 12, Bryce Canyon City\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.com\\/united-states\\/ut\\/bryce\\/139-w-hwy-12?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=41664&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ4OTU4NTctNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:34','2023-09-19 05:55:34'),(5,'Outlaw Saloon and Steakhouse 21+','googleplaces','ChIJmUoceHlQNYcR3W4kn-C16Pk',11,'Laid-back, wood-outfitted saloon serving smoked ribs & steaks plus local brews, cocktails & wine.',8,0.20,1,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.6522683,\"lng\":-112.434249},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.65361738029149,\"lng\":-112.4329796697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.65091941970849,\"lng\":-112.4356776302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/map