maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110931229232288623384\\\">Lorena Garc\\u00eda Rebertos<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhRpT7A8fecm6KZaytFr6-_1Qyyj_fhWvQGS-qiEsIQBOaZEdiFG-_LF4GZ2zuZsM_SpYI9KlEpI4XRQEhow6CLjp9KyqdLcWt61ejWdivHbxmms9bzHfi4EqLHy1g6XUW9VHL0Kv2B3Bwee3plcMwzTz7PD75Bi96x0UbNp8dnEKOy\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116349009933733736850\\\">Brant Wojack<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zi9D9ZSH0bMjW_PScygY93atRnTrS3OtNy3F3jB6R6TmUcMNVJPorSZ6w_OyDysCSqDURdtPD_zgUdG6PAbNUW9GXOgbx54CY5BYz0nt9bxrIxTwAkjqS7r96PbXS4UqH-Ynbufph_A1BUDGDJNDEDTLBl_KxzoUfE0cdqilQBJggs\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105096552276218263980\\\">Chiara S.<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziiTCh4lSUvKWXhqfTgAK1dIuJXIT5V4WG1ldRIFSfjq6KL6n_VmpjMy-NoqEDhI-hT1-fHD5zRFnc1WhFBRpxHQcYP2yhjR6hZgMbEKmNTodCP1CtnDRirDZpCgiy7k-YH9m9gTNpu4mcXQ96BrSlmQlVnkfr-2IM8g3bhJ9TQyD8D\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJmUoceHlQNYcR3W4kn-C16Pk\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"MH28+W8 Hatch, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599MH28+W8\"},\"rating\":4.4,\"reference\":\"ChIJmUoceHlQNYcR3W4kn-C16Pk\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Melinda Schroeder\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101299401192220517814\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUMbn4qehapQWXeb_tdGuS2xApbDAgBBm_8sO6w7NqNOjzb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"What a gem of a place we found!  Best steak I have hand in a loooooong time.  You have the option of cooking it yourself, but why\\u2026 they do such a wonderful job!  Service was spectacular!  Packed house with only two servers , but still personable and expedient.  We had Lorali as our server\\u2026 TOP NOTCH!  \\ud83c\\uddfa\\ud83c\\uddf8\\ud83c\\udde9\\ud83c\\uddea\",\"time\":1691892812,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Emilie M.\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110270461090335304085\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWcAcL_0OKFdZVxcKWMKnPvUuCq4twbpOPAEVU0syzZ498=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Really glad we stopped in! Steak, potato, roll and lively little side salad for $29 before tax. Yes please!\\nGood salad options and also a kickass Impossible Burger too. Thanks for having us.\",\"time\":1694143640,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"AmirReza Oghbaee\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102450438109475361370\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWzZJtMaekQ-bw2lHVF8nX7JrdCdjAhhbdgsDGjDRF0htZz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Great drinks and good food! They are super friendly and nice and the vibe is super unique with lots of games and even an indoor grill if you prefer to grill your own food yourself!\",\"time\":1690120700,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Stan Klinefelter\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112767837992394467021\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocL8cvo02DVLMojS8FuEzwECFzfGPhsfcwkEzpiycNWo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Dinner at this restaurant last Tuesday was one of the worst dining experiences we have ever had. The main room is poorly lit, but quite large, with a couple of pool tables and a large bar. There are about six or seven tables.  Apart from two young men playing pool, and a couple at one table, the place was deserted. The room adjacent to the main room has the grill for grilling your own steaks, as well as the \\u201csalad toppings bar\\u201c and a few tables.  The grill was not in use, and the salad topping bar offered garbanzo beans, pickled beets from a jar, a mostly empty container of shredded carrots, and a couple of other items not worthy of mention. The service started reasonably well with a pleasant woman welcoming us with menus in hand. We ordered drinks, a chicken sandwich with barbecue sauce and 1\\/2 side of ribs also with barbecue sauce. The server then disappeared and ultimately began chatting at the bar with one of the pool players. We tried to wave her over, and the best we got was a signal that she would be with us in a minute. After about five minutes another server came and move things along. It was clear that she was covering for her colleague, who would swing by every five or 10 minutes and tell us that our ribs were almost done, and that the food would be out in a while. Her colleague finally brought the food and we never saw our sever again, as she was still engaged in her conversation at the bar.  The chicken in the sandwich was OK, but the ribs were terrible and the barbecue sauce not much better.  Meat should be falling off of ribs, but these ribs required serious surgery, and there wasn\\u2019t much meat. When the back up server finally brought our bill, it was too dark to examine closely, but the total seemed correct. She gave me an electronic pad, which asked me to select the amount of the tip.  I gave a 15% tip and we were out of there. The next day I looked at the receipt and saw that the Outlaw had taken the liberty of adding an 18% tip before giving me the bill. When added to the 15% that I gave when I got the bill, we ended up tipping 33% for poor service. In retrospect, I could have examined the check and seen the automatic tip, but it really was too dark to do that.  Also, without going back to the Outlaw, I can\\u2019t swear that the automatic tip wasn\\u2019t disclosed on the menu (although it is a modest menu and we has plenty of time to look at it) or that the electronic pad didn\\u2019t say \\u201cadditional tip\\u201d, but I don\\u2019t think either were the case.  In any event, it wasn\\u2019t the money, it was the principal.  Go to the Outlaw at your peril.\",\"time\":1694278754,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Chiara S.\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105096552276218263980\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVDBEkJDdsb6RRTq6b1UGUcWDryhlVH7pfB20pxn9FcdfYQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Excellent service and thoughtful chef. Very delicious food & drinks! We loved the  atmosphere and would absolutely recommend! :)\",\"time\":1689124693,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"bar\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=18007843086388195037\",\"user_ratings_total\":382,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"138 North Main Street, Hatch\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/outlawbrycecanyon.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:34','2023-09-19 05:55:34'),(6,'Ruby\'s Inn Cowboy\'s Buffet & Steak Room','googleplaces','ChIJ5crY6RxmNYcRllxBs8YFJpw',12,'Family-friendly eatery with a Western theme serving buffet meals for breakfast, lunch & dinner.',8,0.20,0,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.6736862,\"lng\":-112.1569971},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.6749461302915,\"lng\":-112.1554265197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.6722481697085,\"lng\":-112.1581244802915}}},\"icon\":\"h