76263119943687\\\">Francois Arsene<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjWkDmkPRfZORoV8R43xVwPVb_kODtgQlSGRgPvANvE28VcgQd6tMqv-3V82jh6gBhXbB90kO7Zwqx494x9jRLpQAPx7ZsuRgeiv4qG1ZDEc4odDQe870DQMp_-lB0W8fTKJdDzg22CeZ4_ObUqhGy8F-zk3BUGtDB86IV9U1kM917Z\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117186233839388513005\\\">sungeun Choi<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgWfJucGi4pnHNSIzisRMhfR9_Ly931oyYl6C9--QC_YCwpHiEO3Jv1kc-1awjHT_FWj87O84VOzAxobIFx3osR6MMPHMJF7mhkygRNGml1Kc5GFZR0dn1DFLc5X9Q1BPTEBTu7tF9AL-rTNhPolrR9pILBRtTrHfRRaWdRiVVPIvF5\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107259696867191568057\\\">Adam Davis<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgkKmbMJYf1CEDR4zAh-eMSeEy08XVz-zHNtdH6qPf52h7wJsKO-xXoyRtBNapFBZ0fDme1Do55h4x-lE3dpI58lYzATf_Brmtj4mtU2jRsWkbZD1XRe0Fr5u8swyT81SGBBxJXHzJwpa1NOl8y7GeFX65FZvfpcEWVq-g64DMVis2m\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3000,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110724628392637611572\\\">Chris Leck<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgnsCWxbKXVUWnNrxnWKYya6tkmb0Y8HP3iNLvQOsU9bFTAImEuwxJnMPFML9DcmKoyYmHrCc1IK5Zubxy4xHtnDoZb-my68bagah5ZwriwMLyc9ltv7o9kHH1GRC88f6cEM5q_dhk9ZmgqpXRo-BGi7VytGBmwALsX68w55De_g0kc\",\"width\":4000}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ5crY6RxmNYcRllxBs8YFJpw\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"MRFV+F6 Bryce Canyon City, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599MRFV+F6\"},\"rating\":3.9,\"reference\":\"ChIJ5crY6RxmNYcRllxBs8YFJpw\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"J. Kim\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106977440260206847966\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUdpsM5HXizkxWYp2eU-puVmoSXtLx9ZWYzedY422-WdnDK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"I ordered a steak and a coke. Delicious and  enjoyable lunch there. The restaurant has salad buffet section which I liked. Vege and protein was perfect combo for me!\\nAnd I felt here\'s kid-friendly. I admired how servers kindly treat kids by providing some kid menu papers and pencil that help kids spend their time with joy.\\nI wish to come back and stay in this historic inn!\",\"time\":1694803500,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Brianna Shaffer\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117050302841588043582\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWcAofxNQpXgwXuQ8VW8GIgN3iVNQQ-dnCc-4Bmb9H78RAj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Good experience. I think the buffet quality food is lesser quality than ordering of an entree from the menu. Get there for lunch buffet if you wanna pay less.  You can ask for cheeseburger from the lunch menu during dinner. They have two menus.  Salad bar is great. We were there 2 separate times while visiting last. I would go back again.\",\"time\":1691042928,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lawrence C.\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104703732031905041806\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJnSHPYt2oQQEAX4iNTjxkiGz7jhrOOeuQXePB0-97c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"My wife and I had a wonderful dinner. We had the local trout (from nearby Idaho). This included potato and asparagus, and our server was very accommodating to double up on the veggies and forgo the potato.\\n\\nThis also included one trip visit to the salad bar.\\n\\nQuality of everything was great. Portion size of the trout was very ample. Prices were most reasonable.\\n\\nI don\'t understand the low rating received by others. I\'d return as the buffet looks amazing and is also reasonably priced.\",\"time\":1683601556,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Just Sturgis\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108823978031050857646\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW1mcuBunXFtlOUbnGdNZcLy1tpzotgedBdxjVu23z_BIV-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"SAVE YOUR MONEY, SAVE YOUR SANITY, GO SOMEWHERE ELSE. Even if you have to drive an hour, it\'s worth NOT eating here.\\n\\nOne of the worst dining experiences I\'ve ever had. Definitely the most expensive meal I\'ve ever had in terms of price vs. value. $50 for lunch for 2ppl???!! This was about 10x what I would have willingly paid for the meal we experienced.\\n\\nWe walked up right after a man that was asking for a table for a large group. There were only two of us. The preteen hostesses (4 of them) didn\'tv think to check if we were with the large group. They also didn\'t check with the 3 separate couples that queued up behind us. After around 5 minutes, I finally stepped up to inform the girls that we were looking for a table for 2.\\n\\nMeanwhile there are 3 employees sitting in a booth adjacent the hostess area and one gets up to help find a setup for the large group (were they all just hanging out in the booth while on the clock?)\\n\\nAcross from the hostess stand is a cashier counter (I\'m not sure what they do there as our check was presented and charged by our waiter.) There were between 2 and 10 people behind the counter at any given point. Mostly hanging out, laughing, and having a good time chatting while we all stood waiting on a table. Half the people coming in and out of the cashier\'s area were not in uniform though they clearly \\\"worked\\\" there. Most were back there looking at their phones and drinking sodas from some other fast food place.\\n\\nAfter finally getting a booth, we started in on the buffet. It would have been an adequate buffet at $8, but for $18 it was absolutely grand larceny! Mediocre in every possible way.\\n\\nThe tarter sauce packets next to the fried fish were hot, not just warm, not room temp, actually hot. Salmonella anyone? \\ud83e\\udd22\\n\\nThe entire time we were eating, there were dozens of employees wandering around the dining room. Not working or being useful in anyway, just wandering around talking, laughing, staring at teenage girls. The experience was surreal.\\n\\nThe only bright spot was our waiter Alex from Maldovia, who was fantasti. Along with one other waiter from Romania, they seemed to be the only two getting anything done out of a staff of dozens. In fact, staff outnumbered guests 2:1 yet there were lines for seating, dirty tables everywhere, and empty containers on the buffet. They even had some poor lady stationed next to a trash can right in the middle of the dining area (I think it was supposed to be a bussing station, but it just ended up being weird and kind of gross.)\\n\\nCannot recommend at all.\",\"time\":1689080928,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tommy Williams\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100887939975515390470\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXGr_I3LU9ZxtunJ4mv6CSi5fT068P5ouQjmaOSZzt1tmB2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"I enjoyed my hot hamburger sandwich very much, it was tasty and I piled my bowl high for my one trip side salad. The entire buffet looks pretty good. Needed more variety in the soups - just tomato basil and creamy baked potato. More than adequate food, smiling service and perfectly cheesy atmosphere make this five stars.\",\"time\":1686251834,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=11251687070000831638\",\"user_ratings_total\":4605,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"26 South Main Street, Bryce Canyon City\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.rubysinn.com\\/restaurant-in-bryce-canyon\\/cowboys-buffet-steak-room\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:35','2023-09-19 05:55:35'),(7,'Ebenezer\'s Barn and Grill Dinner Show','googleplaces','ChIJ7zoRAqhoNYcRO6q3bdg-EXs',13,'Fixed-price, hearty American dinners & a live show with country music & cowboy demonstrations.',15,0.20,0,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.6719395,\"lng\":-112.154165},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.6735810802915,\"lng\":-112.1527216197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.6708831197085,\"lng\":-112.1554195802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Ebenezer\'s Barn and Grill Dinner Show\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":false},\"photos\":[{\"height\":2160,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100021863606418374616\\\">Ebenezer&#39;s Barn and Grill Dinner Show<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhFUN8ixBJNmpZMiUzmR0zXU6ggbqUVVpLzUpK27zl22fdSBu733dPh8ubI-DeHJgewEzZu9Etd6mZGa-Ygh69R79KwyzwvRrrqOAjfBt8hoGje5sU4Tz-pI8hHuC_VpiYCT2Gyo9Ek6E4_AcJvLKpJGflWSr9EioUVFPJx2HojZvdl\",\"width\":3840}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ7zoRAqhoNYcRO6q3bdg-EXs\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"MRCW+Q8 Bryce Canyon City, UT, USA\",\"global_cod