t.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV4fchRB8iH3PGpwMk8hciLaw0kQg6mL7fOW3sagfc9v6k-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"The food was absolutely disgusting, almost inedible and although the place is clean and the staff is friendly, I do not recommend it at all.  The only thing mildly decent was the Philly cheesesteak sandwich, which was just Ok.\\nDon\'t order the chicken bowl or the friend shrimp.  It was awful.\",\"time\":1694314307,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Dave Thornton\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102589203245172310266\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV83kkA4JqU4RIkLhtTJq1UvSxswejs0oYqnDe9nKZcrAoD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Was going to try this place since we had the buffet yesterday.  They didn\\u2019t have several items including what I thought might be the safest choice. Pizza.  So I got a hot dog.  It was big but not very tasty. My wife got the chicken tenders.  This is not real chicken. But the fries were awesome!!  Subway down the street is a much better option.\",\"time\":1685543465,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Casey M\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105850226948002110108\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUKuGqNAvCi0VJIHZOEzUKj7X80L8V9descvbLNiGPo05pK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Nice little fast food place to eat after a day spent in Bryce. The small pizzas were delicious and the wait wasn\'t too long.\",\"time\":1688070645,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sam Bawahab\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113616123236992144988\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV9Wvc4cDiVzK0B14tCEwERY-CS1QNTB8OYeuaajhT_zVw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"We stop here get quick bite after visiting Bryce Canyon heading back to Springdale UT.  We wanted to eat fast place since I did not want drive in the cayons at night with falling.\\n\\nKids where cold and hungry.  I need a cup hot coffee.   Food was good serve hot.  Restaurant  was clean. Restroom clean.   Cashier super nice and friendly.\",\"time\":1678160309,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Shriraam Murali\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103619313328820942560\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWcFgudNm4a9lW7Vqg-hflgcvicYsN1-oa_pVDK8pi2rlU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"9 months ago\",\"text\":\"If you are visiting Bryce Canyon national Park, and if you are looking for a quick bite a little outside the park, then definitely head to this place. Considering the fact that the restaurants inside the park is not open all the time, you can definitely go here. Food was a little bit pricey but it was good. The cashier was pretty racist and I wish they have a better service which would make this place a good one.\",\"time\":1671475030,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=3543298724570318082\",\"user_ratings_total\":817,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"25 North Main Street, Bryce Canyon City\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.rubysinn.com\\/restauran