al_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocK9wNmu52dE6mEOpBh9zckItXhCriHVrYSt22qU7FM6_R0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"What a great little place.\\n\\nCould tell its well loved by the community due to the age ranges of the customers.\\n\\nAnd it looked like they all loved their pizzas and much as we did.\\n\\nAdmittedly we made the mistake of a 16\\\" pizza between 2 Scottish folk. Bit of a struggle but we made it!\\n\\nGood food and great staff. Good prices too for the quality.\",\"time\":1685921929,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Alan Lai\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116049778383828394750\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXDsqGS0qDwAku7_T6MbnF13RjHTd33a895DzD1WoP1LP4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Great experience here and great food. Kristen S. was such an amazing waitress. We have food allergies and we love that Pizza Place and Kristen was so attentive and worked with us for those food allergies.\\n\\nPizzas were definitely amazing, would love to come back next time we are in the area, worth the quick 10 minute drive from Bryce.\",\"time\":1685310151,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"jbaldarrago\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107414382048314650644\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKGNl7r03YD8pcW3I_JLblKyoK772fa5TBAiNycZaGm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"While it wasn\'t mind-blowing pizza, it was decent pizza. The price is right for what it is. We spent 20 bucks for our half and half pizza. It was something similar to pizza hut. Nice place though. They had an outside patio. And TVs inside so you can enjoy the game. They have tea on the menu but didn\'t have it on hand. That was a little let down but not a deal breaker.\",\"time\":1694921697,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Shane Adair\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116613222328296101004\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXv2zbBYz6DLpz9OgRWFrXITXbRJJwUAn7w8rH7OxslNC0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"We eat here every time we come to Tropic for two reasons, the food and it\'s located in my grandpa and dad\'s old store. But to the pizza, it\'s awesome! The service can be slow, but it\'s because they are always jam packed. It\'s clean and bright and oh so good.\",\"time\":1685326876,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"James Lambourne\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101170314961327651658\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVZu6Oeio2pujgECeyIkIOKtQ79wOM7cwyUmI3oIAxF4Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Pizzas here are huge, slightly expensive when ordering more than one, but tasty, the large pizza is enough to share - meat pizza was great, the veg pizza tasted overly sweet. Sat at a table quickly, and waiter wad accomodating to moving into a booth rather than a middle table. Service was a but slow initially, but it was busy. They also serve wine and beer.\",\"time\":1682132629,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"2030\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"1100\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-