108697551735944542899\\\">Bon F<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhwgSlJhXp1EFjS0NMZdyDsu1PPhni5nqrGfSEdKImb_rwzXdp7XKxq9IFK_uVfBkyhtWX_dQ8Yb_VafZxlXzFjX4AnpaaMZdgQ7d_Fldl0Ajvgnjklo_mGdCjnlcg9XM4ANPYnqNgzHy_DqiATdq9I7aB8W-2eU74ohwC1fplP_2Ty\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108697551735944542899\\\">Bon F<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgym55sdcAhULBfpESz-oA-Xx81xbdOYlJkd5cRZjph0xG4HGKLLBfP9dowrUhYoTXcwrTeVE5mtb8ZUciV8oTpYI3xRZt-8SlJEROLnfanSjefAe-Aef3PQWTlwvE8DmYezsejeO38Jv9-NbJX_kNQYbnIMKVjAeONCr9gwv5EwdML\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJDx09_ExpNYcRlVL6jaeHWsE\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"JRGJ+RR Tropic, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599JRGJ+RR\"},\"rating\":3.7,\"reference\":\"ChIJDx09_ExpNYcRlVL6jaeHWsE\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Paprika Meow\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111635606610599291591\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWHBYvEm-RB-CSx4G6yWWDnBa9FncUK_Y4qUD5Q7ZUqlw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Taste :4.1\\/5\\nEnvironment: 4.2\\/5\\nService\\uff1a4.3\\/5\\n\\nThe menu at the Lodge at Bryce Canyon Dining Room showcases a delightful fusion of flavors, featuring both classic and contemporary dishes. From savory steaks to fresh salads, each bite is a celebration of taste and quality ingredients.\\n\\nIt\'s worth noting that the prices at the Lodge at Bryce Canyon Dining Room are on the higher side, but you don\\u2019t have to drive far away to get the food !\",\"time\":1688959479,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Brett Lodwick\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105408699123553055968\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLupIpKj9PZl0DWIBo9bpyoVc5qTZ7pNzl34OUbGgn7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Service was ok, accommodated our large group quickly. Atmosphere was fine, a little dark, but very roomy. Food was just ok. I had the All American Burger; burger had no seasoning and only taste was the grilled taste. Bacon was super thin and crumbly. Cheese had no taste. Fries were either overcooked or stale, couldn\\u2019t really tell, but only half were edible.\\nWife had the Farfelle Pasta. It was ok, could\\u2019ve had a little more cheese and sauce was a little thin\\/runny.\\nDaughter had the kids chicken tenders. Tenders were bland, breading was a bit mushy. Same thing with her fries as mine.\\nHonestly was not worth the price for the quality of the food. Burger should\\u2019ve been more like $10-12. Pasta should\\u2019ve been more like $15-18 and kids tenders meal should\\u2019ve been that price but with a a drink like most other places.\",\"time\":1693793180,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Terry Mead\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115299947032397247964\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV1KsudO84nxWBPRPbkdqO24cKEEatrxNQSZrmw9cjRUT9b=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"12 months ago\",\"text\":\"Five stars all the way, what an elegant dining room. I was seated immediately, it was around 5:30 PM. Peggy was my server and she was just as friendly as could be. She right away brought me an ice cold bottle of Coors Light and even brought a frosted glass but I just drank it out of the bottle. I ordered the bacon cheeseburger and man was it delicious and so were the fries just as crispy as could be. Peggy did a great job and so did the Chef! Kudos all the way around!\",\"time\":1663873011,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jeff Morgan\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102009759401634378544\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUy9SIDHhD1xSO9OJxWS-L5ZJsamAVIMeHpM1k5mZZkKLsx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"It\'s a lodge. It\'s inside a National Park. How could it be any good? Right?\\nWrong! Wrong! Wrong! Quick, friendly service at reasonable prices.\\nAnd the cheesecake was some of the best we have ever sampled. Delectable.\\nAfterwards, a quick jaunt to the rim trail and another beautiful day at the park is complete.\",\"time\":1682433711,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Bon F\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108697551735944542899\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocISghPlfxVF4yGCYUgyVtbyc2ozu9tztIIsnmSgVfvYbw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"We came here on Thanksgiving, and the lodge offered the Thanksgiving dinner buffet for $25 per person until 7pm and breakfast buffet for $15 per person, which was highly appreciated. Although the food was just okay and the service was also just okay, we would still recommend visitors to dine in here given its convenience and affordable price points. (Follow me on IG \\u27a1\\ufe0f miss_dawang)\",\"time\":1675009743,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=13932597550935331477\",\"user_ratings_total\":74,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"Bryce Canyon National Park, The Lodge at Bryce Canyon, City\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.brycecanyonforever.com\\/dining\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:36','2023-09-19 05:55:36'),(12,'Buffet & steak room','googleplaces','ChIJa0cZpgFnNYcRUWTCU_NdyaY',18,NULL,8,0.20,NULL,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.673655,\"lng\":-112.1575574},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.67492038029149,\"lng\":-112.1559014197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.6722224197085,\"lng\":-112.1585993802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Buffet & steak room\",\"place_id\":\"ChIJa0cZpgFnNYcRUWTCU_NdyaY\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"MRFR+FX Bryce Canyon City, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599MRFR+FX\"},\"reference\":\"ChIJa0cZpgFnNYcRUWTCU_NdyaY\",\"scope\":\"GOOGLE\",\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"vicinity\":\"26 South Main Street, Bryce Canyon City\",\"details\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"26\",\"short_name\":\"26\",\"types\":[\"street_number\"]},{\"long_name\":\"South Main Street\",\"short_name\":\"S Main St\",\"types\":[\"route\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Bryce Canyon City\",\"short_name\":\"Bryce Canyon City\",\"types\":[\"locality\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Garfield County\",\"short_name\":\"Garfield County\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_2\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Utah\",\"short_name\":\"UT\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_1\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"United States\",\"short_name\":\"US\",\"types\":[\"country\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"84764\",\"short_name\":\"84764\",\"types\":[\"postal_code\"]}],\"adr_address\":\"<span class=\\\"street-address\\\">26 S Main St<\\/span>, <span class=\\\"locality\\\">Bryce Canyon City<\\/span>, <span class=\\\"region\\\">UT<\\/span> <span class=\\\"p