szUQc\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3000,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112325485672011286606\\\">Ingo Gutjahr<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhjxqajJBL6vlal7O3TFML39RNVicQnAYNwb_PGsQC-Wkb8RVlAGtzq6rvsbtfP4GoEqaK4SRSTvqLxANiSx8_5EXBbQTGJBDDtJinInPuzR6ktgS7pYkhw3M8acYvzrMWa-UGyI7PDy-ZgPSTNy2BzB_ub8z6HP4xeJ9XXcNeOhA37\",\"width\":4000},{\"height\":3000,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108734380983314664079\\\">Oleksandr Velykoivanenko<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zj-xLP5D94aWK-1gkd65MgpyiCnvHJ9NIB9humbjA94IDQus4-PrlY9fIsuikVDOndAb9BCqZq9Xq5d_iTXa2UofHWv1vq5mkobVjQp_URybTwEB8uR-o8Go-q7ddNI0crtciqOgIE6LHbOyEpiinmEUkjEHevnGz24Dj6abCGg_UQG\",\"width\":4000}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJg83r_g9vNYcRsa2Zl9-_J5c\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"JWF8+2V Tropic, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599JWF8+2V\"},\"rating\":4.2,\"reference\":\"ChIJg83r_g9vNYcRsa2Zl9-_J5c\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Matthijs\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106286977329055841774\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJ5wJOFLJRltL1jrn9GQEQ52KsGw8wIxJaUYU1_QcOQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"We drove here from Bryce Canyon because of the reviews and it didn\'t disappoint. Great hamburger and pasta for a reasonable price. When we left the live music was just getting started but I imagine it would be great to be here later in the evening to have some drinks and enjoy the atmosphere.\",\"time\":1693544019,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lindsay Brennan\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100336019146900261103\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJmqEQNb6hKPD4luvjdcip1sPgcmrmd9j4Z5iFx7JJU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"We had a great meal at Showdowns after a full day of hiking in Bryce Canyon. They have a rustic vibe with great service! They serve you free popcorn when you sit down. The food was great, I had the surf and turf (pictured) and my husband got the brisket and we both enjoyed. The drink selection was great too. We found the prices to be reasonable for a big meal and 2 drinks each. Live music was awesome and the perfect volume. Would definitely recommend Showdowns and hope to return ourselves sometime soon!\",\"time\":1680890357,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"The Foodie Architect\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101720553180737354833\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU-G6WiVe_428AwyfSxjr2EBrMF0bD0XRUrvfAaV1fYJg0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"A happy place in a quiet town. Good food and live music. The outdoor space is so pleasant that makes it super relaxing. The cowboy theme wins my kids hearts.\",\"time\":1688173953,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jess Flower\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109892917018146757394\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXeXcTZpf8grHGmsLdyqxf1AqUHDdCH41rEbQyEerwU1ak=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"We were staying in the village in our drive through and decided to have dinner. Wait was long and you get a buzzer to let you know when your table is ready. But there is a fire outside to sit by until you are called. When seated we got popcorn in the table complimentary which was fun! Very fun western old time vibe and decor. The food is good homestyle food and there was live music on. Was reasonably priced for a smaller town and attached to a RV park. Would recommend!\",\"time\":1681608417,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Navid\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104558963095096460666\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXHMywXfAYCkiIjlfw6oH69-fD3guUK3Pnks7BAyOS7-8oz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Super friendly place, amazing live music. Unfortunately the food was super basic and just not were it should be. The burger was actually extremely well cooked but the Jack\\u2019d up sauce was a huge no for us and the campfire trout was just disappointing. The music really saved the day here\",\"time\":1681447087,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=10891885190860877233\",\"user_ratings_total\":456,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"80 South Main Street, Tropic\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/showdownsrestaurant.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:37','2023-09-19 05:55:37'),(14,'Stage Stop Station','googleplaces','ChIJx15S8wFvNYcRL3m-zDtTKAo',20,NULL,8,0.20,0,NULL,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.6235698,\"lng\":-112.0821066},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.6250527802915,\"lng\":-112.0808101697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.62235481970851,\"lng\":-112.0835081302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/shopping-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#4B96F3\",\"icon_mask_base