le trip.\",\"time\":1625280973,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Ernest Kyed\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110766205735632991661\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV79uu5N9v0IIDv-HVj6xnKJouKKnPS8Z7TEZetm4GScQI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"So much more than a gas station.  Large convenience store with a small eatery and lots of touristy trinkets and stuff!  Clean and large with a big lot to maneuver an RV.\",\"time\":1651260358,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jeff Mu\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102769518238607618777\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocI3TV-uBl0WeMXSxJM6gKq19VWyy3jMf-bHtLWfOYGVaUE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"Very clean store, super friendly staff, AWESOME and CHEAP food!!! Nothing on the menu goes beyond $10 and your won\'t believe how much you get and the taste!\",\"time\":1655430387,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lisa Chynoweth\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114568358725756048540\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU90q2Pd2641XmQhERqzhwm5MnnQBIHb3ut9ATWPfreiRQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 years ago\",\"text\":\"Great place to have lunch. Lots of options for snacks. Clean environment. Easy to get in and out of the pumps to fill your vehicle. Highly recommend.\",\"time\":1571937548,\"translated\":false}],\"types\":[\"convenience_store\",\"gas_station\",\"store\",\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\