n6RNc23aWjl4dvDjaJJMaS82LtY_ixTwRn96d\",\"width\":1920}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJNT1CxwlvNYcR1dT21rfcRt8\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"JWG9+85 Tropic, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599JWG9+85\"},\"rating\":4.1,\"reference\":\"ChIJNT1CxwlvNYcR1dT21rfcRt8\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Erin Primm\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117629126337298081110\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjX8zOHAsHuRls5HSfzuWCRbSoNyGa2oWnCACUY761rTNms=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Quick and friendly service! Quesadilla was a generous size and salsas and pico were spicy and flavorful\",\"time\":1688171101,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Brian Won\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103969833385419012000\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUcQTQme1S6jmORLN_kHZTL92y56NBGOdVz1lvllXzPaCU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 years ago\",\"text\":\"It\'s edible. Not very good, but edible. Tacos are too big for street tacos, too small to be an Americanized abomination. Al pastor is also not spit grilled, which means I think it\'s really adobada? That said they try hard, and that\'s worthy of credit.\",\"time\":1598939376,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Nicholas r\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110560220289002573053\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVs2KOPfNAamlpHsg197UJT0OFad_9-ja-SJQmS-_SeWss=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"Guy running the truck was super nice and let\\u2019s get real finding a taco truck in the middle of no where is pretty awesome. I feel like the food was a good value for the price. This is comparing it to other taco places in Utah. Chill environment and nothing like some tacos after a day of hiking.\",\"time\":1601777848,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Carla Duval\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110518917226399045586\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXuSgsyRXwqJtMdd3G90Hi0c4E4zQbguDIX0W0xom3VqhI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"This taco truck really hit the spot after a tough day of hiking. Delicious burritos perfect for refueling. No frills and lovely staff. Highly recommend!\",\"time\":1620447980,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sam Gamble\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111277039338652963559\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVcsGRiLzKoKVUyrGGDcwRBw4TUlPgEi02U_TbLvIn6GQk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"The carne asada burrito and quesadilla were both really solid. We were pretty impressed with the taste and quality. The taco truck really saved us from a dinner of convenience store snacks.\",\"time\":1603597869,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=16088789400971302101\",\"user_ratings_total\":8,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"Tropic\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:37','2023-09-19 05:55:37'),(16,'i.d.k. barbecue','googleplaces','ChIJ_-MNB4VtNYcRVV98R9Zh8lo',22,'Simple counter serve restaurant with on-site parking serving BBQ dishes to e