risket, coleslaw, and mac & cheese my husband had the loaded baked potato with sweet shredded pork. The owners started with a food truck which is why they are able to serve it so fast. The restaurant has several tables with two inside old truck beds. They also have lots of picnic tables outside. If you want to support local business and have a great meal, this is your spot.\",\"time\":1687268365,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sam Wong\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117867159097661584407\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVDHQdxfZNOQdE-E1eL6CAZktoSSuP8XU898cZHnhbB1_yu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"Little town Great food.\\nWe tried the brisket amd burnt ends.\\nwow. so juicy and moist and flavorful.\\none of the best I\'ve had in a long long time\\nRecommend to come try it.\\nPortion is on the smaller side but at that price, get 2 coz it\'s dang good! !!!\\nDon\'t say I didn\'t tell you so.\\nDon\'t miss out!\",\"time\":1694573789,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"lati mom\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115330840808643325889\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIAbIFYRZCt2fhrM-3HGQgdbN_o4B7MWE5UwbUUM0wL=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"While camping at Bryce we drove over for a nice warm meal. We loved it! The meat is tender and flavorful. The service was perfect. The dining area is clean & the staff were very helpful. We had the 1 meat plate, the sweet pork sandwich & the Mac n cheese. We loved everything we chose. The BBQ sauces are great too! Our favorite was the sweet pork sandwich with coleslaw & spicy BBQ sauce. Perfect place in a charming small town!\",\"time\":1686776486,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Alison Terrana\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115276699165685980655\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVk-O2A85cWXwlSpyXtMSYhEjboPF6R4bIQdr8LAeG8CWA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"I would drive back here from PA to grab one of these brisket sandwiches. Holy cow, very very good. Mac and cheese is on point, cole slaw is good, baked beans are perfect. Yes, come here. Not far from Bryce Canyon.\",\"time\":1691718901,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Natalie Riddle\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109198713168122144216\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKSHVsAgt_ADkp3srEkGnnV1bOeMcf8ffMvjFTdDBrt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Probably the BEST BBQ I\\u2019ve ever tasted!! Lots of fun options. Spice it up with a unique combination or keep it original. The service was fantastic. Very warming small town feel (which is a small town. Small business!) Wish we didn\\u2019t live so far away so we could eat there on the regular!\",\"time\":1693683653,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=6553407980727721813\",\"user_ratings_total\":1237,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"161 North Main Street, Tropic\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.idkbarbecue.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:37','2023-09-19 05:55:37'),(17