61\\\">Chet<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgFbl4ykKbp4kUELsBoidHISe6SoGTn4O-5mBGFzuy9GOitaa7CkdpMM4LAgVpHG-xpFBTUxbVqSNom2F0_qXenVsguH6vRK9qeuJMU0L8WUT_FMG7zmnnr6QVLea4lLBX1kyj3y5aSkIuqQnOp8TBCrSQagl7e7Zs9nQtZsno_e1E4\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116793099273067578926\\\">T King<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zirKLCVaNlagtE7hxtx0AsvtBMLJ6ktYTR1G53tzkd0G1-scqBeT8P4KGvf6Qbd8cx_sZZLYY1uGgV9S5HCw-lELDoYqkA-jr4hsYE36GmaCJzsJXmg_8RZvvn3i9PrGXXSzGlv3mx4WCsJKl1iaVveS7mgVbScQzApg6SFMe2qfrqH\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115469509766697585513\\\">Aditya Jayadas<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhqjfxJlKdjVtms-WIMgiqRPd_shf3fOHU8gSXooyo67hdu-CoPWv6IuVMg1mvNEeKiL9LqsP5QMwxSzKjOtFT3QifUEdrWea3Y2U5s7hu_XlZnCaVhsSb3uLnTIzxnUnrOxMIr-wpiiKXN_RhIz4WQ6zJ0pgXlcoWBxfIt7Rou1ntT\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101193278865099937049\\\">Eric<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zj0ziIbCgAjafZgM6A4f4zuTf4FldJtR_D2gOnWV5ZnS9XwX-unPwuA9ImQ9OXqyW0Hp9mrxTzt8i4esfgYsIVqHjwNgitPKHBs1yV-dbXDi9P62Cq3vcka-GdUjdLpxJ_SdKAze7S38dCx8hrTy7kpUZ1mxBvnBh1DcHcawox7HM0E\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ____pkJuNYcRnfL56pLFgv8\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"JWG9+F4 Tropic, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599JWG9+F4\"},\"rating\":4,\"reference\":\"ChIJ____pkJuNYcRnfL56pLFgv8\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Luisa Spizzotin\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117616780073023547609\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWSI-Nq_Bakisc8rtA98Db9utLdCu5ooPDuWtrAeJrHGmv5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"We had a good time here. We didn\'t wait long for a table or even dinner. Very close to our cabin and close to the small Tropic shopping area. Cozy atmosphere, good food, and adequate portions. Had ribs, steak, and hamburger. Would recommend it.\",\"time\":1693412650,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Geo Dude\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110901127473743993673\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUsBbu8Fx4C1txweq-vF52NjXB7d202QfdbRb_iRu-qQIg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"The main downside about this place is the price. It was $12 for two standard pancakes that came with nothing else.\\nIf you add a side of eggs, it\\u2019s an additional $4.\\nAside from the price though, the food was decent. Pancakes were great. Coffee was fresh.\\nThe waiters were attentive and provided great service.\",\"time\":1686435757,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Samaya\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110287610563274636882\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW69ybjU23A3uByOtaz3K1rdTv7LoVKCREv3ngCqTEAHXd8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"We really enjoyed this restaurant, stopped in for breakfast while in the area.  I laughed at another reviewer who complained about pricing.  We spent quite a bit of time in the general area of southern Utah and northern Arizona and found this place to be completely in line with what we paid elsewhere in the area.   Further, the wait staff was friendly and our waiter, Russel was very attentive.  I loved their stuffed strawberry french toast.  Would definitely return when back in that area.\",\"time\":1683513974,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Danelle\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108082599982187360130\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWEHSt1CUOiIVSzSHTdKRDFB3CahikzIYhPmbIN5n1cxw9W=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"The mushroom Gorgonzola appetizer is amazing!  They serve warm bread and butter when you are seated.  They do offer beer and wine.  We were there on a Sunday evening and had to wait 5 to 10 minutes to be seated.  After a delay our flank steak was done perfectly and was tender.  I mixed the mushroom appetizer with it and it just doesn\'t get much better.  Yum.  My husband has the chicken fried steak.  They gravy was excellent and steak crust was crunchy and the steak was tender.  Well done.  Thanks Westin.\",\"time\":1694397546,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"clabsauce Reviews\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112261434719457970397\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUIcx0PF0YCgsojwthMQhHO7rRHsrg4ivPkPVAcFOrWVg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Excellent joint. Food was great (good classic BLT, they also heaped on tons of fries which weren\'t the best but good enough), our waiter Renee was quick, competent, and polite, and although the cowboy theme may not be to everyone\'s liking, the venue was clean and looked nice. Strongly recommended for the experience.\",\"time\":1686513985,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=18411495461442155165\",\"user_ratings_total\":398,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"141 North Main Street, Tropic\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/rustlersrestaurant.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:38','2023-09-19 05:55:38'),(18,'Cowboy Ranch House Bar & Restaurant','googleplaces','ChIJb_AnPw1mNYcR4pVGMYpcenM',24,'Steaks, Mexican dishes & craft beer served in a Western-themed restaurant at a simple hotel.',15,0.20,0,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.6918076,\"lng\":-112.1542245},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.69310163029149,\"lng\":-112.1528082697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.69040366970849,\"lng\":-112.1555062302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/bar-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/bar_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Cowboy Ranch House Bar & Restaurant\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":1478,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108213522492432800480\\\">Cowboy Ranch House Bar &amp; Restaurant<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zh8O2P1H5QrY5706uN01L6eCdaGhzr2LBgpyFpWPdFoqG2fBxyhDFkxMlSTjSvWorMP2U7zMh56auJZQ5eophA39OHbSU4_I7v4nS9xfJZKMfa96ZkQN4sQ19EgfZ8IM9IyTh5x_hSXywt1eSrbGpKJsa-yQy7vJIcelvXJR2PTL2Ba\",\"width\":2048}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJb_AnPw1mNYcR4pVGMYpcenM\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"MRRW+P8 Bryce Canyon City, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599MRRW+P8\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":3.8,\"reference\":\"ChIJb_AnPw1mNYcR4pVGMYpcenM\",\"scope\":\"GOOGLE\",\"types\":[\"bar\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"user_ratings_total\":863,\"vicinity\":\"13500 E, Utah 12, Bryce Canyon City\",\"details\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"Utah 12\",\"short_name\":\"UT-12\",\"types\":[\"route\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Bryce Canyon City\",\"