aps\\/contrib\\/114470541883880668421\\\">Maxence BUTTON<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgWyx1u6hVeVaz083uXgoVT9cKy_7FNArzoIL_2og3rKpFnbSKmNh5qDPRqAvGo_71odqZNVpKZgynPg6ASFjLAHfnbZVctTx5bb3DayPk68j1gjvYkg04fHx28blV0FdGaICzzGrpBPoWeMSizMhl72WKA7-pDTIDaS_vlq41hpIjT\",\"width\":4000}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJbwOpZ79nNYcRVwRe09OOFyw\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"MRX8+34 Bryce Canyon City, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599MRX8+34\"},\"rating\":4.1,\"reference\":\"ChIJbwOpZ79nNYcRVwRe09OOFyw\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Nik Poulimenos\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105744337124116772382\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVhv5QL9KuVWEJkaue1k8zzXiqdfkUQ1ciamANvLXX82Cs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Our visit to Arriba Mexican Restaurant was nothing short of exceptional! The Carne Asada burrito I ordered was delicious, packed with authentic flavors that transported me straight to Mexico. The real standout, however, was our waitress, Rose. Her attentiveness and warm demeanor elevated the whole experience.\\n\\nThe restaurant also boasts an incredible view of Bryce Canyon\'s awe-inspiring landscape. Combined with its inviting and authentic atmosphere, dining at Arriba feels like a mini-vacation in itself.\\n\\nHighly recommend for anyone visiting Bryce Canyon! Five stars all around.\",\"time\":1693353474,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mike O\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114498242458671994636\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUsOcEDieyGKWVk-wCxUYdZyzc6BUFj0aovK2O1iSDHC5Eu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Found this gem after a day exploring the local parks. Got to our hotel and decided it was a night for Mexican.  Arrived to an almost empty restaurant and were seated promptly. Shortly after, several large parties arrived, enough to fill the place.  But the staff adjusted and service (at least for us) wasn\'t really impacted.\\n\\nOrdered the Chicken Burrito, adding chorizo (because I love chorizo) and it was excellent. They also have great selection of homemade salsas to go with complementary tortillas.\\n\\nPricing was very fair. 4 of us are full for less than $70. Can\'t do that very often anymore.\",\"time\":1691637574,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mel anie\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105120419714212330752\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW3bdX18cT3ca7CK53AELZ06kU1KrCuIO4PNszK27RNjfgP=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"It was only OK if you\\u2019re in need of a sit down meal. Dining options are limited in the area. The restaurant has a weird layout and it seems to be new, maybe they\\u2019re still trying to figure it out. Food was okay, about $15\\/plate. I\\u2019m not sure about \\u201cauthentic.\\u201d Beans and rice were dry. Salsa was warm, which worried me because isn\\u2019t it usually cold, for food safety?\\n\\nThe hostess was definitely off (blonde Hispanic woman). She spent most of the time in the single bathroom. And then she was eating while at the stand. And also had her makeup with her? Overall, weird vibes here. OK food.\",\"time\":1689193801,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"someguy6\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100983539773950014770\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVE9ZybsKwhkuUT9uf9hklcT0IB1Iwf2cEEWx1tgC9K070=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Nice Mexican restaurant with good food, just seemed a little short staffed. I got the street tacos, and as you can see they were pretty good\",\"time\":1691636711,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Brad Simmons\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115326054524229885111\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVBBBCcfai-n91-hAufGE8aO_HkALUN0LRUfi8QcJzOcIo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Fantastic authentic Mexican food! A newer establishment that is finding its groove with the flow and communication. Their service was great.\",\"time\":1685408133,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=3177165102568571991\",\"user_ratings_total\":240,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"1152 Utah 12, Bryce Canyon City\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:38','2023-09-19 05:55:38'),(20,'Canyon Coffee House','googleplaces','ChIJM0ieZbUQM4cR5aCbSNT2Yk4',26,'Quick stop for grabbing organic, shade-grown coffee drinks, pastries & fruit in a resort lodge.',8,0.20,NULL,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.0568885,\"lng\":-112.1406447},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.0581425302915,\"lng\":-112.1394415697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.0554445697085,\"lng\":-112.1421395302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/cafe-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/cafe_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Canyon Coffee House\",\"openi