vGIC8HipzckRmE2bNEIKfQ3lYTGX-JZJJWiV6em5IqzdqBopvm8KsF2a0i\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105118946461245463355\\\">T. Higuchi<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhay82M-RzCiLgzbRUo_pO1Zv_R_-faFuZk0H-vWgGU3Uv5u5OwcpsYGcGBJ09AZQAXgPGocucswYjeLv-RA8I9fxTg8XUCa-qa8N0E6PfpfbQ1WO4EvhhClnDfCnZ-3Hc481eh6IBY2i4HEWLqxRToh_cPnFl8bLFqbpHP9DZTik0h\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":1944,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100664674527623398618\\\">Emiliano Dami\\u00e1n Freiberg Kohan (Pollo Freiberg)<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjnbN1ixpH5pj55Z_8nJUOv_AJXd7mH-0bn7htgLmdawqhMFd6WxUWUWIoZehQqbYvgkftE0D-0Pto3PaNPyZ6zD1y8sfeEzBf2hUn-A3Rp5d8lj6bQP1xzoRnhHwxeBcACX87MplOHaqnNRvTzTWr-wyTqk1MUMsdSIYapcgef_0c4\",\"width\":2592}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJM0ieZbUQM4cR5aCbSNT2Yk4\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"3V45+QP Grand Canyon Village, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85893V45+QP\"},\"rating\":3.7,\"reference\":\"ChIJM0ieZbUQM4cR5aCbSNT2Yk4\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Stephen Smith\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118035232399696359666\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXYwdNVcfKxpimprPQD1XnBmfO6oCiJTybngv8C1gMGFkQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"Due to COVID-19 they are serving everything out of a place called the fountain. They have snacks such as ice cream, chips and root beer floats. They also serve sandwiches and hotdogs. You can\\u2019t go wrong with dryers ice cream.\",\"time\":1603042769,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"18 Summers\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100509638741713410947\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVs4hpbhvBZqlg1vkLlb-zlWnvslg_rJGiCZx5hZn75o-E=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"The lady taking the orders was nice. But the food and drinks were terrible. 7:15 in the morning ready to watch the sunrise over the canyon. I have a cinnamon roll and a \\u201cmocha\\u201c. Out of the three the only thing to enjoy was the sunrise.\\n\\nThe cinnamon roll which is labeled \\u201cfresh baked\\u201d had just been delivered from the kitchen. It was Very dry had had very little flavor. The mocha which cost $5 tasted like a mix between packaged hot cocoa and brewed coffee blanketed in canned whipped topping and sprinkled with chocolate chips.\\n\\nI hate to waste money but I didn\\u2019t finish either one. They were that disgusting.\\n\\nI guess if I return it only be to get a bottled or prepackaged item.\",\"time\":1614695773,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"My Two Cents\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108575102048289105112\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLqu9UCyICGxF5TMrWHJ1G_NeWcHuzGxipDIcyPJpdQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"Little museum. Historically beautiful and a great balance of male and female historical figures portrayed. Loved it!\",\"time\":1626802452,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jason Rolland\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103231211845489875116\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJbO5iTo2hQ6A8NYH7-Iiobh-Gi91LaV6FW6w-Fhx9v=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"ZERO STARS!! We paid 45 bucks for 3 box lunches that included really dry and stale PB&J sandwiches, 2 hot chocolates, 1 cider and a pretzel w cheese. It was all awful (drinks were fine) and the employee (an overweight angry male) was incredibly rude and unprofessional. He seemed to hate his job and wasn\'t happy with our larger order.  We honestly should have left when he was being so rude, but the kids were hungry and needed to eat. I would skip this place and find a better place to grab a snack, our experience was just awful!\",\"time\":1608261882,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"James Dankert\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102000441922047924407\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocL0isZawHXIrPFB0pV4sdtVhb52AoCs7aZYi9ffa-O-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"Service was terrible. They got a whole string of orders wrong (forgetting to charge for things and needing to do extra transactions, not giving people things they did pay for, etc). They gave my wife an expired yogurt. They were overall rude, condescending, and patronizing to the guests. And to top it all off, the coffee was mediocre.\",\"time\":1601560145,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"cafe\",\"store\",\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=5648348274287681765\",\"user_ratings_total\":69,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"9 Village Loop Drive, Grand Canyon Village\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.grandcanyonlodges.com\\/dining\\/bright-angel-restaurant\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:39','2023-09-19 05:55:40'),(21,'Canyon Star Steakhouse & Saloon','googleplaces','ChIJzxHU8-4bM4cR1JI38Am_zp4',27,'Roomy eatery/sports bar inside the Western-style Grand Hotel cooking up steaks & Southern fare.',15,0.20,0,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"ge