=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114745517509848944633\\\">Dan Locking<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjPDuJ6sZguamqHU61Z3o3xtYaZDxjzog90lxstMET1iEevM4lhpslnK_tQaX-YRghopC6slMylw0meN81hevcyWHb8q5GoeUujCyCnnBdJ9_99h4_0vePwGm9T5NFs9hAL6jPZOXeNqrBh9uzsJAR5eCBOgoEAAc_BGiXXh32VdoYS\",\"width\":4080},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111733106730153940272\\\">Angie Vowels<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zj2FAJE5ZsMOHKvs78E3M8HHSudz58EV_rC1EszQfCo7Cg_7dRH-U20CUTl_9RVtel1AQHTqeRbqCTUPNbKw8IAeRPu-ySa1gfCF5LwWWbJYY8NpVqP11XSySpHrTP9H4W4szT-B3MosNum9166jr7UXxGi-b2WdLVAkK2hFxIHxzCR\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104030710305454113118\\\">Cindy L<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjg5wuVN-zx1CNNYv5aB3nj9UYI-nqeDB3onKobvmXDmP_b8il5gU73pVNraNjlCpARkcYJ1R1mg51mzNxw9m1VhHdC-naegt176KbCLWkU9zjJSG6eoX2XxabTxcbnLDyTJtXd0swmCZgZ2W9ReXy740TcPVxEMxS15VGqMrUSsrA7\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104030710305454113118\\\">Cindy L<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zh6KBnK2nyqUn5har_2xRzg5JI1PaMvHR7g6hcC4WuQ99ndrvNlEV2xxXQRY6Z1Hx4C87gqdEH4yBTy3L58DvQBo5zvoMSL1x_GHVC-bbUM4X3leBoAqO_hhhgZ_aC2SgiCkat105UbpfFiC5OgrcjGLAMQVUG2C-0c0eyKySkOlOba\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJzxHU8-4bM4cR1JI38Am_zp4\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"XVCF+68 Grand Canyon Village, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8579XVCF+68\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":3.2,\"reference\":\"ChIJzxHU8-4bM4cR1JI38Am_zp4\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Ismael \\u201cMay1to\\u201d Cortez\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115978986146669382224\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWe96C3qvXPOSlhO9HIAU0Db07rTok43NGOP1-jqMvVS06K=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"The best breakfast I\\u2019ve had in a really long time. The breakfast buffet is amazing everything was good and fresh. Build your own breakfast for a fair price. The restaurant was super clean and the staff was amazing. I recommend everyone who is around the Grand Canyon to come and try this incredible breakfast. I will definitely be back again thanks for the experience.\",\"time\":1690913087,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Cindy L\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104030710305454113118\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV3WIE5x-7KbrwLh3jJW5ZwJ9_XcJB0GQm_Rhicp-R5g4c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Canyon Star.\\nAaron, a bar back with black hair (I forget her name, she was awesome!)and Kyla what is fabulous crew.  Aaron is one of the best funniest bartenders that we have met on our trip. He was amazing and mixing our cocktails as well. We love the place, love the atmosphere, it was so clean and had a great vibe. The saloon was attached to the restaurant, and the food that we saw come out of the kitchen looked fabulous.\\nI WOULD RECOMMEND\",\"time\":1690086379,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kevin Perron\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115335416308458274594\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU1xVAAKFxe2brYiwXcydfzLOr6tyGo4-Uaw_I9jPnW724=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Literally 1 of the best steaks I jave ever eaten. The Staff were polite, intellectual, intelligent and a pleasure to have met. The drinks were very very good and we will always go here when we visit.\",\"time\":1694389471,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"L S\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111237841947380337726\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWy_QD2ZE65TeMglRbfn-CqHehRi5-wuj2qcInoF8Cj2RWG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"10 months ago\",\"text\":\"Excellent service. Our waitress was so pleasant and helpful. She made the meal more enjoyable.\\n\\nStarted with the wedding soup and it was very tasty. Try the artichoke dip as a share item. It was awesome!!\\n\\nSplit the sirloin steak with mashed potatoes and carrots. The food was good. I would order the steak again.\\n\\nFinished with a chocolate cheesecake. It was rich and delicious!\",\"time\":1667115623,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"John Lynch\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114844370032175101148\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU1yHnU_8YB5ZIE06KYYB8v63-TWjEMq7WvYwk3clEUm-I=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"I had the12oz  rib eye and my wife had salad with 4 oz filet filet which were delicious. Server was excellent. Good decor. However, maybe a little overpriced, probably because of location.\",\"time\":1679063373,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=11443293752600793812\",\"user_ratings_total\":505,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"149 Arizona 64, Grand Canyon Village\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.grandcanyongrandhotel.com\\/grand-canyon-dining\\/\",\"wh