FF+44\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":3.9,\"reference\":\"ChIJV77wu38QM4cR1fcd19q8S-8\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Marisa Spagnoli\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100546694634846621745\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLIDHgPyLsOgzFCoi2toJR6dBb_Ni-EUQU_ynuwZtA2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"We were greeted warmly at this beautifully decorated, large and clean restaurant.  Our server Lupe\\u2019 was prompt with the fresh chips and delicious homemade salsa. Lupe\\u2019 was also knowledgeable, sweet and able to answer our questions precisely and quickly.  They have an extensive tequila menu (range $7-$38) and cocktail selection. One of us had a Cadillac Margarita and one of us had a double shot of the $7 tequila. Both were perfect.  The food was super tasty!  We had the Chicken Mole\\u2019 and the Chicken Taco Salad. Both were fresh, delicious, and on-point.  The portions make this place a great value and the prices are fair.  On top of it all, we were treated like guests, not tourists.\",\"time\":1693431844,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Benjamin Thomas\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102778889400245781141\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWFaikgtaGCIQDjyzTG_kBFiY8C8clMevLio_RZJDHIJ2U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Ok. What a gem. Love the decor and ambiance and all the authentic articles you can buy. The seating and tables - all of it was so good. For here on a Wednesday evening for dinner with 9 people and had no problem getting seated and served quickly. I got the Combination platter 2 with pork tamale, beef Chile Colorado enchilada, and chicken enchilada. The Cole Colorado was delicious. No one had complaints about their food - including the kids, and nothing was left behind.\\n\\nThe service was incredible and friendly as well. Definitely worth visiting if you\'re en route to the Grand Canyon.\",\"time\":1686238811,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Noa A\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111491988887659636384\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW2qc1bKxgF20xsAMxpbNbFgJwEQnSr6ZDiB4RXReaiP-s=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Starting with the positive things. The food is really good. I loved the chips they give you as a starter. It\'s real Mexican food but it\'s not exaggerated spicy. However the portions, as always, are huge.\\nThe positive point about the service is that they all speak Spanish and as a Spanish person in vacation in the us it\'s nice. On the other hand the service is very slow and the waiters are not very attentive. It took them a long time to bring in the food and forgot some orders.\\nThe place is decorated in a Mexican way but I found it a bit too much.\\nLastly, i appreciated also that they have electric plugs to charge your devices at every table.\",\"time\":1691384507,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Ismael \\u201cMay1to\\u201d Cortez\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115978986146669382224\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWe96C3qvXPOSlhO9HIAU0Db07rTok43NGOP1-jqMvVS06K=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Service was amazing food was good but not great. The rice was a little to dry that\\u2019s my only complaint. The drinks were prefect a little pricey but good. They do have a bar inside and plenty of parking. I would recommend everyone to try it out maybe the rice just had a bad day when I was there.\",\"time\":1690993769,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Misty LeAnn\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106039158050850492618\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXP3eEwHEGSo90DKqlRFeMbTXywlklNdcJRgB5KnHP91w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"We ate here twice. Normal wait time, all the staff was nice and very quick; always refilling drinks and chips. Food was good (8.5\\/10), and chips and salsa were AMAZING! You can tell the salsa is homemade. Pricing normal, best place to eat in the area. Open until 10 pm.\",\"time\":1683910856,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=17243083246416033749\",\"user_ratings_total\":4486,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"352 Arizona 64, Grand Canyon Village\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.plazabonita.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:39','2023-09-19 05:55:39'),(23,'We Cook Pizza and Pasta','googleplaces','ChIJJ8dV3fkbM4cRCXZjEbjCVaM',29,'Diners sit at picnic tables while sampling this basic eatery\'s Italian standards & salad bar.',15,0.20,0,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":35.9759999,\"lng\":-112.1244386},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":35.97735238029149,\"lng\":-112.1232282697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":35.9746544197085,\"lng\":-112.1259262302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\"