sE8aMutihTSoXOk8HhCX_YnjljKCFXplR77HfrRDPQ\",\"width\":2560}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJw43zg70QM4cRpEHc56nZeJw\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"3V3J+M3 Grand Canyon Village, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85893V3J+M3\"},\"rating\":3.1,\"reference\":\"ChIJw43zg70QM4cRpEHc56nZeJw\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"David Cho\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109313146400701703936\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIW1XO5VNP8eyVc9KA_ZitKA72yHy7VY45O6L0WQaOX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Food was surprisingly delicious. Especially the brisket. The place gets a little crazy and disorganized, but mostly from the patrons trying to rush through. Was crazy busy, but pretty efficient if you stay in line. People trying to hold a table and rush through the lines is what caused the confusion.\\n\\nProcess: 3 stars. place your order then get in cafeteria style line for main entrees and drinks. Then the salad bar and drink lines. Salad bar needed to get refreshed, but otherwise decent. Basic, but decent. Pet\'s were only allowed on one side of the dining hall. Wasn\'t clear until someone told us and wasn\'t very nice about it. At least they do have a section for pets. Would be nice if they had signs or were more friendly about it.\\n\\nFood. 4.5 stars. Brisket, veggies, and pozole were all very tasty. Salad bar was basic, but fresh. Soda fountain had many options, which was nice.\\n\\nService: 4 stars. Some really nice people, especially at the food service line. Person who kicked us out of line because of our dog, not so much.\\n\\nGiven the options are limited in the park, it\'s nice to have a decent option.\\n\\nPro tip: only microwave on the property is in the dining hall. If you need to reheat some leftover or like us, our dog food, come to the dining hall.\",\"time\":1679768173,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tree B\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105226403062921227098\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKEk25xuD7jvex1mRzBCe674BjcTGwufVreiaa5YtVV=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"When we travel back through here we\'re going to eat here again! The waitress was excellent! The food was delicious! The wait time for the meal was rather quick. I recommend this place!\",\"time\":1692283965,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Stephan Brus\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109887739951321430221\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUhdxi-vj4R03h_hFnRDVINyPmi1NVegevAKiqdB42pvi_1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Avoid this place!!! A tasteless cheap prefab pizza with minimal toppings and not much bigger than my hand - for 17 usd!! What a scam! They exploit the fact that most people\\/customers won\'t return here because they are passing through Grand Canyon Village. Ordering proces was weird and the cashier dude was very annoying. It\'s sad that they have to make their money like this, by ripping off tourists. \\ud83d\\udc4e\\ud83c\\udffb\\ud83d\\udc4e\\ud83c\\udffb\",\"time\":1688798038,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"S Martinez\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102063977285101741295\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVwCHoYF8CGe-DawZN5qezS00x5JvJ8R65ntQnbEPWtz9Y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Overpriced, food served cafeteria style, you pick food item they place it in your plastic container. I was clearly told only 1 meat by the first guy who went on to inform the server,\\\"Only 1 meat.\\\" I chose the chicken which was overcooked, extremely hard, no flavor, and tasted like it was cooked in the microwave. I then picked green beans that were hard to chew! The desert was store bought sliced by weight and served! Really bad service. Just eat and hurry up and leave! Also no order in line as i asked questions about the food, a bus of seniors arrived with their diner card passes. For being elderly they were inpatient and rude. They looked at me, and the first elderly lady smirked and said we have diner pass cards and stated they dont need to wait in line. Sad no patience, so about 12 plus elders from a chartered bus just went around me. Needless to say, I did not return!!\",\"time\":1694242598,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"A H\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116009516368665042633\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLp-tEXZL8QUjj-JCvEJNvqiWixkgyb_6I8936dKE6C=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"It\'s a decent place to grab a bite during the day. We stopped by for dinner before we were out again to see the stars. There\'s a spacious eating area. We got a large pizza with one topping (they charge extra for each topping option, unless you\'re getting regular cheese pizza). Super friendly staff!\",\"time\":1677273960,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=11275000990884708772\",\"user_ratings_total\":167,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"11 Yavapai Lodge Road, Grand Canyon Village\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.visitgrandcanyon.com\\/dining-and-shoppi