2,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114719452590974727073\\\">Matteo Saraconi<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziYfJRpeDggPcFkQWGvh4q-EFEwxvFU4ydKvc66rxPOXi1KEUFQtOf66xehML2HY8DDd7hE8uPYGwCE2Cy5spL6eOHptfiAKEi5pWbW5xcd7WcUWAhoRBCURzt6xmMq0HwbAFsiNj4nqacKWCuob6pwRRU6PmXH1-EhEVAtC8gI6_Ay\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":1920,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112044449451870342667\\\">James B<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgAZuXqV1jd0mhWnM_gQwtq9hA93zY79NExJuICgOfyzD9qd_vsUjmOF0cMp1kVhVWS-szssL1RlMTJzur9c9pI0YEym4rJsd978bUNbM6k1SEMXRzAJyva6Uzoue6QSsTPt3FTDPLCZQ6TyCzQOYDXREklbnITMlxNq3sJipayiXoY\",\"width\":1080}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJjyjPDOkbM4cR1aGJn_IYEfI\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"XVFF+P8 Tusayan, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8579XVFF+P8\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3,\"reference\":\"ChIJjyjPDOkbM4cR1aGJn_IYEfI\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Dr. Mohammad Shamsuddoha\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117352289297743537255\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXT_XAbtJiScJ-e9xKpep_d78OPHKTZpTNd7HLgUWgmHx4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"I normally do not take pizza huts pizzas because the dominoes is making much better. Pizza Hut is pricey as well compare to the Domino\\u2019s Pizza. This place is very expensive. One medium pizzas cost $20 plus tax plus tips and it\\u2019s  too much.\\n\\nSo you do not have any choice whenever you find no options around you so you\\u2019ll have to take it down to whatever the prices and time it will need. so we will have a helicopter tour for 45 minutes later. they made pizza for us and it takes 45 minutes, which  time consuming. But they made a good pizzas because we are hungry, so I should not say everything bad.\",\"time\":1679489850,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"James B\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112044449451870342667\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUb6ggZfsKyts31v_eI5js9-GTVWzXeJwwV9TYLRdB0SqQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"The pizza was a good as Pizza Hut gets but the express means limited choices. The quality was good. Would definitely eat here again.\",\"time\":1681942505,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Anish Shah\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104847016092945030797\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLHqOrINGBXmZ24q4p4n43__9WvTZnyEk3pzZFA4w_N=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"We stopped by to pick up pizza and bread sticks and eat back at the hotel.  Hoping for hand tossed, we realized they only make pan pizza.  That was disappointing but at least they had bread sticks.   It only takes 10 to 15 min to make, which is great.  There is a large sitting area if you prefer to eat there as well.  However the reason for the low ranking is bc the pizza tasted undercooked.  Even the bread sticks tasted a bit undercooked, which was disappointing bc we were too nervous finishing and ruining our next morning of hiking in the GC.\",\"time\":1693771473,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kavitha Krishnan\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114977564870079713363\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVv59I8i7AyZX9-Kn79MSEab4DFm7Tx8AobHTQG_KZ2gjBx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"If you are really hungry and dont have anywhere else to go this would be a good option. They have very limited items on their menu. We ordered the pan pizza (which was the only pizza kind available) which was good, the cheese bread sticks were very soggy and chewy. Service was slow, however they were understaffed and it was Memorial weekend.\",\"time\":1654198603,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"MoinHenry\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112168703203372176996\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUcIs7_zoFuUMxrJwx2VHgLDjEBKGD4VZXU-Idm0_Etyxw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"The pizza wasn\'t the best but also not near bad. I didn\'t enjoy the service nor the fast food ambience. The wait time was just abnormally long. We nearly had to wait 30 min.\",\"time\":1692720073,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":false,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=17442750262120391125\",\"user_ratings_total\":228,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"Imax Theatre, 450 State Route 64 Grand Canyon, Tusayan\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/locations.pizzahut.com\\/az\\/tusayan\\/450-state-route-64?utm_medium=organic&utm_source=local&utm_campaign=googlelistings&utm_content=website&utm_term=295786\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:41','2023-09-19 05:55:41'),(28,'Arizona Steakhouse','googleplaces','ChIJBRfAfczuMocRvitz8IgvCNI',34,'Big windows facing the canyon set the scene for modern steakhouse fare, plus burgers & BBQ at lunch.',8,0.20,NULL,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geome