E31sAadmM9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"The dining experience was exceptional. While I initially believed they specialised only in steak, I was pleasantly surprised to find diverse offerings, including plant-based options and a salmon dish. The service was attentive and the ambiance truly elevated our meal. Additionally, the kids\\u2019 menu deserves a special mention, not only for its variety but also for the generous portion sizes.\",\"time\":1692674355,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"P R\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117284355081185402313\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVT4IHAZGl2DpCxGfuznjjxLJkS5eOQdfigbBN20sgniFmc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"The steak was done to perfection. Mash potatoes were delicious. Service was great fro our waiter.  The view amazing.  Loved this place.  Highly recommended.\",\"time\":1692053269,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Seth Varner (Wandermore Publishing LLC)\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105180376581691624400\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWT8H95ksQgEyUwtiUMfobiCjnReHGhsBG-YmZFSf6t3g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Nice eatery to relax at and enjoy a view of the rim. We were originally told it would be a 40 minute wait, but we ended up getting in a couple of minutes later. Be prepared to spend a little money here \\u2014 there\\u2019s some cheaper appetizer options, but you\\u2019ll likely end up paying top dollar for their prime rib, salmon, or another high-tier dish. Friendly staff and relatively quick service, and the food is very tasty! The pan seared salmon has a unique flavor to it because of the prickly pear butter, and the prickly pearadise cider is reminiscent of a Mike\\u2019s Hard Strawberry Lemonade.\",\"time\":1685296258,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Linda Filippi\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116099770159085127949\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJLA_yTQ7wBV0gGw1wfuykqGU6C3zeWxfxRgvx1vTG2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"We sat at a window table looking out at the Grand Canyon, as well as the walkers going by. It was a breathtaking view. Our waiter Raul was excellent: soft spoken, knowledgeable, attentive, and professional. My husband ordered the prime rib and I ordered the lamb chops. We started with house salads that were generous in size. The entrees were so delicious, wonderfully seasoned, and cooked to perfection. For dessert we enjoyed the apple crisp with ice cream and way too much whip cream. I highly recommend Arizona Steakhouse.\",\"time\":1686796882,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Erica M\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109148483257415119795\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUGXPuBEdRp5Os_K2EYV7O5SvQBpGOQ8fAQThwLBtSW9Pk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Food was ok. Ordered prime rib medium rare and it was definitely medium to medium well and not very flavorful. (And it was crazy expensive)\\nBread was excellent. Potatoes were not real (box potatoes most likely).  Boys liked the turkey wraps a lot.\\nShrimp was ok.\\nView was beautiful but you have to have a reservation to sit by a window.\",\"time\":1687387986,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=15134398812974689214\",\"user_ratings_total\":809,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"10 Albright Avenue, Grand Canyon Village\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.grandcanyonlodges.com\\/dining\\/arizona-room\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:41','2023-09-19 05:55:41'),(29,'Big E Steakhouse & Saloon','googleplaces','ChIJg6mSye4bM4cRUYJ0Ppcn42Y',35,'Western-style steakhouse pairing its meats with drinks & entertainment including a magician & music.',15,0.20,0,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":35.97299609999999,\"lng\":-112.1260212},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":35.97442038029149,\"lng\":-112.1249081697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":35.97172241970849,\"lng\":-112.1276061302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Big E Steakhouse & Saloon\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":1152,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109092220863045541233\\\">Big E Steakhouse &amp; Saloon<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjONfQxtLbO4a_6ly7P-lrtBU8LAZMeBlSRQogwJli09-q8njonx_sLGEphxyGFXpwFM2hXyW9Mn9wUbKa_yp0EBGYH44KLthKFQClaLUD4looOn2iSS_rli3c2dugNvQoON1add_CxC3jAeEpxydBzvP2lRn7pj8l7akIe5Vnbn4ra\",\"width\":769}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJg6mSye4bM4cRUYJ0Ppcn42Y\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"XVFF+5H Grand Canyon Village, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8579XVFF+5H\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":3.8,\"reference\":\"ChIJg6mSye4bM4cRUYJ0Ppcn42Y\",\"scope\":\"GOOGLE\",\"types\":[\