trib\\/115638192858160465354\\\">Morgan M<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjz3i4_UTE39m4VhWjqUpVBoq57UT5ChLReUYMPwq0RcZnrjJquKju1WjIg2wg9h45jPYYq7SZ55LwrnD5yzgpqQyrf0GQEY_ZkHbXQpzdGiivTEzZox5j60jWiIT_FzjyzLDLLIe_Yj3_D2kCAf_enAEOmuKCXJUPKXFI2H2MB3Ngd\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108314497537795232836\\\">Jeff Stilwell<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zibdfX-wPRRcgl1NXqhmMsOViULnwxng08MVLwBAzxx_o5VMpLJSFP6xXXJ3xlXjur-JWFB_CxwxRyRhGKEurQXd_MY8PqLFoJEqjAWhGcr_5TCrTlbIx9z77mCSn95VwB1UXFP2csKc5H33WNKHS7vclAgZ5ZyepOdDRlNml4x8PFg\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115225258832349526221\\\">Priscilla McGuire<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjhJhVYvLPySTh3rWopTNxMv_6ttBmNwXWuGf-gvJOYfd8T2DqA4U3pHV9k_WK8Ok_25yjIA0TND6lB9UyeOSHBoGBwGGKv1H6X4ezML9sr8C7z28RntnhzH1LWmaJXhmoG1_zFEERZj-Y-oB7v5PsywNoFyc15vv3DHsyl0xkhaPOK\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115225258832349526221\\\">Priscilla McGuire<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjwStUwVC11uIVyBrJsm7N6A-QHekxh5zpoatNIaejtzo7Cv_54KXhxrAqImmg8xmLyQsN1J7WktFjoS6Z_J036vEY2Lvs2b46k7g3pccVCp9ev9tA2ZDkqWli1QTadgvai0paHgQGhQqxa9JpghOclQUiOyNUSKZBAPnZPUfub_LGu\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJnb-6BZITM4cRmXHLzeLKvZs\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"5WWW+WR North Rim, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85895WWW+WR\"},\"rating\":4,\"reference\":\"ChIJnb-6BZITM4cRmXHLzeLKvZs\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Morgan M\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115638192858160465354\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocI_ssrCRp8f9eJc6vxWgHB0duPDzQPsC_oXRUYRHGw2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"There need to be more stars for atmosphere.\\nIt\'s always a pleasure dining or lunching at the Grand Canyon Dining Room. Good food. Professional staff. Roger was great! And just being there with that  incredible view that words can barely describe. I had the Grand Canyon burger.\",\"time\":1694486220,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"George Bo Clevenger\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107354339031793245435\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVDyWBOww5KA7_yvGyG5Sc6tMXUWmSNyfqdQgoqQ9cG6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Your choices for food at the north rim are very limited. We were there for two nights and decided we would have dinner in the dining room at the lodge. The menu had several dishes that sounded good to us and we made a reservation for that evening.\\nWe were seated quickly and our waitress was very friendly. We ordered the brisket platter and the poblano chicken.  The food came out rather quickly, looked great and good portions. To my surprise the brisket was way over cooked and definitely not cooked low and slow as it should be.  The corn was mush.\\nMy wife\'s chicken wasn\'t much better...dry and salty.\\nYour choices are very limited at the north rim, I suggest you plan ahead and bring food with you.\",\"time\":1693771977,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Afsha Chaudhary\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101760734248093799437\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXVm_7nR9HlJkWE5FBnpWWxWNQcxSJvHm2XN8vqvDsp-gsx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"The server was great\\nThe food was amazing we ordered brisket and elk soup both were full of flavors and delightful\\nThey have enough veg options along with dessert and a huge spread of drinks\\nAmazing place\",\"time\":1693951162,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=11222348921941225881\",\"user_ratings_total\":3,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"6225 Arizona 67, North Rim\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.grandcanyonnorth.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:42','2023-09-19 05:55:42'),(32,'Desert Lounge + Grill','googleplaces','ChIJQQ4ICe8bM4cRFb5MIwsGKsU',38,'Set inside a Best Western Hotel, this fine-dining option specializes in chops & seafood.',8,0.20,0,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":35.9693112,\"lng\":-112.1292774},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":35.9708228302915,\"lng\":-112.1278681697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":35.9681248697085,\"lng\":-112.1305661302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Desert Lounge + Grill\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":false},\"photos\":[{\"height\":675,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101605073989929183856\\\">Desert Lounge + Grill<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhtKzu0Rdnl_hZ3FxYze7N7-zPcRGePgC22mWLPc6jGwBLftxXhrOLVXAmdJ7Eohw4r7JSLVfxLU0EY8GP3B6ZrGY9EAVZGFnKIgeQt0GNXSZMpw2Nqp5Nifl0Slk_cEzOiJPL272ZptP7C4AmP-QOorym5uVPzL9QkxplRwXJNlyax\",\"width\":1200}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJQQ4ICe8bM4cRFb5MIwsGKsU\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"XV9C+P7 Grand Canyon Village, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8579XV9C+P7\"},\"rating\":3.8,\"reference\":\"ChIJQQ4ICe8bM4cRFb5MIwsGKsU\",\"scope\":\"GOOGLE\",\"