Wif_0qi5BdwUr_YJc9HflxTXZCRCfNSJ6FsCJrvVQiiG5bK9FfOXK1vIfOsRDxYLKGpJEWwxXSuYO6gD4myKH4tzQzEBUqmSW8ZppFUTEKMODIA_6CRQJGJQc_zDGxjjs7jI7XEdMQw_rxw4\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJQQ4ICe8bM4cRFb5MIwsGKsU\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"XV9C+P7 Grand Canyon Village, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8579XV9C+P7\"},\"rating\":3.8,\"reference\":\"ChIJQQ4ICe8bM4cRFb5MIwsGKsU\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Let\'s Go\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101658895275332744566\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIPig8D6kJkmmhCGcQH-iC1FUbFWmQ-UOjUSvN4Se9o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"11 months ago\",\"text\":\"Me and my wife really enjoyed our dinner here. Food was great and the service was excellent. It\'s a classy restaurant and the atmosphere was romantic for the two of us watching the sunset while eating.\\n\\nI highly recommend their set menu. It\'s great value. We ordered the prime rib and half chicken from the set menu. The caesar salad and creamy chicken soup were good. The medium rime rib was excellent. It was quite big although the menu said 8oz. My wife could not finish it. It came with some veggies which was just perfectly cooked. My chicken was a little salty to my taste but it was acceptable.\\n\\nThe atmosphere was great. The restaurant was classy and nicely decorated. They server with full tablecloth, fine silverware and glassware. We sat by the large window overlooking a small garden. We ate while the sun went down. It was romantic.\\n\\nI can see why people complained about the service. First we had to wait 25 min for a table, not because the restaurant was full, but because they were short-staffed. In fact, the place was pretty empty, only about 5 tables were there. We sat down and were quickly served with water and breads by Vanessa, a very friendly lady who was busing the tables. Breads were delicious and she gave us a second basket no problem. We then waited for another 15 min before the server came to us. It turned out the waitress at the front did not tell him he was our server. Anyway, Juan came and he was fantastic. He took our order and stroke a friendly conversation. He came back a few times to make sure our food was okay and refilled our water. Even the bartender lady came to ask us if we needed anything. I think a little understanding and patience will go a long way.\",\"time\":1665828215,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"J. C.\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103332091910362148930\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUa7C9b3QibOD-Kpr3VBJMtm3ediHlnFCYXsZ712KQ-M7w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"10 months ago\",\"text\":\"My meal was cook to perfection. Some of the other meals were served cold and My daughter N.Y Steak was overcooked. Our server Juan was amazing -kind, friendly and took the time to make sure we were having a good experience. Can\'t say the same for some of the other staff who worked that night.\",\"time\":1667595777,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jason Grey\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116160777102916923731\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXbZu-tdCqxv8xxPBRPX2VsX-NNWrzCEphO1S4S7EnHZ9o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"All of the lights, vents, cameras, sprinklers, etc, were perfectly centered in each ceiling tile and it was incredibly satisfying. Food and beer available.\",\"time\":1688610785,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Richard Fung\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104203729809591171711\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocK9ydHgcXew6G0oZzsAPbO6IqelyeT4plqzo519q3vC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"Quick Summary\\nThe steakhouse in the Best Western. Food was decent, our waiter, Alec, was excellent, but food did take a while to arrive. Reservations are encouraged but we got lucky with a walk-in after sunset\\n\\nFood- 4 stars\\nBread- complimentary bread was good. Nothing special, but good to wet the appetite\\n\\nRibeye- they cooked it perfectly, but not the best marbling or seasoning.\\n\\nSeabass- this was pretty good\\n\\nService- 5 stars\\nOur server, Alec, was fantastic throughout. The kitchen was running a bit slow though to get our food (probably around 30-40 minutes to get our meal)\\n\\nBottom Line\\nThe prices can be a bit expensive since it\'s in the Grand Canyon area with limited options. However, the Coronado Room is a decent dinner spot when you\'re staying at the Best Western\",\"time\":1649043319,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"olivia chambers\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111601313697930272749\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUBIR6QSc7HVKh6t1w7nfYB2ZIbgFfLZxPEYPaevNuj8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"The oldest restaurant ever. The waiters outfits dated, the floor dated and the walls dated. The menu, insanely overpriced! 30$ for an 8 oz steak. The only thing that saved this place was the waiter from France he was a great waiter and funny too. The menu was also, Asian, Spanish, American, and French. Pick a theme guys.\",\"time\":1690689977,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"lodging\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=14207174619400289813\",\"user_ratings_total\":410,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"74 Arizona 64, Grand Canyon Village\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.grandcanyonsquire.com\\/dining-and-lounges.htm\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:42','2023-09-19 05:55:42'),(33,'Bright Angel Bikes & Café at Grand Canyon Visitor Center','googleplaces','ChIJjfsXS5kQM4cRvMNFzkWrPWo',39,'Upbeat cafe & espresso bar offering sandwiches, soups & drinks with a local, seasonal focus.',15,0.20,0,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.0585794,\"lng\":-112.1098366},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.0598132802915,\"lng\":-112.1085932197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.05711531970851,\"lng\":-112.1112911802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/cafe-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/cafe_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Bright Angel Bikes & Caf\\u00e9 at Grand Canyon Visitor Center\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108070246706566912708\\\">Marcus<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgPpOz6d_rsztIW1TC51wP9r4l1itjWqoiw2z_Ehqu_-MRTm1_nVVzswq-WNdvH91NGJ3jwspqR79Va5fLlKg9oqTgBQAYUIScibM3zfpy6Tr4a_bFDjnGfpP7XCA7XTpZSB6DbvVQp5Ky9vTr4oha5ReWmXhAjtThwkWBcuCLnNWA4\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJjfsXS5kQM4cRvMNFzkWrPWo\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"3V5R+C3 Grand Canyon Village, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85893V5R+C3\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJjfsXS5kQM4cRvMNFzkWrPWo\",\"scope\":\"GOOGLE\",\"types\":[\"cafe\",\"travel_agency\",\"restaurant\",\