3piFuWgZK-NwGLmOzx\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115491237823273723725\\\">Henry Ng<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziJZMRCxQWZXBiK5bogxk5UQdROEI4OBTuf2aaKWLDGtsn7Z65IJttU-ivO4lH6lHLFOSCiLeelflXeATOxo7F0q7vTUvZziTgBM41Mq2jpEuR4F2P9_UpvfvvL2KNYHqENp4fr0IoKtCtN06rPIjwHvXV9VR2fgYGXI65dO0R-q4Cu\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJjfsXS5kQM4cRvMNFzkWrPWo\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"3V5R+C3 Grand Canyon Village, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85893V5R+C3\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJjfsXS5kQM4cRvMNFzkWrPWo\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"John Turner\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104307236093407978286\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUL-JgMXPJgY9e8-ipaw2z53GqhDPy-nK2ekPsj5ST8g6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"When it comes to exploring the breathtaking wonders of the Grand Canyon, Bright Angel Bikes is the ultimate companion for your outdoor adventure. During my recent visit to this iconic destination, I had the pleasure of renting bikes from Bright Angel Bikes, and it turned out to be an unforgettable experience.\\n\\nFrom the moment I arrived at their convenient location near the Grand Canyon\'s South Rim, I was greeted by a friendly and knowledgeable staff. They took the time to understand my preferences and provided valuable insights on the best biking routes, ensuring that I had a customized and enjoyable experience.\\n\\nThe selection of bikes at Bright Angel Bikes is impressive. They offer a range of well-maintained bicycles suitable for various skill levels and preferences. Whether you\'re an experienced cyclist or a casual rider, you\'ll find the perfect ride to suit your needs. The staff\'s expertise in fitting the bikes to each individual ensured that I was comfortable and ready to embark on my adventure.\\n\\nThe biking trails around the Grand Canyon are simply awe-inspiring, and exploring them on two wheels with Bright Angel Bikes was an absolute thrill. The well-marked paths and scenic routes allowed me to immerse myself in the stunning natural beauty of the canyon. The freedom and flexibility of biking provided a unique perspective and allowed me to discover hidden gems along the way.\\n\\nSafety is a top priority at Bright Angel Bikes, and I appreciated the thorough briefing they provided before I set off. They shared important tips on trail etiquette, safety precautions, and recommended rest stops. This attention to detail made me feel confident and at ease throughout my biking excursion.\\n\\nOne of the highlights of my experience was the breathtaking ride along the Rim Trail. Pedaling along the rim of the Grand Canyon, I was treated to panoramic views that seemed to stretch on forever. The sheer magnitude of the canyon\'s beauty is truly awe-inspiring, and the bike ride allowed me to fully appreciate its grandeur while enjoying the fresh air and tranquility of nature.\\n\\nAside from bike rentals, Bright Angel Bikes also offers guided tours and shuttle services, making it even easier to explore the Grand Canyon\'s wonders. Whether you prefer a leisurely ride or an adrenaline-pumping downhill adventure, their team can assist in creating the perfect itinerary for you.\\n\\nI must also commend the exceptional customer service provided by Bright Angel Bikes. The staff members were friendly, approachable, and passionate about the Grand Canyon. They eagerly shared their knowledge, offered helpful suggestions, and ensured that I had an incredible experience from start to finish.\\n\\nIn conclusion, Bright Angel Bikes is the go-to destination for anyone seeking an unforgettable biking adventure at the Grand Canyon. Their top-quality bikes, knowledgeable staff, and commitment to safety and customer satisfaction set them apart. Whether you\'re a seasoned cyclist or a first-time visitor, renting bikes from Bright Angel Bikes will enhance your exploration of this natural wonder and create memories that will last a lifetime.\\n\\nMake sure to include Bright Angel Bikes in your Grand Canyon itinerary. They are a reliable and exceptional partner for all your biking needs, allowing you to immerse yourself in the awe-inspiring beauty of this iconic national park\",\"time\":1684901035,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Aaron Harris\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115882981499033739204\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKQEn4-34gdduzZ17Xo4_O6K7il0LDzjL2D5AdI--Ih=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"We had a wonderful experience taking the ride to Hermits Rest(E-bikes). Reserved online ahead of time and everything was ready for us to go the morning of our ride. Bought a sandwich and some blueberry muffins (a little undercooked, but things happen). Everyone we met or that helped us was informative and courteous. Overall an excellent experience and would highly recommend and would do again for sure.\",\"time\":1686164307,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jess Justice\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117978974226555540214\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVP1jtYS_3jLnSr2n6hv1NjrE-T4CQiOmZLb_alIX9Cgv8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"We loved every bit of it! We rented the bikes for 2 hours and went to Yaki Point. It\\u2019s a great ride along the south rim with lots of great views! We also got to pet mules on our way. Really fun and it\\u2019s a good way to avoid the crowds. Staff were very friendly and informative.\",\"time\":1689301620,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Diana Perrel\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106212477466642296956\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJPgdi1gxqnyTZsJVEdsPd_FQjivabhR_ATpR8HSAfB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"We had a great experience! Rented bikes for me, my husband, and our 4 kids ages 7-11. We made a reservation ahead of time, and they were quick to get us riding as soon as we arrived. They were very helpful measuring the kids for helmets and bikes. This was by far our favorite experience at Grand Canyon NP. It was amazing to see so many different views of the canyon away from the crowds. We all loved it and would highly recommend it.\",\"time\":1686461582,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Henry Ng\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115491237823273723725\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWQQkntWcM5eztKy7Ds5uajVzduzbUCwhi2EBY54Mpdsw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"What a way to check out the South Rim of the Grand Canyon.  Check in and orientation was super smooth and the sandwiches were quite good! The roast beef pretzel bun was probably the best.  We also tried the turkey wrap and the turkey with ciabatta bread as well.\\n\\nOnly thing I could say from an improvement perspective is getting a receipt or order confirmation via email.  I booked it back in late March and completed the waiver form.  About 3 weeks went by and I forgot if I already booked the bikes so I searched through my emails and found nothing so I thought I forgot to book it.\\n\\nLater I realized I saved the first order\\u2019s waiver in my cloud storage so that\\u2019s when I knew I already booked it because I was about to save the new waiver form in my cloud storage.  So I ended up just eating the admin fee from cancelling the second reservation.\\n\\nWe rented the e-bikes for half a day and the yellow and orange trail is definitely doable in 5 hours even without being in a rush.\",\"time\":1682527239,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":false,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"cafe\",\"travel_agency\",\"restaurant\",\"store\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=7655463257901482940\",\"user_ratings_total\":1070,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"10 South Entrance Road, Grand Canyon Village\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/bikegrandcanyon.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:42','2023-09-19 05:55:42'),(34,'The Fountain','googleplaces','ChIJQV5hRmIRM4cR1YFMibEs8iQ',40,NULL,8,0.20,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.0570828,\"lng\":-112.1407124},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.0582358302915,\"lng\":-112.1394897697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.0555378697085,\"lng\":-112.1421877302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"The Fountain\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101666185166395504907\\\">Steve Klefstad<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjgYuPkTEv4_LX0wm-N0XODg7RKf83hDORk437kctThy8mbK-HSNDKD5op-sajitUUKi65R0jZhbzYBJt4giTbUsH6ixyJDM-7bURh7TqfsxpgblWJ_tsBYv2kZVT