description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Very good service here, the customer service was great and didn\\u2019t expect as it\\u2019s a tourist place.\",\"time\":1693715666,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Daniel Jewett\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100330150063041247272\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXDU8LabMKKAJjkBvIKQbeg4-Io8cC4rc7qtRY0FwLGYDA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"If you wanna pay $30 for 2 fast food meals then this is the place for you!! The prices are ABSOLUTELY insane for a fast food joint! We could\'ve had something much better for around the same price if we just would\'ve had lunch in Williams. The franchise owners gotta lower the prices somewhat because it\'s pretty ridiculous.\",\"time\":1687618371,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Teddy Johnson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117288077422478266832\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW1WK9oTVIF_yZ7ZSGc5OwdROMw2xQQqf1_WK9hDdSu0WyB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Was out of many menu items and drinks. Loby and restrooms were very dirty with trash in the floor. Couldn\'t find a clean table. Drive through was closed. Waited over an hour to order and receive our food.\",\"time\":1681089594,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Matthew L\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113014747515436207675\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVqJCoKJifCBg6ll8DZb0-N_ClOIvZp99GbxBK-gP4OLDo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"On June 28 they were out of French fries, yet you were still able to order them on the mobile app. Maybe fix that little glitch. And maybe don\'t have the person with the mask on as your primary person engaging with customers (calling out names\\/numbers). It\'s 2023, I\'m over asking someone to repeat their muffled words over and over again.\",\"time\":1688613873,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Maurice M\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110050953398483658089\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV5oGk7MbmLiiPSUbpX1-WM03g1Lo28ACDV4lAAQNdiyXk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"Good Wendy\'s food. This place can handle large crowds.\",\"time\":1694716026,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"2200\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"0630\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"2200\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"0630\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"2200\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"0630\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"2200\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"0630\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"2200\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"0630\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"2200\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"0630\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"2200\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"0630\"}}],\"type\":\"DRIVE_THROUGH\",\"weekday_text\":[\"Monday: 6:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200910:00\\u202fPM\",\"Tues