P6_hownlZFl5rctKXO3X3gxHxyg05Txy-ufUDAzYjwoRQvOvx-j8JiuQ6405-nDgihMW5PMTAFxUuElwQwy_oB8GXpP80rpTG06gcUj-UKg9ldup3MbwkPDh_1bDs2QOtyBruETecYK-_oZof20VWpKg\",\"width\":4000},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110226577231054074754\\\">That Girl<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zheE6fzOnJELNCGnXNze4qEtdhcomQKDXokZ_wTgZP9ZKtLwITFEAZvpzFpz629LgojXq05kUGHrvDLNAPRtrIHaSCOlmUkpsKEBwbYzNnx5CGsoMSoXu6VbSCvZ8HaTbkFeTxpTRPWWnugNyrOtQIW1mM-KWg0YKZ7bk3EKAHXQtsT\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJt4BBjAoaM4cR8bASyfd01EI\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"XVGG+32 Grand Canyon Village, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8579XVGG+32\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":3,\"reference\":\"ChIJt4BBjAoaM4cR8bASyfd01EI\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Cathy Cooper\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105959651504456268938\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV49t7ch9crTr95-eBlpd-kOn8Bthp765uSS95GY58XiH0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"We had excellent juniper wood fired steaks! Not sure why anyone would rate this restaurant so low. We loved the Western decor throughout. The portions were good sized with salad & delicious cornbread, baked potato, corn on the cob & baked beans served in a cute little pot. Don\\u2019t skip the homemade hot apple pie a La mode! It\\u2019s the perfect place to stop after a day at the Grand Canyon!\",\"time\":1692060942,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Don Cooper\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115289013165480565212\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUEFJwhc7pdHaD3eOuEtLk0jPNY1eNzm5PX6BkkHJ1HZg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Great western theme! Great salad! More western than Dodge City Kansas!\\ud83e\\udd23 Great food and steaks plus fantastic corn bread! Best I\\u2019ve ever had! This is a hidden gem! The steak was fantastic!! This place gets a ten out of ten!! The apple pie is unbelievable!\",\"time\":1692059999,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Wendy Yost\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118152575567269687910\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjX-zM_906bth6glo-yt74yXWND4YUed1xAm85DkoTdPYFY1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"So so good.  After having a terrible experience down the road...we walked into a warm, welcoming restaurant with immediate seating in a busy restaurant.  The food was absolutely phenomenal!!  Service was amazing. So friendly and fun.  If you are in the area... definitely go there!  Open fire barbeque meat and beans! Tons of food for the price!  Coffee was delicious as well, very fresh.\",\"time\":1682916628,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Chris McGuffin\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115483038403886494663\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWrIzeZcdVYKUTHf6-EUUJLTFgqvyCRg93u4IuIQmkBEC0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Prompt service and generous portions. Too much food for either of us to eat. The atmosphere is dark and western. My wife had the hamburger and enjoyed it. The fries were good too. I had the half-rack of ribs. They had a good flavour but were a little rubbery. The small cob of corn was a nice surprise but it was boiled for too long: it was really soft and tasteless. The salad served at the beginning of our meal was fresh (lettuce, tomato and red onions) with a generous glob of salad dressing. My wife liked the flavor; I prefer salad without dressing but we were not asked about that. Beer was served cold and the soda was well carbonated with lots of ice. The men\'s washroom was clean, functional and decorated with framed cowboy cats.\",\"time\":1682648963,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Denise Laverty\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105923002011716143098\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLD1vTQ2cdFEhZ-d6-4KTrUfum1TbORJGTinWYVJuzm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"This no-frills restaurant was definitely a surprise. The food was fantastic - steaks were cooked perfectly! You get a lot too. I had the Cowgirl Steak and it came with a salad, piece of cornbread, baked potato, corn on the cob and a cute pot of beans to share with the table. Service was excellent!\",\"time\":1689346503,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=4815602509145092337\",\"user_ratings_total\":1768,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"541 Arizona 64, Grand Canyon Village\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:43','2023-09-19 05:55:43'),(37,'Subway','googleplaces','ChIJZ_EqCKfWNIcRIZ-6SDecfPk',43,'Casual counter-serve chain for build-your-own sandwiches & salads, with health-conscious options.',10,0.20,NULL,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.0433637,\"lng\":-112.5223247},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.04453143029149,\"lng\":-112.5209771197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.