_xznYUDhWFMyiDTmlqu5Tt-JI84vbRaSE\",\"width\":1080},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100320882308713972072\\\">Patrick Youngblood<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgCL-8Lvw8zL2TN9VLa_vDYkn0insC0xuuwwysttFa6urFPpmfephT4qwNRHqiQJT8seiubFGfNZ9KINPywLDDTnB_Ng9OcpUW0dGBaRNShVmGTLKe1BDC1i-Hp1T7doiP6NUG1-BYarrnkkJVfzpQTGEXLGwVbaBlW1KTtFgiTS4ba\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":1920,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101388301031775786128\\\">William Taylor<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhXoQdMqPpi-uqbu9CI9yVdb-TvhuILjm0lzj8s5nU3TvgWz9-xhXX5KLZi3Da9PRJTK82maXuvn3Vnb9b1io6Ppa1uBBByS11Vi0fQO7r3MPZuQUzH-r8gsMAkK-9_NbtkmExJ0X_0xnXLVr0gL1jgZYBJAUroyfDGj6TElwhpNZw\",\"width\":1080},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100320882308713972072\\\">Patrick Youngblood<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhY0goS19QFtUd6R5_KLGKFNB9SWsIZIH-sXferJ_edetxUIjxm4KXwLjriYIOv-J7591AV7oh-kfUyoaGkeQUtrn23b9-N3JU21GZ2PFecrvaJaVos_Ve9A6QrxWS8Isco1DsSnbvtFI_UvkUT2MsQKaMb6G-gnCv2JibNTk82VDoZ\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJZ_EqCKfWNIcRIZ-6SDecfPk\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"2FVH+83 Kanab, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85992FVH+83\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.7,\"reference\":\"ChIJZ_EqCKfWNIcRIZ-6SDecfPk\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Eve R\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103205098297797662305\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocISq6H4C0gYf88LgmWF2Is68aP-McOFT23Zjmxo57af=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"Visited Subway here on September 14th while visiting USA for the first time. I have only encountered nice and polite people, but here. I speak 4 languages, so pardon my pronunciation when it comes to certain words. We pronounce them differently. I felt like I wanted to leave with my partner and we were also asked to leave a tip (we\\u2019re probably too polite so we left a dollar or so, although I regret that).. the woman who worked there this morning was helping a trainee, I felt so sorry for him. The woman who was with him felt so intimidating and extremely cold towards us and the trainee. Whole experience was terrible. But the sandwiches were good, thank You!\",\"time\":1694713552,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jason Excell\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102958864159163884394\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVNd0lzQMK-FXMRT93tbhxJfuG5cZLZD5INgYbJDKCGdQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Good food. The staff is very hard working and great with customers. Not sure why the corden off half of the dining room.  Is it so they won\'t need to clean it later or to encourage people to  \\\"take-out\\\" ?\",\"time\":1691766716,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sarah Gleeson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108382143529742526011\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJwvRDJX-5UG4ILW9hNRdWIR9-qpNTxzSIUvU_MSH3h=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"3 of us stopped here during our road trip for a quick cheap bite and were delighted with both the service and the subs. Bobbi, I believe her name was excellent. Attentive, kind, patient and efficient. She was the only one behind the counter and didn\\u2019t seem to stress or rush with a queue! 5 stars for Bobbi \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\",\"time\":1689307300,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jim Hin\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105597456998587977475\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJNuhmzAqQat2G0w8Z08fEFjfTfAzXFJ8yZb22Btl36=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"We needed a restaurant that could cater for 222 people.  Subway stepped up to the plate and hit it out of the park.  All the sandwiches, sides, and condiments were ready to go at the designated time and the display cases allowed for easy serving.  Rick and the Subway team were great to work with, and we\'ll use them when our group gathers again next year.\",\"time\":1684806970,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"madi greenwood\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114944343041208267615\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocI_zvzgbPF38k-l7PTMyl4OXZWm0lewG_xOcO2BbkD0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"gage is seriously the best! i have a gluten allergy, and after letting him know he got everything clean and prepared my bowl to make sure my food didn\\u2019t have any gluten traces. he also was so kind and happy to do it, even though the line was long behind me. he made my day!\",\"time\":1683416343,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=17977415573813501729\",\"user_ratings_total\":447,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"295 East 300 South, Kanab\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.c