\\/102791792902558300323\\\">Karen Heet\\/Realtor<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgz8oAW9TBXCcTp9CoyZ_Q5W5c260cyhFyYTrtkRXT7bZO0xJ1kK8xxqi4tx2dXhqVF-Yrvs8FGjxN9J2YJx4iTgWo3vMivHpLL5sT_Yj3qQzNYtXh5rwkB8w4au5dEZSAEkYgUw6KrgHfnyaOwsTBouto-a13ugooV25z-7REcbT4V\",\"width\":1536},{\"height\":1200,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113005540430113617084\\\">Jake Dinsdale<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhRT1WD0Im8a10-JPAdiffRpv7JXDSjrj1gI6B2azYhqFnOeNnW9BDDItH4B5a0RsIVfxjhDbmO4CRurxAXYXadoHMvfwVJP7JpeZqQ9zXde43f_7c6TVVMTKICP8b2C-x3qvWnr8zLsxeC5awh_hG-OUdPDdHteRZRSsIG8h_4pocW\",\"width\":1600}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJAYzROR_UNIcRlufqBZEeQgs\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"2FX9+95 Kanab, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85992FX9+95\"},\"rating\":4.7,\"reference\":\"ChIJAYzROR_UNIcRlufqBZEeQgs\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Clegger\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106280719171997913750\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWvWBriP6367CYG9PPAcjEXr2mvDNodzNFeEJpXDTb4gv4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"I really like this small town drugstore.  It has all the things you used to find in a drugstore when you were younger.  Prescription drugs of course but gifts, soda fountain, ice cream parlor, and a great sandwich bar.  Really a fun place to stop and pick up some gift or cards for everyone who didn\\u2019t travel with you to Kanab.\",\"time\":1688568690,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Rochelle Howe\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105934790192950542848\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIJfKuRd7nBrCK-2bRA7U3-2xRS5sM5okqOgiGJwgZ0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"While on vacation. The battery in the key fob was losing juice. I called and asked the woman at counter if she could check if they had the battery. She nicely checked and held it for me. I appreciate their kindness\",\"time\":1684342338,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mike Fenn\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109650449154354669211\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocI5sNl4mwClIvMTTKRt_PEaMN32m9ZN5CA1aqpltNre=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Very nice small store with a nice assortment of meds and local treasures . The little ice cream and sandwich shop inside was very good. Great views of the Red Rock Hills\",\"time\":1684198208,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Brittany Love\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116378425887974778815\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXeWSzE_m92IIoVG2xPLwDpnepfjrFrvBhi4g6c6eXpep4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"The few years we lived here, this place saved my life so many times - they have anything and everything you need! I get lost in their boutique for fun and love the Kanab merchandise they have for sale. The pharmacists and cashiers are all cheery, pleasant to work with, and helpful.\\nWe were vaccinated here and it was a very clean, smooth-hop in-and-out procedure.\\n\\nThank you for taking care of us!\",\"time\":1656199283,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Larry Morden\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109447089866199469372\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/