ews\":[{\"author_name\":\"John B\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117559686267500620535\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWqzDcXMg1gvcSfgU_8ACYY9TXhKDWnGNIJUMGIiF25vsY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Came across this place driving around town. We arrived at 1600 got great inside table, local lager was very good. We ordered the Hot Mess pizza. It was excellent, between the Beyond Meat sausage and the non dairy cheese and peppers very tasty. Only small issue wish crust was thinner. Entire staff couldn\\u2019t be friendlier including the kitchen staff. SKY was our server great job and answered all questions. Great job. We Will Be Back\",\"time\":1688235356,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lisa McGraw\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103122156032057991045\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJAaUGHoUpcm20-ygkk0uQkoN7Tl7hxMwezttHckwCc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"High quality food and great atmosphere.\\nWe shared a wild mushroom pizza and latkes.\\nAbsolutely delicious.\\nMy husband had a cider and I an Old Fashioned made with High West bourbon (a Utah bourbon).\\nWe took home a slice of cheesecake with triple berry jam.\\nEverything was great and would definitely come back!\",\"time\":1682904760,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mary Cluff\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116025738246752218990\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU9ZTHnPc4OMw879XeruCBXOev917T5G6d351JpHvqIqOM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Service was quick and our waitress was amazing! Our food came out quick and was the best. We ordered the garlic bombs and margherita pizza. Everything was so good! We went on a Friday when they had live music, the artist was great, but the amp was turned up quite a bit, we felt like we had to yell to talk to each other. We can\\u2019t wait to go back!\",\"time\":1685176893,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Pam Scott (pamoscott)\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103274101931367872316\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUT0MYBwXZk5dmRpzSJYG_abOaPL3efNvvDbhmq4KRAtT8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"This place is worth the wait. We were there on a busy Wednesday and waited 30 mins for a table. So glad we did! We had the Caprese with perfect tomatoes and the Mushroom Madness pizza, which we dug in to so fast I didn\\u2019t get a photo. The service was great, and the views were even better.\",\"time\":1687405543,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Diana \\u0160poljar\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100786525802475504989\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUMOQeXjzneIZNtZSg0YYX9_1aYE2ejQMGy6iu9u8GwGkI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Great food, great service. Everything was amazing, and the vegan cheesecake was heavenly! This is a vegetarian restaurant with vegan options for everything on the menu. Outdoor and indoor seating area available, parking is possible on site.\",\"time\":1688397036,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\