\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101100521535685704890\\\">Catarina Gamboa<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgpEZs6g01tK3JIEWH9APx9baeMQBMTNwDvtgVzhze8jrju8RYOeMKnIfLywEB1NUjW1ol4-Sz9rMgYC-juGIZVccu92duZg_wweBT6hMYOc08kEtMsgWyj8ge2ZY48Wn_2L54T5Q4MzLobXDlwZjlbVhJiiP8_Xq7KYSl6WJRQbaCe\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108569227422395185267\\\">HumorousMirror1<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgK7qn2oUEU-_FdP2ovIKauofsk2jXhSmBC6hc4dg1wsMw8FBrsut_peolr1FNpy3jPPAWzaWw0zkFv-6mAdrzCyZuRRjcow-XYTX7lh3pXAyPB-zufZrOmT_elSPweVvq3LWTVEwT4Af-jTb5gxpj7jKRtsJfMmkl7cd4M45SDTGCN\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":4000,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114024289217387099008\\\">Gen Merritt<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhwauEsaDMfZTl4jZCkJyOhjbfwrCJXHd1qlPk_ne_YELQD-C1cwsXGXiuMEK5flLe-cpUulMyIxIapgEnG1Q3KLQ-CpAUjFqrxS-9UT0pvioQLsdhhrUs3TvzGh_rSQ-rJXVdX_Zh82OTGAb9xRBLDbelgs8_waFeI2MYLHQgffNaj\",\"width\":3000}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ2T9tOH7NyoARe4TWXp_sJfw\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"68F9+78 Mount Carmel, Orderville, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"859968F9+78\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.4,\"reference\":\"ChIJ2T9tOH7NyoARe4TWXp_sJfw\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Akul S\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104980346610246887405\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWAgI7LgvcuYSVfH7ZgA0_2XK_4wCeFRDQOUJW6FxADY2zG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"We happened to run into this place and it didn\'t disappoint! Classic American diner serving wholesome meals. Ordered the house salad and a turkey platter with mashed potatoes and chicken gravy; throughout enjoyed it. The service could\'ve been a bit quicker, but understandable since it was crowded. Will definitely return!\",\"time\":1694477974,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jaqueline Cabello\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111745364407988316832\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWE8fkrzOTlzQWcY7BSX-s0_EPfz3r3iz_r64Su32RnOg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"This Place is Amazing!!!  The prices and food were great, customer service was outstanding.  Our server Lloyd was very kind and friendly, and make us feel welcome. The meals are homemade, Large sizes. The pie is the best pie that you will ever have. We had shrimp, and liver (which was perfectly cooked), The pasta are great as well!!!!\",\"time\":1685681153,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Z Harris\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101639017935664448144\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocL3EZ5BNu1lF1T1cz08u83QM9mUzBe537_WuuuyXxQhGA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Only place to eat in the area. Service of the tables good. It was clean. Lots of 1950s looking decorations. The booths were comfortable. Food was decent. I don\'t know how much of it was made from scratch and how much of it came out of a bag in the freezer. Prices were what you would expect when you\'re in the middle of nowhere. I\'ll eat there again if I was in the area. The Thunderbird Berry pie and ice cream was a nice finishing.\",\"time\":1685774899,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Catarina Gamboa\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101100521535685704890\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVkbBAqgKnOZiJavjp8en6LAXXuaRVDdsKyO0msEF0zqDe1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"Great typical restaurant!\\nThe food was great and the portions were large. The service was also very good even though we stayed past the closing time given the affluence of the restaurant.\\nThe pies are worth it! We ordered 3 to try the different flavors and they were great. Although, with all the food we had before, we ended up taking some parts in boxes.\\nGreat place to come and have a great meal.\",\"time\":1678636857,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tracy R\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105834182220278926064\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIQ6uYfj5TWQ-Cg2h7uXbm-TJ0yLm0RnbjmEeyGE-Uj6XQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"This is a definite must visit restaurant.  It\\u2019s a 5th generation family owned business where quality and customer service come first!  The food is delicious with food size portions and reasonable pricing.  Our server Jason was AMAZING and ATTENTIVE.  I spoke with the owner and thanked her for the hospitality.  Very sweet lady and takes pride in her business! Please stop by and support the wonderful place.\",\"time\":1684988840,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":false,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=18169188440931206267\",\"user_ratings_total\":2546,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"4530 State Street, Mount Carmel\",\"website\":\