language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKG5HoaR4FS_200dRA0HUWqYKjjGcIXyEz6HNprxaqC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"We needed to dump & fill our RV mostly and heard it was free to do so with purchase of fuel so we asked the lady and she said no $10usd too. We thought she was being greedy & rude so we left. Thanks, you just lost a fair whack of our money as we also needed 2 RV propane tanks filled along with gas :) we popped literally across the road where dump & fill was free with gas purchase.\",\"time\":1693867461,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tony Dreizehn\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107016442420268415858\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUI_e14-6x4xFuSxKkPNQ5Pl6qxAKq8hQl-xremG9MOkxo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Pretty cool little shop with lots of cool knickknacks, trinkets, clothes, blankets & more! Staff is friendly & helpful. Definitely could grab a c-note worth of cool stuff in a matter of minutes. Will definitely stop by again when I comeback through in November \\ud83e\\udd20\",\"time\":1682713408,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Chuck Nagel\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111628612203865338340\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjX60w5k6tzL5-CX78gIBWDpHub3kEZU8L5pooB9ccrgkmI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"I used this station frequently while I was in the area visiting the parks.  Good access for cars and rv\'s.  Clean restrooms.\",\"time\":1684765744,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Ted Frady\",\"auth