g for even the largest trailers. It is attached to a trading post where you can buy all kinds of souvenir items.\",\"time\":1688339047,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"j h\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115038429400306602612\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKqClwOOwZmscIT8f2JsZtWKua3LAlvaaHprs966GzV=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"Fast and friendly service.\\n\\nThere doesn\'t seem to be too many choices to eat in this town. Subway was one of the few choices.\\n\\nThe sandwich was really good and they were very friendly here.\",\"time\":1631758216,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Crystal Chang\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103417704671312442950\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKJ2hQaWJ5YfXzFfEkQ2-tmEDWWidHUJTRujgFlZFVv-oY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"I don\\u2019t know why they were being mean to me. When I\\u2019m lining up they told me let the people who were opening the door closed the door and I did try to told them but someone was holding the door and people are keep coming into the store, when those people came in the store they did close the door suddenly. Me and my family are not traveling with them, and I think they thought we were traveling together (with the people who are holding the door) so they are being mean and impatient to us. And it is obviously that they are only treating us impatience because when they are serving next customer they are being nice, this a really bad experience for me.\",\"time\":1685566579,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Weronika Zalinski\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104384502244322238102\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLPhl1ScUi4_EtsRc40eGBdZQmaKiuhiqn-LQwtDgTx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Blonde mid aged lady has horrible attitude. Was very rude and disrespectful when trying to order our meal. Wont be coming back to this location.\",\"time\":1689376982,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Anupama Venkatesan\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116132411396587646126\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU95F2FF_eKSUiNv-dxa2uXZr6dAuP7kRz00MZlt0i-guJ0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"The person who prepared my sandwich was very nice and patient. Food was good and as I expected\",\"time\":1686528081,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=9105331515190028538\",\"user_ratings_total\":210,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"4490 South State Street, Orderville\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.com\\/united-states\\/ut\\/orderville\\/4490-south-state-street?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=44687&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ5MDMzOTItNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:45','2023-09-19 05:55:45'),(46,'All - American Fuel (Valley Station)','googleplaces','ChIJRYVVFz7NyoARwkhplXkrlGY',52,NULL,8,0.20,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.276261,\"lng