4697586051881195620\\\">Rimantas Verikas<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhB5VmwH5F3nRpesxXJGNVFA79b7HYmLZn2nOPrKsLmVc2FTN4XDJWgC0cXZa6WdWNKs1C4AwsmKImIPRBN75i9m0lqUBD_NHjr3YV3yX2TYilKtO19Qc9BMtZI2dq7VUXP0XAdiB6H1waqjRK_g8IiyYfufs0BFjPkp-Cr0Zv163v3\",\"width\":4608},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103258123885814869609\\\">anbaen<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zi4TPVFolbRYwEHmu_lx8_h4sOfRBrY_1yUD_bzC1sS3eetIpB6Bn07LeujQQ-JxqXoVsXhmuuyvfGa6yKolZ2waTSouXTeWgzy6VdFWnLTATp5hS29miSKzZsYQ4W6nWMI4dCZAnDajpXTx1H-igx0SQWiCIbPW38LV4VSp-Tl0gxq\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102594585019443646808\\\">Camille<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhjmHUS8x5fwHKSyIgaivrp4M5j46Wih0QlLGVD2VRJSEH9j4zj-bo03VaiMGB5L-xn4XYOHuQZ7xOMxzBJ_JzQ5vIGQmTVyAnOBLAQrb7HydNvN7yLezsMIRAQYMkXJ_3Bxc5IgVMldkCmDPPHP_1Crl5c5uxyD5GPS9lj1yWBAh3w\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ8-ZUCR_UNIcRG2lvbEMkOPI\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"2FXC+5V Kanab, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85992FXC+5V\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.3,\"reference\":\"ChIJ8-ZUCR_UNIcRG2lvbEMkOPI\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Z Harris\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101639017935664448144\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocL3EZ5BNu1lF1T1cz08u83QM9mUzBe537_WuuuyXxQhGA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Pick them because of their good Google reviews. Nicely laid out restaurant lots of Western art on the walls.\\n\\nDinner comes with some delicious hearty dinner rolls. If you do the side salad or the mashed potatoes make sure you get the salad deluxe or the potatoes loaded for the additional cost they were delicious! The country fried steak had delicious gravy. Portions were large. The guy across from me got a porterhouse steak and it was beautiful.\\n\\nWould recommend to anyone coming through town.\",\"time\":1685194251,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Summer\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101678908066260063328\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV9Rillj3uviuXnefoEiwQh5BCcOJ6sGl_RN-dfOV1VroI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Was craving some good ol\' American food and this place hit the spot. I ordered the patty melt and fries while my guy got a cup of the clam chowder and the famous chicken fried steak with mashed potatoes. The meal was cooked perfectly and hit the spot but also not the very best we have ever had. However, after our piece of chocolate cream pie was dropped off at the table, it was all I could do to not lick the plate after we devoured the huge slice. All in all, the service was great and it was worth a visit.\",\"time\":1686961723,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Eddie Ozols\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100180529626230696303\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW90CLwyMhunGEtgXsJMyHkwReUY1Vps1OnqrdsML9Fiv5U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"One of the best steaks I\'ve ever had. Came exactly as requested medium rare. Service great and interesting environment. The salad was also great\",\"time\":1692596769,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mary G\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100953835342779846666\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUCS6q3ON-ufOaeSnO2ux3omtviKNDqxI0MQuoEQlszfIk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Stopped in on our way to the Grand Canyon- delicious flank steak sandwiches and garlic butter shrimp bowl. The mashed potatoes were superb.\",\"time\":1691267896,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Pam Hull\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115585215965706607783\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIdzUC0Fs422zj6Y1cry1E_zB64hHGJfAjFGSdxzcpa=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Wow!!!! The food here is absolutely fantastic! Service was great. THE best pie we\\u2019re ever had!!! U must get some pie! If ur hungry, look no further!!\",\"time\":1693436615,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":false,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1130\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1130\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"1130\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"1130\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"1130\"}}],\"type\":\"TAKEOUT\",\"weekday_text\":[\"Monday: Closed\",\"Tuesday: 11:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Wednesday: 11:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Thursday: 11:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Friday: 11:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Saturday: 11:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",