th\":1799},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109661593991086010197\\\">Billy Blohm<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjZkXXrYx2FMu89xdYhDvpFLdaNt7G08AGD5UenTM_98iL6zwzx6BiiHSRb4NFP8htNrLX_IGNXRBnARaD6MCv_29Loc0R2koZZEopi5ZdCPI5nFwcV041oOU6Lsz-VKnMIjVTqG31bs1cJDtuZyX9qaauSxgxoced_gWcNaQmqA_Em\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":1868,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111675866356566806137\\\">Marianne Balsiger<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziKgmD_Iyqo68LM4Jk92jUx_WfxyDcQtI3K0VBmIdAOv9Mr5oLRP3Hvi4PUaOxahc7ozdbrKZHe95EdgWgZtvGHX8goqcFbqWgbLb8Fj5jgehwnxF8B720jyTh9d2iUw-djkv_8bcWPbx2h7ZKwdIstPZd_VvYhsBnT_vcb286flFMD\",\"width\":4000},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115038429400306602612\\\">j h<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgK2S9KPf6yingnva-lcWlJkBqIHsFPym2K1lGkZLCSXEquPt2lsp9W0oKVMJdOhlCil8DtEBGbU42-3hE2R-3vVmXaHQT71hF3n2Pr6L9aEhaRjbiWnT9X8Hw9F9cm0hq4sROJMX2ueuJW1LbjLP22HLQ-_neBTpztJINlEFoxuD2i\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJM4I-hB3UNIcRBtuAzIDd6Fw\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"2FVG+42 Kanab, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85992FVG+42\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":4.2,\"reference\":\"ChIJM4I-hB3UNIcRBtuAzIDd6Fw\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Jillian Muinos\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100878705042572357875\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUIIbU53Sq8m-EmHB0xdKTrGqYVHO3vBG4mnd2-a43DiTg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"The medium pizza was HUGE!! Pepperoni , bacon, jalape\\u00f1o. We called in the order and picked it up 30 mins later! Easy and delicious after a long day of traveling\",\"time\":1690682148,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"srideepa banerjee\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101631505283249800166\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVA_ysrDBsa3ygwG7xdx5lVJkmkYrs7LMUVe3I0tvM66p8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"We just stumbled upon this pizza place, and were taken by surprise by the food. We were hungry and looking for place to sit down with kids and eat. First look may come as slightly shady but then the all you can eat buffet for 5.99 takes everything away. There was good variety of pizzas, cinnamon stick and nice simple salad bar. Staff was polite and friendly.\",\"time\":1682867517,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"David Smeeth\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100253071713455177654\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU3lZm6DjHstVRNlkr-KGUHbFdqTrZj43S5DSWv67GKA98=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Sweet small town pizzeria! When we arrived they were busy and short-staffed. Even so, the woman at the counter was kind and polite, answered our questions, and gave us an accurate estimate as to when our food would come out. Yes the atmosphere isn\'t exactly fancy, but perfectly fine for a family dinner. Our meal was yummy. Will definitely return when I am next in Kanab.\",\"time\":1691539238,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Nic Epke\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105207079575479947844\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLehNupoNxDE8iUygHMOq8BQMT3iyZMCyHclQZgXWST=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"The park lot is tiny. There was kind of like a weird old sports theme going on inside. Place could definitely use a makeover. We got a small cheese pizza. Pizza was lacking big time. It seemed generic and bland. I should\'ve got toppings on the pizza to flavor it. However, pizza was cooked perfectly on the bottom. It just had no flavor. Salad from the salad bar was a nice option. Service was fast and friendly.\\n\\nEdit: I\'m changing my review from a 2 to a 4 star based on the buffet. Still not impressed by the pizza but for the price and what\'s available at the lunch buffet, it\'s great!\",\"time\":1677191216,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"John Chen\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103016571910334156246\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKAB0oUogK5nn8mPp1mSSpB0yTSVyojKrlYziO8PVuU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"I got a personal Hawaiian pizza, it was very tasty. Although I waited a while for this pizza. The taste was worth the wait. I commend the front staff on handling all the customers that were waiting. Always had their smiles.\",\"time\":1680569968,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=6694844391342791430\",\"user_ratings_total\":687,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"164 East 300 South, Kanab\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:46','2023-09-19 05:55:46'),(52,'Chuckwagon Cookouts','googleplaces','ChIJE_fRfhjUNIcRX2H5XyUprGM',58,'Unassuming eatery at Little Hollywood offering a basic American menu, plus beer & wine.',8,0.20,NULL,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"O