ATJ83zgUHy8YXVmpNIqSh1E5rRfhgAPHTpf3TsbsDOIeENZVB_afJoYfSTRlGZmt3flo7BCfhc7h0UIfiET2o1ijJnBTkscsYHDUs2FNzCKhQX6MGdtxXWFDjYD9_h0fwG4wvQV4aDDeGEWeO7XeKN4Gzftio7RzI8A24fRHGQmkp1fWnnCA\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":2268,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109178407523561001476\\\">Tim Robinson<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zicZDmjH6D-z49kfwBiDOEHpgJtd9nrzTGkHtqef0VTNPGtp6_A6WWBjVZU9d19le1rEmeBZzlbuWuaBdkK2FT_reWGcKrjdIMHwJECYpYpv-wHCvyGysaiE5vfHfaZNhWA8zusP9wakVVw83inJhd1At3hIi6UJHrvBYKG-P0hvuBs\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":2268,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105738101823329049651\\\">R. Hab<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziL0gWSEx2thjEwSjUPVoDG_kKcO42MylgfKGfWiEFs_vJyY4Mt4xzJ5tbT-6s5mLedzd6orHfIaqo-FlXrzxXUwotH2pNHOsFbkYA4QrALoCyVKaUIO7MUXZJNLw8jhP_eTYkwZSM8RRRT6c8tLyUugWMcjRP5vbGvS1RKfebJUWUw\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":4000,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112897634547269617968\\\">Michael Anderson<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zj-ZWrXbifpYgeIiLvW6w_mkGB2-mtblrYHD1MsLF7wHjHDJNP-8hbOzdKqiAH_J-MGcZ5wbS_JO7BSExb30BypWEfzpSGsy-2R4wTCrbKcMnvtpUMAnOTQ_aBMG02wlS0I7HngL4uV4zeNP6Pc9Fe7H7odbdBy9Z_rlIJwm315IFdg\",\"width\":3000},{\"height\":2250,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104172065911495738064\\\">Glenn Bishop<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgEy588EO_Jpkn6BHpk4DpFiMYE84wR8zX6G6soALjPHwVd-pAloj18HeOrLNOPsEQ9hh6WzPIex1gVlTlExYcPo1HBbht2XwJEosM2v_g2id012GdADsO8L_HKSMAT4u3VyVePqxi6R3azx_2sSYadT5ytVEF3cHp3MpNb4vopRg66\",\"width\":4000}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJe2jaqx_UNIcRCyZz7yuBOgw\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"2FXF+23 Kanab, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85992FXF+23\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.1,\"reference\":\"ChIJe2jaqx_UNIcRCyZz7yuBOgw\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Samantha Anasky\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112584287779589498085\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV24n_HK3lJZ7-aNRVLbvaSDgT0b2sO6rbVnTDNe4EiNw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"My mom and I decided to stop here on a whim while staying in Kanab, UT during a 10 day road trip.\\n\\nThe decor and surrounding area of the restaurant is really cool and honestly kids would absolutely love the area. It is a very old-western vibe with many different picture opportunity locations!\\n\\nThe server seemed to have the entire restaurant, but he was friendly and attentive. We ordered the Frank Sinatra burger which was okay, but the brisket on top of the burger was dry. So, overall the food was okay, but not the best burger we have had.\\n\\nWe, honestly, were more impressed with the service (server and kitchen staff) who took orders for a table of at least 12+ and had their food out in less than 20 minutes, exactly as it was ordered!\\n\\nOverall, this is a great place to come in such a small town, has a great atmosphere and vibe, and you won\'t be disappointed!\",\"time\":1692310083,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"EatDrink TravelReview\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102145797066074664636\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVn2Vcwg-6ncA_-147alixcFPD7DAlhEOIvQ2TziIAXKA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"We passed by here as a family of 7 coming from Page heading to Zion & onto vegas. The food was brilliant. For me the Brisket platter was a winner with really soft, juicy melt in your mouth meat. The portion sizes for the rest of the dishes were huge as well. Shoutout to the lone guy who took our order and was taking care of the restaurant.\\nNice souvenir shop next door as well.\",\"time\":1692455782,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Phil Dade\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112281634120594906853\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVZxmjoWYGTslrt0aeFa8NbnarkT03Fc1dyPuDWZNo4t9s=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Best spot for ribs in Kanab!\\n\\nWhen we drive to St George from Arizona, always go out of our way to hit Iron Horse!  Very fun atmosphere and can\\u2019t go wrong with the Cattle Drive platter!  The black pepper ribs are a 10!  And love the bacon chicken breast!\\n\\nHighly recommend!\",\"time\":1685571776,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tony Brock\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102139549409894331475\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWsUGVyDo0kCSYwqM-XwWMpQOGu8EJbH4hykDeKZTUhtBbH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Just passing through town and had dinner here with the family. The Ribeye was really delicious. The family rated the sirloin, Mac & cheese and burger pretty well too. Service was good and the atmosphere was very casual. There was karaoke going outside on this Sat night. Hilarious raccoon card game set up the middle of the place.\",\"time\":1688935567,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Seth Varner (Wandermore Publishing LLC)\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105180376581691624400\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWT8H95ksQgEyUwtiUMfobiCjnReHGhsBG-YmZFSf6t3g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Amazing food and atmosphere here! It\\u2019s a busy place during the summertime so expect to wait in line to get in, or make a reservation ahead of time. We ended up having to wait almost an hour and a half to get a table because they had to accommodate for a group of 35 people, but the kitchen stayed open past 9pm to ensure that us and others still got fed. They even offered free dessert because they felt bad (although we didn\\u2019t end up taking them up on it cause we were so full)! The food was well worth the wait. I opted for the cattle drive platter which consisted of Monterey chicken breast, smoked ribs, mashed potatoes, and fries. I couldn\\u2019t finish it all but I would still highly recommend trying it and taking home the leftovers! Be sure to catch a photo of the poker game on your way out of the restaurant.\",\"time\":1685299216,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=881158702805231115\",\"user_ratings_total\":1371,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"78 East Center Street, Kanab\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.ironhorsekanab.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:47','2023-09-19 05:55:47'),(54,'The Dining Room at Parry Lodge','googleplaces','ChIJf_DPi0bVNIcRgcdPi5gxk0g',60,NULL,8,0.20,0,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.04847850000001,\"lng\":-112.5269538},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.04964803029151,\"lng\":-112.5256693697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.04695006970851,\"lng\":-112.5283673302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",