erent textures and flavors. Like who knew that microgreens would go with dessert? But it totally works! Note, they don\'t serve alcohol, but I know they\'ve been trying to get a liquor license for a few months, so hopefully that will go through soon!\",\"time\":1694663776,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Cameron Gibson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115931466171026443762\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLGcmeHX0skG3a1GhAu_G8sCDBN5o33D-9EnRkRH1-q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Food was excellent! The charcuterie board was a great appetizer and the Bison and halibut were cooked just right with amazing flavor.\",\"time\":1692408303,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sophie Marenne\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109901446297039686110\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocImnGtbloGVgRo-3Hzco5_Ia1m1Ud8kqHxJ3jyrEh5f=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Greatest cuisine we had during our journey from San Francisco to Salt Lake City. Meat was perfectly cooked, vegetables were divine too, spices choices were bold but adequate, and everything was super fresh. Unfortunately no alcoholic beverages but there are plenty of other creative options. I 100% recommend that place.\",\"time\":1692186884,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Barbara Williamson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100376361090895133016\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWBTlhY27rKBXDdaDHEvMrb9difKGrGmcKjYDtswZCsgDg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Outstanding. Overlooked. I am shocked how few people know that Parry\\u2019s Lodge has extraordinary food with prices comparable to the other high-end restaurants in Kanab. Elk & bison burgers at lunch with killer old-school steak fries. Excellent entrees at night. Do yourself a favor & eat here.\",\"time\":1692734118,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Cristina meoni\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111352106452655399673\\/reviews\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW-6TUrLGlGbDzG35k_tWf8bBI93naH_ODjgrmhrrlc3g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"\",\"time\":1692314087,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=5229578123549329281\",\"user_ratings_total\":5,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"89 East Center Street, Kanab\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.parrylodge.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:47','2023-09-19 05:55:47'),(55,'Brown Box Bakeshop','googleplaces','ChIJnwm2gpjVNIcRcjbYBFZU6H8',61,NULL,8,0.20,NULL,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.0479974,\"lng\":-112.5276307},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.0494125302915,\"lng\":-112.5263860697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.0467145697085,\"lng\":-112.5290840302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Brown Box Bakeshop\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":false},\"photos\":[{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps