JONu1SCwI0dkf8gQJOHbIP2fFppAw\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJnwm2gpjVNIcRcjbYBFZU6H8\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"2FXC+5W Kanab, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85992FXC+5W\"},\"rating\":4.9,\"reference\":\"ChIJnwm2gpjVNIcRcjbYBFZU6H8\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Billy Bob\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100296467773238516802\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJb10Ji2BOrD2XHXMuSJA_VK_IPXmK7xSsuC2euLv0k=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Absolutely loved this place. Great spot for picking up food after hiking with some awesome healthy options. Dare I say it, they even have fantastic biodegradable to-go containers that I haven\'t seen before. Very well thought out place with such good food. The grilled cheeses were delicious and had such a great fusion of flavors (we got the jalapeno one and the one with rosemary. So yummy). The tomato basil soup was fantastic with such a full flavor. The salads were also remarkable and the dressing wasn\'t overpowering. The cookie and ice cream dessert was remarkable and a better version of a pizooki. The cookie was so fluffy and the ice cream was decadent. Their caramel and chocolate sauce was home made and so flavorful as well. Definitely deserves 5 stars and all my business whenever I come through town again. Service was phenomenal and very friendly as well. Such a great place!\",\"time\":1684295805,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tara Ryan\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118212663582611797446\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWzFcHdYjV1tf2BtGKw4Bcyae7UpfN-uBjH-v8kFHF4TT0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"We stopped in for some grilled cheese and cookies. We had the Popper and the Gourmet and both were very cheesy with the right amount of pull and lots of flavour.\\n\\nThe cookies were soft and delicious.\\n\\nThere\\u2019s a mixture of seating including couches, tall tables and patio seating too. Relaxed vibes and very cosy. They have a gift shop here too.\",\"time\":1694544364,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jeremy Cowdell\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116491231935635407192\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWn6IOuCAX41gRLZYF3zttvqWmE2biBP-tfm9YzZJgD166c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Excellent experience and food today. This place has some amazing homemade ice cream. We also enjoyed the grilled cheese sandwhiches in a combo with homemade cookies.\\n\\nDifferent flavored grilled cheese such as My Jam and sour dough bread are available too. Many different cup cakes, cookies, and cinnamon rolls, too. Going back for the skillet cookie and ice cream.\",\"time\":1685735265,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"James Price\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101786574889535785878\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUUAjjQEyFM5c8f1pEWPV0avhkkoqQSxrBFZIAy6iEZOHCp=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"This is my go-to stop on the way to Lake Powell! Their ice cream, grilled cheese, and soups are delicious! The ambiance is well designed, service is friendly and fast, and they have lots of cool souvenirs and things as well.\",\"time\":1691948385,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"lati mom\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115330840808643325889\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIAbIFYRZCt2fhrM-3HGQgdbN_o4B7MWE5UwbUUM0wL=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"This is such a fun & yummy place! They\\u2019re so friendly. The decor is fun & the food was perfect! The menu was very simple: grilled cheese, soups, salads, desserts. We tried the classic grilled cheese, tomato basil soup & the savory salad. Everything was perfect! We definitely want to go back for ice cream!\",\"time\":1679265439,\"translated\":false}],\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"bakery\",\"cafe\",\"restaurant\",\"store\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=9216709365838919282\",\"user_ratings_total\":176,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"42 East Center Street, Kanab\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/brownboxkanab.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:47','2023-09-19 05:55:47'),(56,'FUSION HOUSE','googleplaces','ChIJO7-CDR_UNIcRn7X3MpOY9qw',62,'Small, unfussy eatery offering Pan-Asian specialties, with vegan options, plus beer & wine.',15,0.20,NULL,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.04799310000001,\"lng\":-112.528069},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.04950998029151,\"lng\":-112.5267874197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.04681201970851,\"lng\":-112.5294853802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"FUSION HOUSE\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":false},\"photos\":[{\"height\":2268,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108286490806240703988\\\">Matt Zerfas<\\/a>\"]