UNIcRn7X3MpOY9qw\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"2FXC+5Q Kanab, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85992FXC+5Q\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.1,\"reference\":\"ChIJO7-CDR_UNIcRn7X3MpOY9qw\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Dr. J\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102722343318335441646\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXcQcQWNlW33WDc7L--LGcHuamJ9g9Pvar32YwYGptOQyY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"We had saut\\u00e9ed tofu and saut\\u00e9ed beef. Portions were large, but the saut\\u00e9ed tofu on the Mandarin menu was misinterpreted. Not too many choice of Chinese food in town. So this may be a good one.\",\"time\":1693594500,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Courtney Drew\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107406080578002079697\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjX6hw0gPazzGnEuAny5qlr6tvi4qMpku3LomuWLmnYisw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"We had the Orange chicken medium spicy and the Kung Pao Chicken also medium spicy. Both were excellent with fresh veggies and helpful staff. Would Absolutely recommend.\",\"time\":1684550541,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kelly Hogeland\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103309163311871160928\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIo-FLJFKreCOtbRHxM9rTfgTOvZ-oSbDIgA-0fHV-q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"12 months ago\",\"text\":\"Great place to eat! It is a little on the pricey side but I feel like it\\u2019s quality food. I liked that they asked what level of spice you wanted. We got the General Tso combo $20 and I got Orange Chicken entree which came with rice. They carry pepsi products with free refills but had coke and Dr Pepper in a can which was $2. We each received about 3-3.5 cups of chicken which is enough for left overs!\",\"time\":1663849301,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Natalie Wysocki\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101138492042975616990\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXugbzupdp6ulCRORN2ClSJ2n437WmuEVixVbhqlib_CL4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"Had a great meal here. I was with a party of 9 people, we ordered a couple of apps, and everyone was happy with their entrees. Wait staff was attentive and friendly, even though we came in about an hour before closing. The sizzling beef actually came out sizzling!\",\"time\":1633235098,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Hey Rae\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109393457757583326106\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJfbB7tlv2NS1BMt9x5O7UlO_AR2fUjv8NkdFreYBa8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"Amazing food, big portions and great service! They had a full house and were still able to get out out group if fives food in a good time. Once again will and have been recommending it to anyone that ask of a good place to eat in kanab. Every single time it\'s great. Not once has the food changed or been bad. Amazing service and amazing food.\",\"time\":1676597045,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":false,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\