e},{\"author_name\":\"E. Pena\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104221554706243435195\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIU35_h6oAfIMHVgSwqcjftlhv4UNQNt9_mtYtNhmwXEw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Very inviting, visiting out state let me in 5 mins before they open. Thanks for the hospitality!\",\"time\":1692898188,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Brandonn L.\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115599421249672425145\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU54kUm1K8tTHTrWj1Y7YpxUQXfsK_rYiXiM9preTyGEvM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"Came by here a week ago cause I was craving pizza and saw on google maps that there was a Little Ceasars in Page which was a short drive from my motel so I decided to come by here and grab a pizza. First of all this place was very short staffed and then they had no pizzas of any kind that were hot and ready. I also decided to go ahead and order a regular pepperoni pizza since I was told it would be a 20 minute wait which I wasn\'t in a big hurry. Well turns out it took over 30 minutes from the time I came in to the time I finally got my pizza which was unacceptable. The prices too were higher than most of the other Little Ceasars locations i\'ve been to. I could of easily went to Pizza Hut which wasn\'t too far from here and spent a few extra bucks on a larger pizza and got it faster than I got mine here!! I will say the location is good and at least my pizza was fresh which i\'ll give them that. Unless you don\'t mind waiting a ridiculous amount of time for your order I do not reccomend this pizza joint!! Pizza Hut is way better!\",\"time\":1676512429,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":false,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"meal_delivery\",\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=3041796619314578226\",\"user_ratings_total\":190,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"57 South Lake Powell Boulevard, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/littlecaesars.com\\/en-us\\/store\\/7317\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:48','2023-09-19 05:55:53'),(58,'Subway','googleplaces','ChIJ1z-AA6VsNIcRPPC1eaeMbA0',64,'Casual counter-serve chain for build-your-own sandwiches & salads, with health-conscious options.',10,0.20,NULL,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.90731299999999,\"lng\":-111.4811466},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.90874228029149,\"lng\":-111.4797876697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.90604431970849,\"lng\":-111.4824856302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Subway\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107319522787289278932\\\">Bryan Cruikshank<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zh6irn52bi4VyRCTmaWMdGggHWayhacwehk47ti_IezkUQf2HbO7MeZtzUC-GTo6Jd-W2UHwdgZ44E-ZJZfobm8f1Oysea6jHRjQW2asWoExQzneQOa4xX4ZOsuOBUlTU1VReTP2gGptVwpl-DBof4drk61FkXUxOZHwGKmytOW3oss\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ1z-AA6VsNIcRPPC1eaeMbA0\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WG49+WG Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWG49+WG\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJ1z-AA6VsNIcRPPC1eaeMbA0\",