\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109882023585907545362\\\">Ms Benally<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgQVeLMwEAEibz39J2uM4LhHL9XSPQNN_U0VOZGy-QN4q0WfAV657fwjrukWRMkKbR2OY5M0REKzc6mxW7FS2cteZtb_5hMcEsMkNeSxwr3HXyBLnCGVkC7wJImhkBfJqNrSs81VF_yJ6Nax2iSFKwg7Qt1Lb5lYsvpGe02kVLR8nsS\",\"width\":2268}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ1z-AA6VsNIcRPPC1eaeMbA0\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WG49+WG Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWG49+WG\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJ1z-AA6VsNIcRPPC1eaeMbA0\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Kurt Kamperschroer\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106231408426874177385\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXbAUmZI7KOmRnx4lqG4Bow_LQjKYZXTbQb1gc6YBoKJQ4a=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"One of the rudest servers I ever met. Attitude plenty. Is seemed it was a pain to have to wait on us.  The previous couple was foreign and she was extremely rude to them. They looked afraid. Even a request to cut out sub in half was met with sighs and eye rolls   She should but have a job here.\",\"time\":1694806054,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Ms Benally\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109882023585907545362\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIhpH0mq_UQJyzk-UzMO45G2dS8ZN5iZ7Lfb3rAVCTD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"For our end of 2nd semester celebrations we ordered 2 platters with all the toppings on the side. The students loved it. Was all gone they were hungry as well. Thank you for getting our order out on time.\",\"time\":1639889553,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Vasu Sureja\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113563544111354839198\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXQNmJSRYr4Ar1JQZ8a4WKKI3f9EQom1p4yNhD8Ot6I5BE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"I dont have an option for zero star. Very rude subway maker lady. Clearly felt, she was very racist. Well-educated customers are not dumb like these staff members irrespective of their races. First, teach them how to treat your customers nicely, then let them serve. Will definitely complain.\",\"time\":1681864695,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Conner Romney\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103167984784903123761\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUhXg7uRihaDdnThqMpgxrXp42BF2q_rGe3EhsVwVYoIwnU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"We walked inside at around 7:20 last night and the first thing the employee says to us is that their lobby is closed and that we can\'t eat inside? I would understand if it was closer to closing time but 40 minutes is little excessive. They then gave us attitude the entire time we ordered our sandwich. While ordering they asked what we wanted and we told her and then they moved it over to wrap it up and before they did we asked to add green peppers and the employee let out a big sigh, scooted the sandwich back to the vegetables and goes \\\"Ok, you want ANYTHING else on your sandwich?!\\\" Super rude attitude that was not needed from a place that\'s known for letting you build your own sandwich. I understand if someone has had a rough day at work and wants to be done, but if an attitude makes it all the way to the customer then I feel something should be adjusted on your end.\",\"time\":1680122928,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Rainer Fehling\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111325954353751201856\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLoWCu8pjE_gey8DUHVQGN8TF0VGtkQi9m6Kw29Jbtk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Food as expected. But the service was below zero. Unfriendly lady there pushing despite the fact that we were struggling a bit with language barrier. Speed doesn\\u2019t help! And we did not really slow down the whole business, as we were first and last in line!\",\"time\":1689198159,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=967302670907207740\",\"user_ratings_total\":237,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"813 State Highway 89A Suite A9, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.com\\/united-states\\/az\\/page\\/813-state-highway-89a?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=6379&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ5MTM0NzktNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:49','2023-09-19 05:55:53'),(59,'Dam Bar & Grille','googleplaces','ChIJi6wzj68UNIcRh9sFZcbtRNQ',65,'Traditional American dishes & beer served in a Glen Canyon Dam-inspired bar & grill.',15,0.20,NULL,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.9176827,\"lng\":-111.4599282},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.9191225302915,\"lng\":-111.4586062197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.9164245697085,\"lng\":-111.4613041802915}}},