Jenny was our waitress, and she did an amazing job. I definitely recommend trying this place. The cocktails were fire, and the food was delicious.\",\"time\":1694224301,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Teresa Gildersleeve\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108210727427354160328\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXe1c_5dHNPe7Tw57bZJ5Ns73Co_vAqNqfhUI18-7JxDu0w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"We headed here because we saw a T-shirt advertising it on a man at the Grand Canyon. Glad we came, we were quickly seated on the patio and our server rocked! I had the Cod Tacos and hubby order the blue cheese burger. All very delicious. Service was great. We had to stop in the gift shop to get our own Dam Bar T shirt.\",\"time\":1683047784,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Eva Britton\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115991398889618417370\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVLZY9OrsPXbJJ3w_TbyspphtcPycWuqSkFjNAKvh4axZQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"We had a great waiter. Service was fast and the food was very good! We loved the atmosphere here. The waiter made me an amazing margarita! Got cheesecake to go.\",\"time\":1680701445,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Rachel Moose\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105951132834517610661\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV_omDwqoBQI61DxVWHEEZgvJF6SaR0zcCxLEwy-FCfR9Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Ate here last night with my husband & two friends. We had excellent service & really enjoyed the food. We shared the potato skins & pretzel sticks\\u2014both yummy, but especially the pretzels. For dinner I had the bacon & bleu burger with fries. Very good!\",\"time\":1684799383,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kevin Perron\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115335416308458274594\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU1xVAAKFxe2brYiwXcydfzLOr6tyGo4-Uaw_I9jPnW724=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Excellent service, some of the best tasting Margaritas i\'ve ever had and food was amazing... the steak was top 10 in my book.\",\"time\":1694389128,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"bar\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=15295611670811237255\",\"user_ratings_total\":1770,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"644 North Navajo Drive, Page\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.damplaza.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:49','2023-09-19 05:55:53'),(60,'Ranch House Grille','googleplaces','ChIJBQp0W7sUNIcRMID1tYbl4dE',66,'Basic American eatery known for dishing out homestyle breakfast faves, plus chicken fried steak.',10,0.20,NULL,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.9206522,\"lng\":-111.4580608},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.9219834802915,\"lng\":-111.4569365197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.9192855197085,\"lng\":-111.4596344802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place