/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107362741330273590079\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWxc1x67zramSrUmKCBPK1FqirJ3kOEACZLVrEe8LsMGV4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"The burger and the sweet potato fries were the best! The homemade salsa was awesome too. The rest of our food was very tasty but the burger was a stand out! The regular fries were just okay, they were a little under done.\",\"time\":1680469291,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Daniel Korman\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108003801829340349475\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVbXg5SnS9_Cp0W8MXITDehzDmlM7eyo3yCAO_aj5wt0g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"The food was definitely fresh, delicious and reasonably priced. This is a nice family run joint with a robust menu and great service. I would stop again.\",\"time\":1691371270,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Alicia J\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116739932484545775500\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWKW-P1Hy_PpzSSIuUUsgjWqw6hv03Wvdg0OE-urRbQ3dKY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"8 months ago\",\"text\":\"Great little breakfast place. Staff is attentive and knowledgeable. My order of eggs, bacon, hash browns and toast came exactly as ordered and perfect. The breakfast burrito was hearty and delicious. The meat omelette was not skimpy with the fillings and really good. The French toast was what you can expect from French toast. Overall a decent experience and I would come back.\",\"time\":1672115310,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Vincent Watson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111701775234433504294\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJ84pz2e7r02VeoZmAhqAE7m9bcuTcXYqNb3PGxMTF6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Nice place in Page.  Breakfast & lunch available all hours.\\n\\nStaff are friendly, service is fast.  Food quite tasty.\",\"time\":1685827218,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=15123621390427979824\",\"user_ratings_total\":1756,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"819 North Navajo Drive, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.ranchhouse-grille.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:49','2023-09-19 05:55:53'),(61,'Subway','googleplaces','ChIJG5fWAldrNIcRF_oIyBSV5Wg',67,'Casual counter-serve chain for build-your-own sandwiches & salads, with health-conscious options.',10,0.20,NULL,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.9048123,\"lng\":-111.4872417},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.9059191802915,\"lng\":-111.4856852697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.9032212197085,\"lng\":-111.4883832302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Subway\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":1080,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/cont