ogle.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113469435656467725083\\\">Falguni Roy<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zj3cK2kQYgQPbz2uniz3snEUKYibo--D4HTjBLxFI2sJJA6L68io_KsrgUy1_bP5Rl9wmdEy9NYmyZLdffT3RDNzPPsxsitF8sknCHYi1gARYTTItXnFC33O4LtORtjbVvgSGmyZLwszjXeioNOd74MqBmvFbOxQZkIUbmoZ1VZ71k-\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":2576,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106274346654331001174\\\">Rebecca Wagener<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhLlA2Gy1Ay13M1pxldl4a2wSmSYRYLNROS3AyDHaDyBepNgnz4Fv0euKYf8GgNejGKOPPxYZh2lwNYKIVQn7ID-9_DvxY-zQ3Vy5NsnOvpb3L7U9rJ_nEurphKWnaz4fqh9A59p4Sk2QJXEhyTz4PwULz2sTe9BzA8gT8xNvFtDHcV\",\"width\":1932}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJG5fWAldrNIcRF_oIyBSV5Wg\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WG37+W4 Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWG37+W4\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":2.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJG5fWAldrNIcRF_oIyBSV5Wg\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Connor\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111899012424858707924\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVYz-jNlSYIvJiSDYoIQRRCylqyOWKYgdtyFELPwPDoTVw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"In a nutshell:\\n\\\"Hey, just wondering what\'s on the chicken club pizza?\\\"\\n\\\"Uh, I dunno.....sausage.......\\\"\\n\\\"Okay, can we get it without sausage, please?\\\"\\n\\\"There isn\'t sausage on it.\\\"\\n\\\".....\\\"\\n\\nEnded up with a pizza without toppings we really wanted. All we were told was the ONE topping NOT on it. Our fault for asking what was on it, I guess?\\n\\nGenuinely thought we were on a show like Impractical Jokers. It\'s comical how little any of these people care about their jobs. I can\'t even be that mad. This whole experience made a funny story. The manager listening to video game compilations on his phone in the middle of the dining room was a great ambiance.\\n\\nSeriously though, go literally anywhere else. If you already went through it, then just know you\'re not alone. Everyone else had the same experience (:\",\"time\":1685505385,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"amos sookraj\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116706188343892801756\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXOftl_XSrEUexCxIVLDjuAEBbeB06twc6LpRfDEtUcuA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Waited 5 mins for staff to realize we were there.  Then instead of walking my son through his order the worker was rude cause he didn\'t specify bread.  We walked out, no business for them.\",\"time\":1691620736,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Pranav Chaporkar\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110268103367176741981\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW-tUEpR2w2JJmYUHJLFfmYwJxPHw-kJedESWmQ3Icgcbg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Title: Disappointing Customer Service Experience\\n\\nRating: \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\n\\nReview:\\n\\nI recently had a sub-par experience at this establishment. The individuals working behind the counter seemed unwilling to assist with even the simplest requests. To make matters worse, I was left waiting at the counter for an extended period of time before they finally emerged from the back room.\\n\\nWhen I politely asked for an extra bag, the server\'s reaction was completely disproportionate, as if I had requested something completely unreasonable like her own kidney. It was a disheartening encounter that left me with a sour impression.\\n\\nI strongly advise avoiding this place at all costs. Instead, I would recommend visiting the nearby McDonald\'s across the road, where the service is far more reliable and welcoming.\",\"time\":1684436781,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Karlee Jarvis\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103292235815901209107\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJfvNsj1SOd41cHOFtgXWDiiqZyjqsvbvIeuxpoYwZs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"My mother and I and my 3 kids came in for lunch before shopping. The cashier immediately had a standoffish rude attitude towards my mother and refused to speak to her directly, instead only speaking to the kids. When my mother asked her what comes with the kids meal she said \\u201cI\\u2019ll tell you in a minute\\u201d she then proceeded to refuse speaking to us. She was only rude to us! The other people in front or behind were fine. This was an extremely concerning experience and we felt very singled out. My BLT sandwich was given to me with FROZEN bacon. Won\\u2019t be coming back here anytime soon. Corporate needs to check out how this location is managed.\",\"time\":1687805083,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jono Williams\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103238140612604699281\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVWl_I9Dr5g1lUCYpr8aOdzr87i2J0wTT453TxU7hpiPg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Just like everyone else here, the level of service was so bad I felt like they should of tipped me for being such a good customer while they were extremely rude.\\n\\nANYTHING ELSE\\nI\\u2019ve never heard anyone tell this word so much so fast so angrily\",\"time\":1693941289,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=7558611466099161623\",\"user_ratings_total\":127,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"1017 Haul Road, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.com\\/united-states\\/az\\/page\\/1017-haul-rd?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=38561&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ5MDk1NTQtNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:50','2023-09-19 05:55:54'),(62,'The Bowl','googleplaces','ChIJ46Sb17oUNIcRjSDATAABfpQ',68,'Old-school recreation center with bowling & billiards, plus a simple bar & grill with familiar grub.',10,0.20,0,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.9197082,\"lng\":-111.4606323},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.92094708029151,\"lng\":-111.4593367197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.91824911970851,\"lng\":-111.4620346802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/bar-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/bar_pinlet\",\"name\":\"The Bowl\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":3856,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109470575604113442542\\\">Mariann Millsaps<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zg07GejpwEbdWGq1qkQhr4g6draAEe3wG5_37kSq_oPlMLf_23VCnlHOVRMKH-dMCOH6wjJ41kofj7clXB_vke_z1wWxibtFz5Qd1e_n14FqGKO9Tvykl70MQnMiVU-Rte4B9h7HLv7Iip3RnLXqM2hlSuON5RV0G3JGXut19SgQ4jC\",\"width\":6656}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ46Sb17oUNIcRjSDATAABfpQ\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WG9Q+VP Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWG9Q+VP\"},\"price_level\":1,\