36,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108260161334404335991\\\">James Begay<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjMKG0lWKwx212d0HqfG2s90fx_JDoF9-G2phwekK06WtwEHSdrNeucv1mJQsceu-zFpv7Q3jtIDUoZBT0v_EI2rVIKF7LAWT2ksOJRL5DX1KcEhibihrEMNqV5MG-ybJ6NMPoTX2InNlhqQzBbl5IhVhbw5CBqEt0l9IUcxE20l0Mh\",\"width\":2560},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105210768901632170204\\\">Laurent DIDIER<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziri3ApqKNatzb1Bvc_hmBqgpzMW9yCoeKuIafLav9QnTJERQTYPPatmPGZ4hGrx4rJxzPRZkoomvwdc0DYSQIockpbsTGsd41A438TdYJgke9LPTov87HD-g0bC4k5U7oSKFN08khTH3ivKy9GU9sZteDN02BIg-p9WBPVG8KPQEuJ\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ46Sb17oUNIcRjSDATAABfpQ\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WG9Q+VP Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWG9Q+VP\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":4,\"reference\":\"ChIJ46Sb17oUNIcRjSDATAABfpQ\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Martin Boer\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101518247041827823828\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJru_9bCBEueJYOFNYhSre-AP99ldc6KMx5Tv0ouM-j=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"If you want to experience a real local club where bowling is the main activity but after ten it turns into a nightclub. The locals are present and friendly and the service was excellent. As a family we loved the game en ambiance which made the holiday just a bit more special.\",\"time\":1690745450,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sash G\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111765260689166287804\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWJ4rPS7X9SmOtJ7AgYHGFdN6SxpSAJrdrzhIraXwiuxw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"One of the best bars I\'ve ever went to. Prices are good, you can use a bowling area from ~1968 or play pool billiard. I liked the digital jukebox, too. Play some good music and you\'ll get in touch with the locals quickly. Have a basket of fries for 5$, there extremely good as well.\\nPlease don\'t expect a fancy bar you\'d find in the cities - it\'s old, basic and down-to-earth, how it should be.\",\"time\":1686416831,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Michelle White\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106951841996448270965\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKxh9MvMtT2YoizeJN_dtpIQIYpPYAHnIY6YT5RsG4O=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Nice bartenders, friendly people. Good drinks.\\nRetro bowling.\",\"time\":1684264417,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jeff Jordan\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100070577687986305304\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVYzROYGnjc0I5Bw8A_MCpog1IjRHhk5YGsWpMKlaH-k84=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Friendly staffs and people.  Great foods!  BUT\\u2026\\u2026Price is too expensive for my son to bowl 6 games like $30-$36.  One time, my son bowled 2 hours, I was surprised that they charged my son $120.  I learned a lesson. I prefer to go to bowling alley in Phoenix - only charged my son $15 for 2 hours - kids package.\",\"time\":1686370099,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Hole Mates\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113929967215039112757\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXsyrave2cyzQ6H2M3u7Xc77yqrJbAJU9tUeUxP_Fw5pas=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"Bowling alley is cool and post apocalyptic. There is a large possibly fiberglass sailfish on the wall. There is a small karaoke speaker  playing tears for fears \\\" everybody wants to rule the world\\\" at this given moment. Pitcher of blue moon was 15 bucks. It\'s open on Sundays until 1am. The door is difficult to find so try all of the doors... there was a car with a skeleton on the hood parked precariously close behind a monster truck in the parking lot.\",\"time\":1650865221,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":false,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"bowling_alley\",\"bar\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=10699990865478164621\",\"user_ratings_total\":320,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"24 North Lake Powell Boulevard, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/pages\\/The-Bowl\\/161822203956986\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:50','2023-09-19 05:55:54'),(63,'Denny\'s','googleplaces','ChIJ6chmi7QUNIcRj_5eWbkSfUQ',69,'Casual diner chain dishing up classic American comfort fare, including all-day breakfast favorites.',10,0.20,1,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.923345,\"lng\":-111.4726295},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.9247103802915,\"lng\":-111.4713951697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.9220124197085,\"lng\":-111.4740931302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/res