ns1AwPXFRWIts2BZGAlTRBNQcf1eaYw-8EAAoRIdYukFaZaSGEIUrI\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3072,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102990854037521004644\\\">Andy Mai<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgmL7xnsLdOGND1xlAlRxxVTmxkPpArYS87LYrB9RdWo1KhLJ9KN3ar5ESFE97ogkAcAOmb6Mqpjdqx4s43pafHelwzjes8nbb6rqFCRiKQtZxetmoFppiTH5lGoBMCe4ic3jdIPoOU2sgExST2i3tU-GggItyaJtQ6vzkgC6nbBr7S\",\"width\":4080},{\"height\":720,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117461860942472634262\\\">Denny&#39;s<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zi44qFCp-N0ACHhfuGVTLZk405ZqTdpHLYV8NPoYqRSRbSudSHlnieYxPygxq_5VlwIDlCnunp7AV3O3NNVpxeMBc4LTYIY0LWnQ9r3zJQ3Tscbn09RDEAzAqhmKAuf6RxoCfKcfEyiobzmRnW9h68GebHYGzM68jU0-EQhzKRfdzHc\",\"width\":720},{\"height\":2976,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118264980178123439499\\\">Martin Edel<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhr-Rqg9Gk7X6SuQvlwTXHYLL59TBgeuaerg_59wwZx33FB_WEVh5WfsS-rt3x16Z3vrZcT7W7tOm4Xl6BKTIfqCgufQGAMBLj80dTmCqIu0zXecaH3O5Y7Btbz1mHvHspLG5BaEkXJ_oJPHiESbVNY--bp78owhxyGpdMz6h0NXbV3\",\"width\":3968}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ6chmi7QUNIcRj_5eWbkSfUQ\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WGFG+8W Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWGFG+8W\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.4,\"reference\":\"ChIJ6chmi7QUNIcRj_5eWbkSfUQ\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"T M\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105462493892895047495\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKMEo-yMPGmTbRWHL8USpmEEe43d0463UCK_otwrs1D=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"It\'s 2pm on Friday afternoon and the place is moderately busy. My scrambled eggs were hot and fluffy, the bacon crisp but not burnt, the Meaty Melt which is beef brisket on toast was tasty. Service was good. Place was clean.\",\"time\":1688766158,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Oana Gaidan\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112015745380732540595\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWZuqbF0ql9n_dHOAjzDwgs_KSClCogRfBTnuj4GF010ds=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"The server was terrible and the food was burned . The server was so bored  looking when we told her  she forgot our order,never asked us if we need anything or thanked us.She got our drinks orders wrong as well. Absolutely no personalty at all. No smile no thank you. She just throwed  the check on the table when we wanted to get some desert  for the wedding anniversary celebration.. It was humiliating. We were 14 of us, more than half our food was burned.\\nTerrible customer service and manners.\\n\\nThis is not the Denny\'s that i remember!Never going back!\",\"time\":1659242103,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Eli Ben Ari\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117229088145483686869\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXIPam1N0KnPhO7LbZwwWw4yJZV6aTknibrgvwa-kOVM_S_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"I wasn\'t sure if this place deserved a 2 star just because the service was THAT bad, but the food was pretty good.\\nIt took about 20 minutes until we were seated and another 30 minutes wait just to pay the bill!!! There was one waitress on the whole place.\",\"time\":1682277390,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"A T\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110678197179454533023\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVUZ-W9kxFj9RuNTzoGBLI9h7AJCmjyjaQa7MP_YC2Yyvww=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"The T bone steak wasn\\u2019t great and \\u201cmedium\\u201d was more like \\u201cwell done\\u201d. The lags and was a better option. Grilled cheese sandwich with potato soup was ok. Oreo shake yummy.\",\"time\":1684471062,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Andy Mai\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102990854037521004644\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWch4QtQFMmQd6qMb5sBG_lbjS_GanaPQSB5HfU9n1P1Go=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"8 months ago\",\"text\":\"Well, if you are into steak, they have the best food for the price. Hand out. The price ridiculously cheap for a hot tourist spot. We had great sirloin and order Togo extra for our road trip. The parking is big and the bathroom is is very clean. The service was great. We had a nice surprise of happy hour discount even though we were 30 minutes earlier than their official happy hour time.\",\"time\":1673563123,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=4935121353945579151\",\"user_ratings_total\":2720,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"669 Scenic View Road, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/locations.dennys.com\\/AZ\\/PAGE\\/246869?utm_source=yext&utm_medium=local-listing&utm_campaign=yext-listing&y_source=1_MjIyODk4NC03MTUtbG9jYXRpb24ud2Vic2l0ZQ%3D%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:50','2023-09-19 05:55:54'),(64,'Taco Bell','googleplaces','ChIJSe_QLFZrNIcRqq