1PiYzRbpVwj6SUGB5syDfExDQH0f8GQI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"We stopped at this Taco Bell in Page, AZ after being on the road all day heading towards the Grand Canyon.  We walked in and stood at the counter for 3-4 minutes (having asked 2 separate employees when someone would be available to take our orders) Finally a manager said we would need to order from the Kiosk. When we got our order they forgot our drinks and our cinnamon twists. I normally do not leave reviews. However there was at least one employee working in the lobby who could have easily helped us or told us...you need to use the Kiosk. Just be aware to use the impersonal Kiosk at this location.\",\"time\":1687218754,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Victor Villanueva\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101717561248114779998\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJdUgOFYmRQzRVVYlpkR28-coJjZ0wUeZZYRCSMpSfJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"Very disappointed, the Fountain drinks were flat, I ordered regular and server got my order wrong. Server struggled to find an item on his POS terminal. Very disappointing. Plus price is just not worth it. I won\'t be going  back.\",\"time\":1694914283,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Slim Shady\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115254768655552321117\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIa9jcQtYAKl9sWN8j6VBDKWIwpAUFvOslH-Ikxeeha=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"No one told me that they weren\\u2019t taking orders at the front so I had to wait almost 10 minites until a different customer told me they only take orders on the machine. I got a chicken quesadilla with sourcream with makes it almost 10 bucks\\u2026. Instead of getting what I paid for I received a plain cheese quesadilla..\",\"time\":1693508550,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Siddhartha Kodgi\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101289091632362512569\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLwQghBVMlvcxCC-e-eCNqpMrjHPS3g_Cs_e4HG8wMP=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Please train the staff, they did not even look for what I ordered. This just crazy they keep those staff. We ordered 3 veg taco, every single one has meet in it.\\n\\nAnd on top of that, manager has arrogance to tell me that she served the correct food because she prepared it. This manager does not ever care for customer who paid $24 for their food.\",\"time\":1682886724,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Hardik Patel\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113588176051940095370\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUosPYwesfoXDaKGdgFv4su7CuKuPZZQV236_P6-qJTqeU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"I placed an order with server. She was little rude while taking order. The order was wrong.\\n. I went back to tell her that it\\u2019s wrong. She was like check each and every item. I opened it one by one then she believed me that it was wrong. They charged extra for onion and didn\\u2019t put it in my food. Bad experience.\",\"time\":1691783750,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"2359\",\"truncated\":true},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"ti