":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKO2xoovB0kyassDk7TzB4PvLokr_88Sis0QFXVnkmL=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"We took the Antelope Point canyon boat tour. Our initial tour was cancelled due to high winds, so we got rescheduled to the following morning. Aside from the freezing temperatures and chilly winds, the tour was pretty neat. The guide was knowledgeable and shared interesting facts about Lake Powell and the canyon. The captain of the boat was very skilled to navigate through the small canyons and make a U turn at the end. We ended up getting a lot of great photo ops. If it wasn\'t for the weather, which wasn\'t within their control, the tour would\'ve been even more awesome.\",\"time\":1680742825,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"C H\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111981408826552595165\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWoAWERNOb5NqOQkR3_9HhP3DHHTTD0pklGJESOfEuGeuA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"03\\/2023 stay\\nVery nice park. Good space between each site! Close to several tourist attractions you must see!  Astroturf at each camp site not much shade but this time of season was nice. Golf cart service to the only floating marina is a must see!  Janet was VERY helpful and worked with us when we had to extend our stay. She takes great pride in keeping park clean\\nWater pressure was \\ud83d\\udc4d\\ud83c\\udffc\\nCons: no on site shower\\/restrooms. Not a problem however just before this stay we lost our hot water heater. Thankfully fixed before arriving to this park.\",\"time\":1680803457,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Adam Loomis\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103054640266881992414\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocL-n0Rcu6RbD9_SGgjeyJNYq_bFfZfG5Y2ymC7g2UFR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"You would be crazy not to check this out. We just went out for the day for paddle boating from Flagstaff. Absolutely amazing, and ate at restaurant on the dock. Wear plenty of sun screen..\",\"time\":1684113455,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jeff Qin\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100888266103719006239\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLCN0rmDT1UxgQID-33yiRKm9cB9a4NNOFbyKMc1vPI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Rent a deck boat for half day. Best price in town. Boat is a little old but super powerful. Would suggest half day to have enough time to explore Navajo and a few bays nearby.\",\"time\":1687142877,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Chloe Alix\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104390293712928152149\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIPxK8BBrpijNpxa4Bvlt9EXOazcaPENYNgQCzOfsqX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"I was a little bit nervous about how it was going to go, but I can honestly say it was super smooth and well worth it. The staff was friendly and helpful and we had a great time on the water. My husband and I had never driven a boat before and they gave us a full lesson explaining how to do everything on the boat. It was July 4 weekend so the waters were quite busy and choppy but it was still a lot of fun. If you\\u2019re not comfortable boating and you\\u2019re renting the deck boat, which can be a slightly more rough ride, I highly suggest going out when it won\\u2019t be too busy. Also be aware that the gas is very expensive. We went out for two hours and the gas cost about $50.\",\"time\":1657059366,\"translated\":false}],\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"rv_park\",\"lodging\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=7709699114178222977\",\"user_ratings_total\":686,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"537 Marina Parkway, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/antelopepointlakepowell.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:50','2023-09-19 05:55:55'),(66,'Driftwood Lounge','googleplaces','ChIJQwoWRwVANIcRWUEp6Y3A-UM',72,'Resort bar & restaurant featuring a Southwestern menu, sports on TV & picturesque lake scenery.',8,0.20,0,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.9957029,\"lng\":-111.4863992},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.9967763302915,\"lng\":-111.4851908197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.9940783697085,\"lng\":-111.4878887802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/bar-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/bar_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Driftwood Lounge\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106808115154969414669\\\">Chad Goyette<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjB56AHMglAqbWXpSFdhDlPF-e1oLpy44hfa7SM77NnwdGvAMr78pc-dz_PNqGO1UzejMFVB-n9C4pYAp9qJLIr0OebsHAbal605POHAT3vsqucURnbC-o_mFrVZe2DefMxuUtuiBCPM9FGRimZ0lLWmlTRtCoFjHnV1CeDXNBSwcMV\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJQwoWRwVANIcRWUEp6Y3A-UM\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"XGW7+7C Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CXGW7+7C\"},\"rating\":3.7,\"reference\":\"ChIJQwoWRwVANIcRWUEp6Y3A-UM\",\"scope\":\"GOOGLE\",\"types