SG5DVCPmeavG-2SiHjC7ySo_dGwz-MsLwKOivW_o4WCCrrQ6LUeFSM5l1E4gCBB6XYpe2C75zxtrr5tkVCnrQHwXvE9ZPbDYLEHdPin\",\"width\":3000}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJQwoWRwVANIcRWUEp6Y3A-UM\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"XGW7+7C Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CXGW7+7C\"},\"rating\":3.7,\"reference\":\"ChIJQwoWRwVANIcRWUEp6Y3A-UM\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Vivien Pierson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109830771920398568690\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLEEixoUCPL5-nm3mLEj4eY-4eXAABlPtTejCes_xT5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"Visited very off season to celebrate my birthday with an Antelope Canyon tour and overnight stay.\\nWe were treated with courtesy and care by all the staff. They were very accommodating with my gluten-free requests and our meals were delicious. Even gave me a slice of gluten-free chocolate cake for my birthday. Wonderful!!\\nThe views of Lake Powell were stunning.\",\"time\":1676869435,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"jessica j\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102463976120432616022\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJ8FqCo8J-No3UT-9LL7TjpBaS1r0wuYJV_tPbwGTc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"This was a solid 3 stars. While we were pleasantly surprised by wonderful service (after reading other reviews, we were worried), we did have a bit dried out bun for the burger, drinks that didn\\u2019t quite match the description, and oily pasta. The chicken was beautiful and the kids\\u2019 pizza was a hit.\",\"time\":1678767157,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Rusty Escandell\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105242177666106568075\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUixFDX20R4_V8PisWSXQU-lGw78CzaPwR8qGxU6KeeZQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"After seeing all the old poor reviews we decided to try anyway, glad we did!  Service was very friendly, attentive and very professional.  We had the burger and a cob salad with seared salmon,  All well prepared and plated nicely.  Forget the poor reviews and give them a go, if your experience turns out 1\\/2 as good as ours it will be wonderful.   Sorry for the after the fact pic of my food but I was enjoying it too much to remember to take a before picture.  Oh and they have a small but nice wine and beer selection.  I had the local red ale, very nice!\",\"time\":1682561060,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Stacey Swapp\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115761145800533647207\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJBlLUBedzlBUvsTLKNUlZebvpV9vTLJlvFPs2RCauO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"We had a great waiter. I cant remember his name, but he had short brunette hair. We had a large group with a few small children ( 2 in high chairs) The food came out fast and was good. My sister and I had the chicken sandwich. It was good, but according to her not as good as in the past. Well, later that night we were both sick with vomiting and other food poisoning pleasantries. Luckily it didnt last long and we were back to our normal selves by the morning. I was impressed at how the waiter was still kind even with the chaos of all the kids.\",\"time\":1687457099,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Crissy Rebbert\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100546026281061824581\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLPdKYiaSP8OSKwxNYbS1C981IPVELN14XEub0aYIM9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"We had the chicken wings and squash and farro salad. Both were really good. Mike our server\\/bartender was excellent! He went above and beyond making our drinks as we didn\\u2019t order off the menu. The view is very nice.\",\"time\":1685806567,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"night_club\",\"bar\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=4898157785476841817\",\"user_ratings_total\":62,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"100 Lake Shore Drive, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lakepowell.com\\/lodging\\/dining\\/driftwood-lounge\\/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=places&utm_campaign=google_places\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:51','2023-09-19 05:55:54'),(67,'Slackers','googleplaces','ChIJ8aGl96QUNIcRpEhyRyOojFk',73,'Relaxed hangout serving burgers, wings & other American pub grub, plus beer pitchers & pints.',15,0.20,NULL,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.91699670000001,\"lng\":-111.4592888},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.91828528029151,\"lng\":-111.4579046197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.91558731970851,\"lng\":-111.4606025802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Slackers\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":1796,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\