o0Sfp\",\"width\":4160},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115330602294713426821\\\">Traci Ratzlaff<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgS9N8tSHzWaFwC5I9g-q7iqe8YHYbZHV2lbUNZ_14q4bStHxmZW18EcgwrlfQvVvTN3HDG79WS5ZL-lWuOVRGw11PVCuJ0nWIjSu10exGynZLXxujaRobDI_5psgBXCy2UoPWgqngGT5UtxN_A1LX1djCemLSmzWIJ-gN1fc-4jDY9\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ8aGl96QUNIcRpEhyRyOojFk\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WG8R+Q7 Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWG8R+Q7\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.3,\"reference\":\"ChIJ8aGl96QUNIcRpEhyRyOojFk\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Mel Rivera\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114600002015453139614\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXGkf40h7WXHkPAkhqp886ELs2SJo1j-BAMGptWosjQrN0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"We love this place! Relaxing and outdoor eating area too. The owner, a true Navaho Indian, recommended corn soup with lamb. It was home made, simple but delicious. We had it together with traditional Indian bread which was delicious. We also had bison burgers. Very satisfying after a long day touring the canyons.\",\"time\":1681917346,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Karsten Kutterer\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104779924252537859561\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjX2pTdS1CmXyvSPCJg-7jJ0SgmQzhTzHHqUI4Z-fOSnz8M=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"If you are passing through Page, AZ or staying by Lake Powell, you have to stop by this local restaurant!\\nFirst of all, we loved the mozzarella sticks. I ordered them thinking my wife and I would be the only ones to eat them, but our young kids attacked them as well. Would have been nice if there had been more of them for the price, though.\\nMy wife got the classic burger, which she said was really good, and onion rings. I got the Navajo taco with fresh jalape\\u00f1os added (and was impressed that they offered fresh and pickled options). It was very flavorful and the fry bread has great flavor and texture. Plenty of chili and veggies on top. The only negative was that they only gave a tiny cup of salsa that barely covered a small portion of the taco.\\nThe chicken tenders are also excellent. I finished off the last one that my kids didn\\u2019t eat and the flavor was so good and the breaking perfectly crispy that it didn\\u2019t even need to be dipped in any sauce\\/condiment. Also, don\\u2019t miss out on the fries either; both taste and texture are excellent.\",\"time\":1683682736,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Monika Meilute\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103386415585494432808\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU-SekgaML5nxAToSoztUgFC1LEXjm2yGp_q-4u4fYJoPw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Very American looking place with OK burgers (sadly we wanted to try potato bun burger, but got simple one), quite sweet onion rings and refillable drinks.\\nStaff was probably tired because the hardly replied to questions and weren\'t as friendly as usually in other restaurants.\",\"time\":1690140170,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Steph W\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102088329469336680236\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWJ9DE9uJH15gQmGMelhMUGcPWVduI7c2DeWzt-gOPWrg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"11 months ago\",\"text\":\"We came in late September and the place was decked out in cute Halloween decorations! You order at the front and the servers will bring them out to your table by #. The burgers that we ordered were extremely juicy and flavorful. It is affordable and tasty. We also got a $9.50 pitcher that was enough for almost 4 cups! I would highly recommend coming for this!\",\"time\":1664805923,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kimberly B\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110625606549621924279\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocI0NdTT3EHFHTzFHeSbzdIGtbT1PoricSdoIscahHS9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"My advice? Skip this place! Overpriced food, slow service. We ordered two burgers & added the fries & drinks (which was supposed to be a large, yet was most definitely a small). It cost us around $35 with tax. Atrocious! It took over 30 min once we ordered to get our food. As you can see, my burger was BLACK! The only good thing was the tater tots.\",\"time\":1676929822,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"1500\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1500\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1500\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"1500\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"1500\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-