h very attentive and on point with the service. We came with 8 adults and 3 kids. They had our drinks in a timely manner and even taking our order to serving our order. Food was very good and flavorful! We will be trying other locations in the future\",\"time\":1692244259,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Akul S\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104980346610246887405\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWAgI7LgvcuYSVfH7ZgA0_2XK_4wCeFRDQOUJW6FxADY2zG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"The best Mexican restaurant I\'ve been to and one of the best overall! Delicious food, excellent service and authentic ambience! The Margarita is a must try and so are their platters! Will definitely visit again.\",\"time\":1694477711,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Yuliana Sysolietina\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100078231292311369315\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVpRL4y5N5CMfdWtt1NEaHUdT_v8T6780lNS7s9pWbQ_kQ5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"I really liked the atmosphere and interior of the restaurant. Colorful and fun. Friendly staff, excellent service. I expected that the dish would be too spicy, but it was not like that. I don\'t eat food with hot spices. This pleased me. The portion was large. The waiter kindly offered to take a photo of our group, for which we thank you very much!!! Good luck and prosperity!\",\"time\":1680411560,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Chiara Chandoha\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110277467179147470076\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLJ14FDqSf53ZCJYzXDtETCVBKZDws6wFUoJEfljwev=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Service was fast and friendly.  The food was delicious and exactly what we expected. The lunch menu was reasonably priced too! Brightly decorated with fun typical Mexican art and beautiful painted chairs.  I take off one star because the bathroom needed attention.\",\"time\":1684365708,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Coach Stan\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117479876833844613622\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV6NfUax9yPo4urfRBwEHon7swItE3Gzmqn_eNzt11zWvI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"We like that place, when I come to page I every time eating here.\\nAmazing interior , really beautiful table and chair,you feel like in Mexico .\\nLarge portions, good food!\\nI want put 5 stars but\\nThey don\\u2019t have soups .\\nOn this time one of the souses filled like spoiled.\\nNice gays working.\",\"time\":1685918295,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"1400\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"1400\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1400\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1400\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"1400\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"1400\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"1800\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"1400\"}}],\"type\":\"HAPPY_HOUR\",\"weekday_text\":[\"Monday: 2:00\\u2009\\u2013\\u20096:00\\u202fPM\",\"Tuesday: 2:00\\u2009\\u2013\\u20096:00\\u202fPM\",\"Wednesday: 2:00\\u2009\\u2013\\u20096:00\\u202fPM\",\"Thursday: 2:00\\u2009\\u2013\\u20096:00\\u202fPM\",\"Friday: 2:00\\u2009\\u2013\\u20096:00\\u202fPM\",\"Saturday: 2:00\\u2009\\u2013\\u20096:00\\u202fPM\",\"Sunday: 2:00\\u2009\\u2013\\u20096:00\\u202fPM\"]}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=5483838394289998135\",\"user_ratings_total\":2962,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"125 South Lake Powell Boulevard, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/fiestamexrest.com\\/mexican-restaurants\\/page-az\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:51','2023-09-19 05:55:54'),(69,'McDonald\'s','googleplaces','ChIJ99FXn7oUNIcRCUKvB6E3uhY',75,'Classic, long-running fast-food chain known for its burgers & fries.',10,0.20,1,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.9056841,\"lng\":-111.4846344},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.9070716802915,\"lng\":-111.4833001197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.9043737197085,\"lng\":-111.4859980802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"McDonald\'s\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":3072,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.