86865582\\\">Kudea<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhE3PdYQAJSimkXO0Qz0AWEh47rnlMuRS7OwqumkDlO49LRUqruDCaj0y1OFmPubljL9TwukB3e8EbwaVb2PzvoXWjTLmp8atRTjaJOrCDRxuUS8zTYaHdMxFatjdxv07FBDoCsz_7QCAbXYLRu1JbAaOjRTEeTIEZwm85YQrem0icS\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112770384663248320983\\\">Khurram Mir<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgJjef6jp7ZBdgzQDysIj9KMwhNiyxrMhnaP5x1uZbjsZ2CHtaD9sjrHpqS79QFjgUXLbHe__a56YQyGjheOW5PNNLIST6b2B-UjZChHK4U1F2z3vYdQoQ9g5dptWTaPPItXozPwsHH0ce2kh4D45LWfhUh2LzyvBwWu3l_4jVae-8m\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105642063251390427792\\\">nikhil wakade<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziXXyDQ9SEQXn0a8fV5s-rK6Iwe7VioRkxnGNjktJsBPCDVY7TUqmjYEnTD68rAH5t6UJmgIgkVBw8D3bGQnhY-xJeLPKlptLeAz7Tk7Qqtke0ay98InP1OnS-qCR-vP9A3uCsRa4wSW7e0Ual55eQwIgJULbQOVOE6-Lvm1wacx_SU\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ99FXn7oUNIcRCUKvB6E3uhY\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WG48+74 Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWG48+74\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.6,\"reference\":\"ChIJ99FXn7oUNIcRCUKvB6E3uhY\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Ingrid Kacaniova\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111607075310859248245\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXqLUcJ2nQRY5lMl64TC1FZvCvkfribPtpDSK6jn2ZWEO4Y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"When we are on roadtrip and pass through Page we always visit this McDonald\'s. We always order to go, inside, using these mega huge ordering boards. 4 years, every year at least one visit, they always do not give us cups for drinks. We always have to go back and ask. Also the fries were never salty. Once we went back and asked for salt. They looked at us like we were crazy. We are from Europe, we do not know if it is something local in USA that they protect people from eating salty things. In reality we do not care, just give us a tiny little bag of salt.\\nThis year (2023) a lady who helped us to order was very very nice. She improved the image of this local McDonald\'s.\\n\\nI must mention that the choices are very limited compared to Europe. No salads, no vegetarian options (I don\'t mean fish).\",\"time\":1687021561,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Summer Begay\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111022718969601753137\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWKP_e5YPB4tFApVkWFZdwV1ZAKR0vJ_mgYfbLOeDeym1o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Soo today after work, I was super hungry and decided to head on over to McDonald\'s for a large fries. Been thinking about crunchy fresh fries since this afternoon. Entered McDonald\'s and noticed that nobody looked happy and the mood was off and I didn\'t even get a greeting. Anyways I was very dissatisfied with the fries I received because it was so so salty and greasy that I couldn\'t even enjoy it. Never again!!\",\"time\":1679617535,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sam Bawahab\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113616123236992144988\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV9Wvc4cDiVzK0B14tCEwERY-CS1QNTB8OYeuaajhT_zVw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"Very clean and new.  Cashier where friendly and courteous.  Fresh brew coffee was perfect way start the day.  We dine in.  Restroom very clean.\",\"time\":1674970668,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Zach Miller\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111307494629789073648\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLxs8fKu-r1XSEdIqFQ8p0UHvTXYHdU7jpkjxG93iVn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Manager doesn\\u2019t know how to keep up on stock and is CONSTANTLY out of half their McCafe menu while also not training drive thru employees properly who will jam drinks in your face forget straws take forever at the call box. They got teenagers at night who look higher than cheech. Food is never up to standard always thrown together with too much condiments soaking the sandwich. Trash is constantly in the parking lot tables are rarely cleaned\",\"time\":1691335056,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"All e-Trading\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102944566237430569478\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLe_db6UtzsRKoG70fbD-49EbQHskYwJTAdTBN62PPU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"We thought we\\u2019d just grab dinner at the Mc Donalds, which everybody likes..right? Well i would definitely not recommend this one for the following reasons:\\n\\n- At ordering the automat said that they didn\\u2019t have anymore fanta orange, but when we looked around after ordering we saw multiple people walking around with fanta orange.\\n- Also at ordering we ordered some mayo sauce with it, but didn\\u2019t get those after getting our order. When we asked for it at the desk they said they were out of mayo. Then literally the man behind us got mayo sauce from them, which is weird as they said they didn\\u2019t have any left to us.\\n\\n- The same thing happened with extra fries. We didn\\u2019t get those either and when asking at the desk again, they were giving us difficulties again and didn\\u2019t gave any even though we did pay for it.\\n\\n- The last thing we were not satisfied about was the quality of the food, i mean yes it\\u2019s the McDonalds but this was definitely worse than other ones as our food looked like it was already done an hour ago and the hamburgers were flat. When just mentioning this to someone at the desk they gave a whole explanation for how they\\u2019re \\u2018different\\u2019 than other McDonalds and it was normal for them, which didn\\u2019t even explain anything.\\n\\nSo in conclusion the whole customer friendly atmosphere was not there at all and we didn\\u2019t get or what was missing or money back. Which is not fair as we now paid for stuff we did not get.\",\"time\":1690862344,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"2359\",\"truncated\":true},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"0000\",\"truncated\":true}}],\"type\":\"DRIVE_THROUGH\",\"weekday_text\":[\"Monday: Open 24 hours\",\"Tuesday: Open 24 hours\",\"Wednesday: Open 24 hours\",\"Thursday: Open 24 hours\",\"Friday: Open 24 hours\",\"Saturday: Open 24 hours\",\"Sunday: Open 24 hours\"]}],\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"cafe\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"store\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=1637682579260785161\",\"user_ratings_total\":2016,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"1004 Haul Road, Page\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.mcdonalds.com\\/us\\/en-us\\/location\\/AZ\\/PAGE\\/1004-W-HAUL-RD\\/31819.html?cid=RF:YXT:GMB::Clicks\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:51','2023-09-19 05:55:55'),(70,'Blue Buddha Sushi Lounge','googleplaces','ChIJi6wzj68UNIcRwUgYY_snt20',76,'Buddha statues & neon blue lights decorate this relaxed hangout for Japanese specialties & drinks.',1