I3Z8CNLrNHnwl8tT_vFxU\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":3344,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102122463374456446975\\\">Daren Jones<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zj8uluOdjuHNTPG_iuLCLP-lDfl-7YDaF_OEklI28VSQrbMfRaSms0dPZ3T8xoieMsHVuzQf3eKHRIkFnO6NrDZ4I0PHG5HV0RdcFw5voGgjenkiq1QOu_nDXZDBdadb_4zolYhfPLmYLuACOU-NBaV7RjkuTdPLuZPF-aBTBzeOWQ\",\"width\":2508},{\"height\":2252,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101237168219141764108\\\">Nicole Wood<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zh7EKdYLj3kTHD5FR2S_kv8nxVzpqgrqgzGXIl7O6PV4DVSJkanOs35_5cr6LjEA2hdETbPzajeCYiWGt0P1RDxRVPiVR-1NaWaW7PmF4U5Yu5Ifi9qosTG4aqVB_TARy0uki7LeK4WfRzGGUqngZ4PLmdEYbA1RwwJqE6q9oy7UI7q\",\"width\":4000}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJi6wzj68UNIcRwUgYY_snt20\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WG9Q+2W Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWG9Q+2W\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.1,\"reference\":\"ChIJi6wzj68UNIcRwUgYY_snt20\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Soffeli\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101595274794772697636\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKo7UMuAZhoi1GD7oUtHpBtQTBCA5loULsDaKbs3xbZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"As a vegan eater, I don\'t have a lot of restaurant options in Page. Therefore I was really happy to find this restaurant. I chose the Phat Bowl with rice, sweet chili sauce and tofu for a total of $11. The price is totally OK and it was very tasty! The waiter (Ian, according to the bill) was nice, he asked the kitchen especially for me which sauce was vegan (only sweet chili - for me, it wasn\'t too spicy). My friend chose the Teriyaki Chicken for $17 and was also very pleased. We were seated with no problems and didn\'t have to wait long for either the drink or the food. We can definitely recommend the restaurant ! :-)\",\"time\":1684905674,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Narendar Mouli\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107719938779380891770\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVRitLb-yFrmsdWHa3vqsWgb4fZh_PP3YMsiSv50kCfZ8PJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"9 months ago\",\"text\":\"Liked the ambience. Most recommended by locals here. We tried traditional margarita, old fashioned, ginger lime martini and strawberry mojito. Other than old fashioned, all other drinks were good. Old fashioned was not good. It was too strong. Food - we ordered shrimp tempura sushi rolls, shrimp tempura appetizer, veggie phat bowl, Cucumber rolls, yum yum bombs. Other than cucumber roll everything was good. Though there are not lot of drink options in menu, they make if we ask for. Though they have cheesecake in menu, they did not have it which disappointed me. The gentleman who took care of us did an amazing job. But other lady who initially took us in could have been more friendlier. Definitely recommended if you are in Page, AZ.\",\"time\":1671170115,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tammie Rabbitt\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114718533855236987462\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLt_VZwgBWXqolLy07VvCcoh9P-vbZHZ52uzf6SqPkL=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Best sushi around. The Yum Yum bombs for dessert were amazing! Tempura fried oreos with ice cream and so delicious. The best!\",\"time\":1686795510,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Finn Rowling-Ashworth\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117110286675080683555\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKinY8qamSlcrX73OP1t0IGvhpjskcbauDpslABHNVJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"A surprising find in Page. Freshly prepared sushi in front of your eyes. Funky interior with options to eat in booths or at the bar. Edamame starter was great. Veggie phat bowl with big bits of tofu in it and Buddha rolls were excellent.\",\"time\":1694481160,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Daren Jones\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102122463374456446975\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUAychs6kMTCeD15xc2eOrikJPbWO1KmGP0iPQjSKpiNz0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 years ago\",\"text\":\"This was my first time and I really enjoyed myself. After spending the day at Lake Powell it was nice to come in and sit down down in a clean and fun environment. The waiters were quick and very knowledgeable. For our group of six we ordered 10 different rolls. The biggest haul I\\u2019ve ever been a part of. We enjoyed every last bit of those 60 pieces of sushi. We also ordered two rice bowls just in case some of the younger kids didn\\u2019t end up liking the sushi. All in all I would say that next year when we come back to Lake Powell we will be going to Blue Buddha for some good sushi!!\",\"time\":1627102674,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=7905831631525005505\",\"user_ratings_total\":623,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"644 North Navajo Drive, Page\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/bluebuddhasushilounge.com\\/\"}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:52','2023-09-19 05:55:55'),(71,'Bonkers Restaurant','googleplaces','ChIJ5ZbzNLsUNIcRVKkWxrHNTOg',77,'Italian dishes, steaks & sandwiches served in an informal dining room with a laid-back vibe.',15,0.20,NULL,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.9205682,\"lng\":-111.4589894},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.92186188029149,\"lng\":-111.4574854697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.9191639197085,\"lng\":-111.4601834302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Bonkers Restaurant\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":false},\"photos\":[{\"height\":810,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105045765518578945977\\\">Bonkers Restaurant<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgUMsHtu2w2Y527Zawt44xBbPUUeE-RetpDlEoziz4WB9M5DmcZCEF0A-_vEOFHcMFkAxu9YQO2VvfL2jTWdIdO4ENL0FmbcS7_Wa3UbBXvt5GlvSAJlpRpaeQiCpO41uYXnpe3QdM3Axs28JEYP3V-2UO0d3csj6WGcsZZXwgz3BRz\",\"width\":1440}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ5ZbzNLsUNIcRVKkWxrHNTOg\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WGCR+6C Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWGCR+6C\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.3,\"reference\":\"ChIJ5ZbzNLsUNIcRVKkWxrHNTOg\",\"scope\":\"GOOGLE\",\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"user_ratings_total\":760,\"vicinity\":\"810 North Navajo Drive, Page\",\"details\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"810\",\"short_name\":\"810\",\"types\":[\"street_number\"]},{\"long_name\":\"North Navajo Drive\",\"short_name\":\"N Navajo Dr\",\"types\":[\"route\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Page\",\"short_name\":\"Page\",\"types\":[\"locality\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Coconino County\"