tps:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117244186882661967720\\\">Arti Sarma<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjHOyNMGdPRlUOSUfNf-5i4dQ7DVbZAokk1raDil7qltFqkQIWWTN_TYLx2uc1FXFfVPmsljUbgDdEP77ryRM7qRhtRxBbkenGmHGiK4uzYTt5V0s5ciNbB7Ce0RkDfR9i-5fFV6dI8_Q9tIY7AUe_Mvz-w_sgF5lCe9uN2sdqzC6nw\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113593018481368581579\\\">Pao Tomos<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgwBjcxzpBwbGRPWo0I77gQ5GiRqpv76pGEOtdNEchh6Se7U9pcNofQNd7Rex_XpGVVY8GL_YLQslhXEgxBo88lYjPFwDUjn-wVLwUkOJRVVYQAJoImX-IsekI4T6eeqDtpfQmNb2QpTnqjnRf-GeTUNs5w9kpeCZzkndth4-Uds6g3\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102145797066074664636\\\">EatDrink TravelReview<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgMLn7VZX2WnpaIRWmpsgdEqK9PJGb2ubN7Om2qVGoyBgCX8UNoS9ULGk3xr8PvzUFsehOxtvL4I3dFhCEB5jylOqyOVEsAlup_sa3AETDUjP6K6u3ODllbfouoGGgLBetlYewcTBNFpjHYLm1oIoWDJO0jw8lV911qiHcwOq9Cb3kT\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ5ZbzNLsUNIcRVKkWxrHNTOg\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WGCR+6C Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWGCR+6C\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.3,\"reference\":\"ChIJ5ZbzNLsUNIcRVKkWxrHNTOg\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Robert Lewin\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114579870883154372066\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLw0q-fJF7QqLwe_cmZ4xxLklQZPofHIzyif1dOIjV_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Fantastic meal, authentic Italian dishes.  I had the chicken park and my wife had the beef medallions.  The chicken was tender, juicy and very flavorful and I had the fettuccine Alfredo with it.  The beef medallions were cooked just right and very tasty.  Quaint little place with a great atmosphere!\",\"time\":1694224690,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Henry Young\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107094056819710826116\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU7_Y2GDlTWojv8pP0lQgDBGmnkyzda8oykAYXB61bCUj0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"I wasn\\u2019t quite sure what to expect from a place with such an unusual name, but I was really pleasantly surprised by the quality of the food and the service. Arrived shortly after they opened at 4 o\\u2019clock - I think I was probably the first customer! I was met by Kat, who was my server and they were really attentive and friendly, even when it got busier.\\n\\nI ordered the marinara with linguine and added meatballs to it, as well as getting a house salad with a vinaigrette dressing. The salad was fresh and tasty. The meatballs tasted really good and the sauce was generally good, even if it was a tad inconsistent in texture. The pasta came with garlic bread and Kat was happy to make sure this was cheese-free.\\n\\nI was surprised to see a proper desert trolley brought out when I was considering the options! I went with a lemon cake (I\\u2019m not sure what the full name of it was). It was really good in terms of portion, size, consistency and taste.\\n\\nIn terms of drinks, I was offered a choice of different lemonades and chose the raspberry lemonade. Kat said it was freshly made that day and it certainly tasted fresh, and was the favourite lemonade I\\u2019ve had on this trip!\\n\\nI thought the prices were reasonable and the quality of service was really good. If I find myself passing through Page again, I will certainly find time to stop by.\",\"time\":1679007802,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Claudine Co\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102841711034879780965\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUxIgpO0l3aWmtiTMaZdM5BhMA3Ix5eRlobaFTzKazxyro=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"I suppose if you have a running race in Page  the next day this would be the place to fuel up and carb-load.\\n\\nOn a Friday night before a race this place was packed, with a 25-30 min wait at 5:45pm.\\n\\nMy husband hadn\\u2019t eaten all day and in retrospect we may have ordered a bit too much, but the pasta portions were large and plentiful and the special Seared Ahi Tuna appetizer tasted good. I was not able to finish my salmon-shrimp fettuccine pasta (was pleased it came with a good portion of saut\\u00e9ed spinach & tomatoes). My husband ordered fettuccine with white clam sauce and added pesto shrimp to it. The result required some lemon\\/ chile flake to lift the single-note flavors but we eventually got some from the server.\\n\\nService was good, although they were clearly slammed.\",\"time\":1681221689,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sandarah Cornwell\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108325079284612228364\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUhNNgcI5FgMgwlZ3hOhcOTn8KmoaxAhDN1E2D_t-LKcug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Oh my goodness!! Did we find a GEM!! EXCELLENT FOOD!! Kudos to the chef\\nWe got a good laugh at the name, but don\'t let that fool you. Our waitress explained, and it made sense. If you\'re curious,  stop in...they won\'t disappoint.\",\"time\":1684029095,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Beth Lester\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110699718165262710294\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXt6hxmFKXpDKDZ_QZYva-GsWnBXmHn1xLRDb5k4eVxNeQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Quality Italian Food.   Our spaghetti with vegetables came out quickly, & Kat was running her tail off.  She needed more help on a busy night.   The vegetables were fresh & cooked well, & the sauce was delicious.\",\"time\":1683282002,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":false,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=16738980078445570388\",\"user_ratings_total\":760,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"810 North Navajo Drive, Page\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.bonkerspageaz.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:52','2023-09-19 05:55:55'),(72,'Sonic Drive-In','googleplaces','ChIJnbvaLFZrNIcRgafwIjTWjvk',78,'Fast-food burger & fries joint with an old-school feel, including retro drive-in service.',10,0.20,1,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.905034,\"lng\":-111.4833006},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":36.9064548302915,\"lng\":-111.4819913697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":36.9037568697085,\"lng\":-111.4846893302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Sonic Drive-In\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117334153929711253590\\\">Benny<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgiad2ItrMwiig4U-6kyLNttdK