":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW2P3KqvkRhNv6fYm9u5TZ0NGTyb5bKuopxhQaODqd5pz8j=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Good stop to address your hunger, clean and a good selection of Asian food. Host accommodating and food was tasty. Come hungry and leave satisfied.\",\"time\":1689873831,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Michael Nguyen\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116661684150713197284\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKe2BWDwNeQp-c9V2h6AARnobQNQVsR_GqeJ_4G_oWv=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"It\\u2019s not worth for a buck! It\\u2019s expensive for the buffet with almost \\u201coily food\\u201d! In addition, an owner or a manager look unfriendly when customers wanted to change the table ( you cannot do that). However, staff is helpful!\\nNot recommended but if you guys want to try its food, just do it and don\\u2019t regret!\",\"time\":1681778002,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"captain ren\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111845061279468030024\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUkK5-nl4ehbGCP-iNPi3nCMkdltGLhcR35WU-8g-XYZqo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"A really great little find. All you can eat restaurant, with a reasonable price. The buffet is not large, but has a lot of great choices. Come if your hungry, and leave happy. Small quaint and basic, good place for a friends night out before heading on your page adventures. Would recommend if you want good food, and a reasonable price. The atmosphere is basic and not luxury, but is still a hidden gem.\",\"time\":1690816833,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tr\\u1ecbnh Minh\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104732206860741819430\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUO6MQrCL7tGjCom4JELEcUhAkLLBRUvzEH-_TO4DrDmucK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"The food here was fine with reasonable prize but don\'t have wifi and drink so it has still a lot to improve\",\"time\":1680409998,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lesly Lopez\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101724778668894258410\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocITX1B61Oeu_5c_ok92yc-q9F7zjmrj7bl1zvWB_52Z=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Food was pretty good. Small buffet style. The complaint i have is the food wasn\\u2019t hot. If the food would have been hot I would have given it another star.\",\"time\":1694014088,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=1233313052854882476\",\"user_ratings_total\":1153,\"utc_offset\":-420,\"vicinity\":\"683 South Lake Powell Boulevard, Page\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:53','2023-09-19 05:55:55'),(75,'Pizza Hut','googleplaces','ChIJl85OLlRrNIcRfrUGwuho02k',81,'Popular delivery, carry-out & dine-in chain known for pizza, wings & pasta, plus sides & desserts.',10,0.20,0,0,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":36.91838310000001,\"lng\