s\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105925593602393347695\\\">Ashish Bajpai<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zix1ducztbrsXOrh9iyOM3sVEXRnS4lhQWigcljE_4-WbxGDd5Y4RLfT-QsxauTKl6EEWlS1mdSZfCvODbMIMen2ojlitgUVDGyeMyB7VlH0cKYJk2WgF-ac_YEvrZbGHzYKQbc9nK4gnu1RweHS875d0uLW4gC3gN0-G9YysG9_79r\",\"width\":6000},{\"height\":683,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108627511229795251221\\\">Pizza Hut<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjBAOH92WP6HKUJXXPMHpVTAK0CXV6Dkpeu8lNrLWbdWoBAAtbTEcBxw9OMRhiUyCevTDIvB8YaZybu7OUAEcXjnrHZZ8YC2pde0ZAJJ67VWGuphbdG--3MVanU-g5SlzyeuMMeZ4EhKcX5K3YzYsJL40ABW3UpD7W541R0-6jrngUT\",\"width\":1025},{\"height\":453,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111191110586298888145\\\">Prince Elbert<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjwfdWXK9n3-ydDYhruegobipD4QXDWewgZElNHhTJdawYhIewWmFh7QkrTGtEAhgsvSmxYyvfvTJEx9fRpuyIpZwiV2KVjcq2eiTmjCVqPiRRPbUoeSfkEjLIMdqP6lq-b2TVN8iUCz_49grcsQ4dgASL24cs8LPBXQdezhXWrYpZ7\",\"width\":375},{\"height\":3072,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118315100214073815835\\\">Chung-Hui Wang<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zi_UhV7j9YB_ajhGa-2dtOkYIoZqzjw1FM-EuHav3SiVv7oWlIfp2ArkyfdFXY1N_KjJfINHnzCI9zxAcQJ7zz7-pkneamwsojki8Zh1GU88yq4X_aaXZGnZKgF_rp983ATL_hwINYjiPzo-OLO-o4-3YxC32Z6I8X4dTHsdNxUhIAZ\",\"width\":4080}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJl85OLlRrNIcRfrUGwuho02k\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"WG9R+94 Page, AZ, USA\",\"global_code\":\"858CWG9R+94\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.6,\"reference\":\"ChIJl85OLlRrNIcRfrUGwuho02k\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Sandesh Shashidhara\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101861940466518659391\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUC5ggIDryA6X7YogVWvUB-RM_n37XCLziXb8Vnkr8idNRE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Good pizza and the staff were friendly. They didnt have ketchup or the oregano which was the only downside. The place was clean and well kept.\",\"time\":1682286775,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Elliott Tso\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115555612909902208183\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVm4AKFkidCoSYziKqZ9tMMOkRdGOmC7NzLUNcNLzVaraEF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"10 months ago\",\"text\":\"Bad delivery!!! We\'re staying just down the road .5 miles away. Paid and left a tip prior to delivery. Pizza and bread stick was ordered for kids and wings for adults. Wing sauce spilled all over the bread sticks and pizza. Kids couldn\'t eat much of breadsticks or pizza because the sauce was soaked on the bottom of the pizza box and into the food. The box being folded in half wasn\'t a good look either. Also, no plates or utensils, who expects people to have plates with them at a hotel or a fork for the bones wings. Well the wings weren\'t so messy since it was in the food. Moral of the story don\'t trust the delivery person. Or tip prior. Also cover the wings!!!! COVER THE WINGS!!! Pizza was pretty good for the adults. Hence 2 stars.\",\"time\":1667537685,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Just Marry\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110710437361980010587\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJWTiVUYXwIKjtcS2RSyjfe-f5-LGDS5mEXk6UHdNE-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"As a regular pizza eater I often go to Pizza Hut but i would\\u2019ve never expected their pizza to be this bad. The mushrooms tasted mostly odd and as the pepperoni was flavorless there was an overload of marinara. Wouldn\\u2019t come back again.\",\"time\":1692987798,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Liz\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100797674665205224606\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXlbxB2Ncv1dJ80j6sYZtWakEBc98OYSGqCdc2QcFRghQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"I\'ve always loved Pizza Hut, since it was the only pizza place we had while growing up. It has been many years since I had a pizza from The Hut.\\n\\nTonight it was the best idea and let me tell you, I\'m gonna call this the Mary Poppins pizza... \\\"Practically perfect in every way.\\\" (If you get that reference, especially if you hear it in a British accent while reading it, we might be new best friends! LOL)\\n\\nAnyway, it had perfectly distributed toppings, like the person who made it actually cared. There was nothing burnt onto the edges of the crust and the bottom was perfectly browned and crisp. I ordered my toppings a specific way and they completely nailed it. It was also not overly saucy, which can really over power the rest of the toppings... it was perfect amount of everything!\\n\\nIn a past life, I used to work at a pizza place and was known for making my pizzas \\\"pretty\\\" and repeat customers would request to have me be the one to make it.... This was literally the first \\\"pretty\\\" pizza I have received of the dozens I have ordered from all sorts of places over the many years since.\\n\\nI wish I knew which employee had made this so I could give them a personal shout out.\\n\\nRegardless, this hit the spot in every way tonight.\\n\\nWho would have thought staying in a janky hotel in Page, Arizona and having a Pizza Hut pizza would turn out to be such a good night?? So random.\",\"time\":1648359387,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Cooper Marshall\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109430182871299525421\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVdnRNrixkT-o892YTqF7_BslPEQMcFhrP-qkUAcO6hhM8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Thought I would give the hut one last try.  Wrong!  Gross.  Asked for garlic\\/butter spray on pizza.  Uhh, tasted like men\'s deodorant spray.  Yuck.  Pizza was barely cooked.  I was the only one there.\\nNever. Ever. Again.\",\"time\":1687560469,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"0000\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"0000\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"1000\"}}],\"type\":\"DELIVERY\",\"weekday_text\":[\"Monday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200911:00\\u202fPM\",\"Tuesday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200911:00\\u202fPM\",\"Wednesday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200911:00\\u202fPM\",\"Thursday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200911:00\\u202fPM\",\"Friday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2