6\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocImm9c5pcqpjggw1CxKn56njiIGMAMeSmmySLOqBaWsEQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"I\\u2019ve ordered from this location and stopped by many times and have always had an excellent experience! Today I ordered a couple wraps and one was missing the main ingredient and they graciously and quickly got a new one to me. Perfection isn\\u2019t required to be awesome at your job, the way you handle mistakes matter just as much! Thanks guys!\",\"time\":1694029119,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"mercedes breann\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112445003415908387608\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjX5ZGChq5FkfnkK2ghBk1G0hGBF2pOuGR0jLxK6aIAg9ug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"I was just here, i ordered a sandwich combo and a pickle and a coke, he couldn\\u2019t seem to understand that i wanted another pickle and coke separate from the combo, and put it on a whole different order, then when i ordered the sandwich i got the number nine and asked for no onions when he read it back he said no tomatoes. When we finally pulled up to the window to get the food they rang us up for the two separate orders and only handed us out one of them and i had to ask for my other order as well, also never got my chips. However, i do love the cedar city jimmy john\\u2019s, but this st. george location was awful\",\"time\":1693850348,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Shannon Dahn\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100530164107483934564\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIet5pvUt6Rh1OjbxAAohDrHA1htTXOUnOdvfDoeGoG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Can I just say that the district Manager is AMAZING!  he was not even on the clock and stopped in his store..saw they were behind and struggling and took it upon himself to deliver my coworkers order himself!!  THATS CUSTOMER SERVICE!!  and an EXCELLENT manager to work with. Wow!!  Thank you for helping my coworker not be hangery. :)\",\"time\":1687399799,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Patricia Kendrick\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105081596072555324446\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLT6v3Zc7lUXWWq3w0yr1depOq0BA5g7Yo2C-nJ0nS3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"The  food is great here!! Including the pickle and the chips!!  The Little John is perfect for a person that can\'t eat a lot also! The unwich is great also with no bread and just a lettuce wrapped sandwich.\",\"time\":1684549960,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Slay Slay\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114691592417552957101\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLog8prsrVrfui-Bes6K4T1zBMKRtxipYS1NQ9IIZI3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Delivery driver was very rude and withhold PAID food from me demanding a tip. Someone else ordered the food for me and and was EXTREMELY rude. I am a 17 year old girl and I was lucky that my parents were home to keep me safe from this unprofessional scary man. I then called to ask why this happened. And I was promptly hung up on by a manager by the name of Madison. DO NOT ORDER FROM HERE.\",\"time\":1681240571,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"1000\"}}],\"type\":\"DRIVE_THROUGH\",\"weekday_text\":[\"Monday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Tuesday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Wednesday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Thursday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Friday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Saturday: 10:00\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20099:00\\u202fPM\",\"Sunday: Closed\"]},{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"2100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"1000\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"