en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUt5ygGq1i3WpxiZXU0PLak6VcCfs18Y6-Q6vjTSIj7U4ZO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Killer food and friendly atmosphere. I had a great sirloin steak and sweet potato! Thanks for your amazing service Blaine!\\nBlaine was confident,  kind and knowledgeable about the menu. He was washing the bar area down,  taking care of drinks for the rest of the staff but continued to wait on me awesomely well and kept a great conversation and connection the entire time.  The rolls are so damn naughty and the sirloin and sweet potato are my goto! Thanks again Blaine,  you remind me of one of my sons.\",\"time\":1693438397,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Robert Lohman\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104115462773039943797\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWorYBa14OtlWcLCgLRwJsZa02nugQTi9Qu4zF-B9t93E-h=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Had pulled pork and it was delicious. We went another time and the pulled pork was all gone but not this time.\\nCall or make an appointment beforehand it\'s busy. We were there Saturday at 6pm.\\nI definitely recommend this place it\'s yummy!\\nBrought our one year old kid and they had a baby seat for him it was perfect.\",\"time\":1692494243,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kristina Boothe\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108346793837378096779\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUEWWpJ3mIFBDf1dPHgvPZZprcYU8GDThhY52KoP8XVxrlt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"My husband and I had lunch today and it was absolutely perfect! We both had Ribeyes that were cooked perfectly! My husband tried to cut the ribs to share with me, but it was pointless... The meat was literally coming right off the bone! Our server, Matt, provided next level customer service! He took the time to explain the menu and confirm the temps of our steaks, was always right there when we needed him, but not overbearing at all! The manager, Shae, even came over and gave us a little welcome treat since it was our first time! We will definitely be back!! Thank you Texas Roadhouse for a wonderful experience all around!!! I would have added pictures of the food, but there was nothing left!\",\"time\":1684697882,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Madhurananda Pahar\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113619030010196504799\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXf6GWaxTsrtFBwqPVf7oVxHI5A-zNVMXIF2GwgasWCXVa9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"This is an amazing place for a good diner with friends. The food was delicious and service was great too. Highly recommended.\",\"time\":1690085276,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":false,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=11382397748733422692\",\"user_ratings_total\":4028,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"2654 Red Cliffs Drive Bldg. 2, St. George\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.texasroadhouse.com\\/locations\\/utah\\/st-george?utm_source=listing&utm_medium=search\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:56','2023-09-19 05:55:56'),(78,'Painted Pony Restaurant','googl