U5L73a4QMFga9lihpmA8ggdljy9Q7uKXxSGdgxhMwPI7lnAnnaN4r-S51vzM4a6qPI7HhQ1RMrkkCii4ZUdYbT3FxTFUEEL3_Rpq_E8cAK\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ5UYq-iNbyoARpEs4tGo0KoE\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"4C6W+GM St. George, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85984C6W+GM\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.2,\"reference\":\"ChIJ5UYq-iNbyoARpEs4tGo0KoE\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Caitlin Bilancia\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100844040973971766394\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUoVw4ZcvcfOY1Evww3S7d3BhdT2AT89Yl4wyLAPefSPeY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Boneless and bone in wings, fresh salads, friendly service. Best nachos I\'ve had in a long while. Highly recommend steak. Tried the Southern Lemon Hotties and loved it. Not as spicy as I thought but just enough. Gluten free options galore!\",\"time\":1689977268,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mickey \\u201cFeliz Vida Sigma\\u201d\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116661686700066132523\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWVz1Hkfu3np6i33EruO8q26iQM8d8zczC9ZU7QFbCSXfFc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Good service and good food. All food on the menu is baked, not fried including the wings and the buffalo chips. You\'ll get 2 bags of snack like pretzels and peanuts ($2 each) with beer ($1.50) even if you don\'t want it because of some weird Utah alcohol rules.\",\"time\":1682690136,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jeanette Leele\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101449669099666633088\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLjHG9LjyGvsX9uU6txRYksr0QBWkO8QsdvSrrymbcs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"9 months ago\",\"text\":\"It\'s very misleading and not worth a visit. There is a sign posted stating fresh ingredients.  We started with an order of chips and salsa. The salsa was Pico picante sauce from the grocery store. Our burgers came out, and the patty on our burger was frozen and smaller than our palm and burned. The bun was bigger than the patty. How can a burger come out frozen in the middle and burn on the outside....and to top it off, smaller than my palm? It is not recommended for anyone. Save yourself the time, 6 disappointment.\",\"time\":1670634380,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"James Parker\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112989869196171859075\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKttbm3vvs4k-etaX9mljJRMzmWEQDwqctdenF4PBDB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"This is my favorite place to eat when I\\u2019m in town. All the food is fresh and tastes better than any other wing place I\\u2019ve been to. I love the beer selection. The beer buddies was confusing at first but a quick explanation from the server cleared it up. Best boneless wings I\\u2019ve ever had. My favorite Irish nachos ever too!\",\"time\":1689697643,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Damian \\u201cAyeedee\\u201d Ford\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117487553287437031212\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJn_i4YofdEpS-lBI_auEOW_6Teehq-mhnDoVhTeY5B=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"Came in after work and wanted some wings but everyone was sending them back so I changed and I ordered the Buffalo wrap and the Buffalo wrap came naked with no sauce. They asked to remake it and I allowed it and it came back cold so I chose not to eat it and asked for it to be removed from my tab after waiting 25 mins before anyone even asked why I did not touch my food. The bartender Kimmy then said I was cut off because of my complaints. And my whole issue is that she\\u2019s not the person who made the food and she was livid enough to cut me off after serving me my 2nd mai tai while my food was sitting in my face for almoust 30 minutes.The owner happened to be sitting two seat from me and allowed the whole process to take place i then personally brought it to her attention, and she said I\\u2019ve been drinking and you can email me.I would never see why anyone in this town would vote for the best sports bar to be this unprofessional.\\n\\nSo heads up if you don\\u2019t like your food don\\u2019t complain you will be cut off and forced to pay full price for a horrible time.\\n\\nAnd you say that nothing was sent back but your servers and \\u201cBar Back Only\\u201d only statements were that the kitchen is training and if you read what was said you would of responded more appropriate.\",\"time\":1694579734,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"bar\",\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=9307309212809317284\",\"user_ratings_total\":759,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"250 Red Cliffs Drive #24, St. George\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/wingnutzstg\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:56','2023-09-19 05:55:56'),(80,'Firehouse Subs Red Rock Commons','googleplaces','ChIJjY9SFiFbyoARsMNITSX7_pA',86,'Counter-serve sandwic