rl\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117624524665181116685\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUf8HuNqMw0w-N6B6nNqMWplOcpdRH4dMv3PVzDorWMKR4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"I came here just to get a drink and was not disappointed to find a Coke freestyle machine. Perfect on a long road trip.\\n\\nThe employees here didn\\u2019t question me one bit and we\\u2019re happy to facilitate just a cup for me with a small charge.\\n\\nI wasn\\u2019t hungry, but the smell of the restaurant definitely is enticing.\\n\\nThese restaurants are all themed very similar like Cracker Barrel, but slightly different each time. All are owned and operated by veteran firefighters so you know the money is going into good hands.\\n\\nI would definitely stop here again, with walking access to the shopping district with multiple stores. This is not a bad place to stop.  With extremely safe parking areas My partner was able to sleep while I walked around.\\n\\nIf you want to see some videos of the area, definitely check out my YouTube channel!  Follow me here on Google Maps to see where all I\\u2019ve been \\ud83e\\udd19 \\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\udd64\\ud83e\\uddef\\ud83d\\ude92\",\"time\":1689909470,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Eleanor Louray\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102642887606310352618\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocI-nyIL7JDtKwwmFhJoVI6JQ4FZn1l1CGLRkoZw3KyD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"9 months ago\",\"text\":\"Great Sandwiches loved the Italian and Hook& Ladder. Could use some cleaning. They had a bunch of teenage boys working and all they did was clown around. Very disappointed in the service.\\nNeed to work on customer service skills.\",\"time\":1670545568,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"aleydis pineda\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114716239202745741375\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWEA7UiSgG849A8zWcVxyjDPBfBDdr35FVy0LA8sRLHjlI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"I came in for a meatball sub and they were all out of meatballs. I was thinking about leaving and going somewhere else, but I felt rude doing that, so I stayed. I didn\\u2019t know what else to get so I asked the boy at the cash register to make me whatever he wanted. He asked me questions about what I like in order for him to make me a sandwich that I would enjoy. Another girl working kept staring at me but it wasn\\u2019t a rude stare. She ended up complimenting my eyes so I think that\\u2019s why she kept looking at me, and the boy that took my order complimented the tattoo on my arm. It\\u2019s a great environment with very friendly employees. Never thought walking into a sandwich shop would make my day. And to top it all off I loved the sandwich they made me.\",\"time\":1690164270,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Rylen Wind\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117007324827316696620\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKPrrgrcS3eEeGYQnIroEabLM4zti1DjaxofZcdZw99=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"9 months ago\",\"text\":\"1\\/3 of my salad was black and wilted. I\\u2019m not sure how you miss this when putting the salad together. This isn\\u2019t a little piece or two. This is disgusting. I\\u2019d like my money back at the very least.\\nThey also forgot my kids juice and rice crispy treat. The treat is like 1\\/4 of the regular sized treats. Pretty disappointed. I\\u2019ve gone here a few times before and never had a problem, but this time I was pretty bummed.\",\"time\":1670097337,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Gravvy\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101262575215956219524\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVBn0CuDXbL8OcMEYpceLbAQQyvc0_qxQZeboGBgg51p64=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"The food is excellent. It\'s fairly decently priced too. The only reason this isn\'t 5 stars is due to the fact they are employing children. I asked the one that looked the youngest and he stated he is 11 years old. Very weird.\",\"time\":1685065137,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=10448064323175105456\",\"user_ratings_total\":454,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"15 South River Road #310, St. George\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/order.firehousesubs.com\\/menu?service-mode=TAKEOUT&store-number=814\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:55:57','2023-09-19 05:55:57'),(81,'Little Caesars Pizza','googleplaces','ChIJrxMzdNRayoARojgb1MtzZrQ',87,'Carry-out chain featuring chicken wings, signature breadsticks & pizza tossed from housemade dough.',10,0.20,0,0,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.0960407,\"lng\":-113.5687153},\"view