a4\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Everything about this experience was truly awful. The female employee that \\u201cserved\\u201d me said maybe three words all while looking at me like I had offended her by walking in. Truly hope this place gets some much needed training. I instantly regretted saying thank you as she replied with a snarky \\u201cyou\\u2019re welcome\\u201d all I asked for was the smallest cheese pizza which I was hoping would be decent\\u2026 nope, I would not be surprised if you told me it was a day old. I would much rather be hungry than stop here again.\",\"time\":1682140732,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Travis Woodsworth\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110995888343696218234\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUI-gUoXL11QDDpLjT1K0cwjCeMc3_86GXUx4PAn4dQTUc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"I love the service I receive at this Little Caesar\\u2019s Pizza. They greet me and are careful to take care of my order needs. You get what you pay for at Little Caesar\\u2019s Pizza. That doesn\\u2019t mean it isn\\u2019t quality. It just means it is not meant to be high end pizza. It saves me time cooking and that is alright by me!\",\"time\":1690423870,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Ashley H\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107771916439729279253\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVVavaH7t0UT5Opxhqv2FrNiWeXFA-LsRSSNsNn-u-8q7n4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"While the pizza tastes good. Don\'t order online and think they will have your order at the promised time.  If it was a one off thing I would not post a review. But it is EVERY single time.  What ever time you want it for order an hour in advance.\",\"time\":1681520601,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Heather Cummins\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118411204822531185121\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWIf6lO7kTfDbtaumdcNcP5DblIYGnRp_DWqRNg9cNaE3w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"I don\\u2019t know what happened to this food. Normally little Caesar\\u2019s crazy bread is fluffy and covered in butter and seasoning. Our crazy bread was crunchy, hard, and had no seasoning in it at all. Normally their cheesy bread is fluffy and fully cooked. Our cheesy bread was stiff and undercooked. All in all, it was disgusting. Their dough was not their normal recipe and it was obvious.\",\"time\":1647122429,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Matthew\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118287435393512581143\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjX7Rj_p-4Ex8Dulawr4wAZES78RzCfGPpZvmGoXKpZAeuA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"Ordered the ExtraMostBestest Sausage & this is what we received, which looks like less sausage than the Classic Sausage.\\n\\nI called & they said they\'d replace the pizza for free the next day, so that is good. But these kids definitely need more training or just look at a picture & copy what\'s on the picture\",\"time\":1646444273,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":false,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_delivery\",\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant