,\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104303470393572584912\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXcetGh5BE1zW-Qnn-Y8Kaphh_gRj7yh6RsopzvZYnSygE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"I went to subways a lot when I was younger then I saw this disturbing sign now in question what the hell was I eating? I thought subway was always fresh and now they have a sign advertising fresh deli meat. What was I eating when I was younger stuff that was not fresh apparently. So that means subway has lied ever since it was created. Until now obviously.\",\"time\":1690812544,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Amara Flores\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100416643150483053355\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKvE6NSKxFRsDzsD8ePObktE-a2uiUKGNaOI_QSVCwp=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"This is the lowest star I can give if 0 was an option I would do it because they are cheap here. They give you the littlest amount of sauce, veggies And TOLD ME THAT I HAVE TO PAY EXTRA FOR THE FREE CONDIMENTS IT COMES WITH? That\\u2019s is so Ridiculous I shouldn\\u2019t have to pay more and if this comes out of ur employees pocket then that mean you need to find a new job. This is why you should never come here if you are trying to get more then what they are willing to give you.\",\"time\":1690993023,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Nikki R\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111155327988746936520\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKegt9s_Zc1vxXXp3Hq6qrTlWdUlV13-sklt4mTsQ78mKk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"This is by far the worst location in town. The lack of customer service is astounding! We ordered a sandwich online and showed up 15 minutes after it was supposed to be ready and it was not ready. Had to wait in line and they claimed we already picked it up. We had not already picked it up. We ended up finally getting a sandwich 45 minutes later! And they think they deserve a tip at the time of ordering for this kind of service?! We will never visit this location again. Every time we do it\\u2019s been one issue after another. The lack of management at this store is completely unacceptable.\",\"time\":1678578102,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"T J\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101295991033567608904\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVbYSj7-vdgANA4GSFyRMv7BMrb5Nii99gluWNqw9JEXiOT=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Do NOT come here. The little white girl with glasses HATES being asked how her day is going. She replies madly with \\\"I\'m working what do you want?\\\" I hope she find a jjob she actually likes or when I\'m in a worse mood ill come jump over that little counter and show her how bad her day can truly get\\ud83d\\ude18 pep up ugly..  You\'re ugly.but if you had a better personality it might help a little \\ud83e\\udd37\\ud83c\\udffd\\u200d\\u2640\\ufe0f all of us work ugly ..get over it or quit!\",\"time\":1683220063,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Baylee Van Patten\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110104044766144097088\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVY_hGG0TH9wafrcocKh-JfeLgBZD4wiXe_Fg0tuqYp92w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"I was surprised by how fresh the food looked and tasted. The service was great too :)\",\"time\":1685454261,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=10627462845284305036\",\"user_ratings_total\":208,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"765 East 700 South, St. George\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.com\\/united-states\\/ut\\/st-george\\/765-e-700-s?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=2693&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ4OTkxOTgtNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:57','2023-09-19 05:55:57'),(83,'Subway','googleplaces','ChIJ_YR56gtbyoARsjeeJRsSxfk',89,'Casual counter-serve chain for build-your-own sandwiches & salads, with health-conscious options.',10,0.20,1,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.1243409,\"lng\":-113.5298247},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.1257363302915,\"lng\":-113.5283695197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.1230383697085,\"lng\":-113.5310674802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Subway\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108641306468647818889\\\">Robert Bolar<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zglnITxFOxWRg1XFi_ycYiSW3k105JendRK1nzrCTC_KbBdjxSvADh5IZVGe0qn_1KDtm29-m5ijlSvNbo8ScICOkYcjR5IohRhIKfORfCvDgPll6wzmv1