zoU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"It was really good! The staff was friendly and the food was delicious. I tried the Baja steak sandwich and it did not disappoint!\\n\\nI had to go back and get this sub again!  So yummy!\\n\\nI took my son today to celebrate a mountain biking win!\",\"time\":1662492865,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Dee N\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112555726895533948665\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKYKUx9CGE2gjERXlpixG1Y6oH5VTjVH-H-Y1e2V9uA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Dahni gave me great service. Our subs were fresh and delicious!\\nPrices are lower than other sub restaurants. And the bread is so fresh and delicious.\",\"time\":1687030076,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Pansies Again\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115486633990930151800\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUXW-QO3M7xWnWx7bKW7AHT6Xt9vLQu9osvhBMDeSWqvzc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"I ordered the toasted Philly steak and cheese with peppers and onions and had the waitress pike on the veggies. It was very satisfying and delicious.\",\"time\":1690593417,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"tala Paiva\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101442618045821445060\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJ0ATYfAPPmPpbpJxiS2lHJ01fs5Rx4MJPDkhnTcbPWiA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"Gentleman with the long hair & cap is wonderful. Great customer service and very helpful with suggestions. Thank you for your positive attitude. Such a welcoming atmosphere, we ended up dining in haha This is now our go to spot\",\"time\":1679096393,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=17997811393660598194\",\"user_ratings_total\":163,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"2654 Red Cliffs Drive Bldg 1 Unit A, St. George\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.com\\/united-states\\/ut\\/st-george\\/2654-e-red-cliffs-dr?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=15144&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ5MTMwMTctNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:57','2023-09-19 05:55:57'),(84,'Subway','googleplaces','ChIJ7bbCwFlFyoARFlN1qqlQMLI',90,'Casual counter-serve chain for build-your-own sandwiches & salads, with health-conscious options.',10,0.20,NULL,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.059787,\"lng\":-113.5864849},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.06114578029149,\"lng\":-113.5850331697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.0584478197085,\"lng\":-113.5877311302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Subway\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":1080,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100238993859662029469\\\">Jay Yu<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjXr99SgGwoX3kkeDL23_wu4rsQ2