943026999721\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJp3bFzr8FhNvO7dHBPynAFeZPEw3QC6QhsKIuNTqBM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"The service was good and we went and a not super busy time. The toasting of the bread was amazing but I could have used a little more toppings.\",\"time\":1681795719,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mallory Peterson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117990098958215921681\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJ9abU-wWhR0i_F7NFQunH9wGgzTl-iRuZ9tnoOhBSemNc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Their food had freezer burn on it. Almost every tin. Quality of food is gross, even the bread was off\",\"time\":1683153810,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tina Porter\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115018490821774640180\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJ9TFfT3Zx11RgCdrxyLjdvQPD-Y83EhwOdo8eq7ua_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"We were traveling through and stopped for dinner. We were in line around 8:40 pm. The girl was helping a mom and a couple of kids. By the time she was done helping them and after we sat in line for 20 minutes the worker informs us they close at 9:00 and now we need to leave. She refused to help us. I asked for the managers number, I called several times with no call back.  Terrible customer service.\",\"time\":1660613317,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jay Yu\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100238993859662029469\\/reviews\",\"langua