\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110916215025022773686\\\">Logan Clymore<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhCjSDWd-CecB1MVectcwSYojULfjNsw6O8u2A5ADacA2P9xtLf9CFvVSmlQsADPUzGuph_-_dtAcH5OtaOc-s4dEcp1polwuRX7Rianb3J7KnVS9NUuvtkzWUk0vXp7t_BLy58hIwck447t2L17a10ju2UMT2iAmSy2yPIXFgVm96M\",\"width\":3264},{\"height\":4000,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113500605632116158895\\\">Joe Seely<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhKaYHhjQAlz6CW1Pp7QmS7DUsh8hYX8rHl9Ovo1hj6y7--U8RGaqVwBkr62LatymEJk0KevGbWUiCfKKENOPbKdIkTSQ3J40lDOUlFLr2uCywwvz9XPPQYXurvl0K6VqmrWr4Xm3eilJbpBTrIc8LncruP3veWj9RHkfSlKxPzbFWQ\",\"width\":3000},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107414039338792934891\\\">Todd Moen<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhcUxkZkkCImE_Cb5GYyNLJy7rTbAIrbc_O5X-ys645Sd9c04B0AviQDJKoqCSzArNUGhN_iFMqYo_0sQmYG2zFRotkT1aEG2JxVutMcxFBkymEFc97WtdFvm2ursFCe7CT_wUXUvOk_F4byCklnjhoEWuuTXYKLne_lnW-bI6eNajR\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJOa4FbyRbyoAROiqedldv-M0\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"4C5Q+97 St. George, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85984C5Q+97\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJOa4FbyRbyoAROiqedldv-M0\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Daniel McClenahan\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113542641207252602837\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXvC88A8f05Uj_aBR0DzE0N0l8uMJO6Q8OLZ0azXY5iZg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"I was asked to give more information regarding my experience for a 3 star review. I only wish to state that 3 stars is not bad it\'s simply average which is what the whole experience has been the last several times I\'ve ordered from Papa Johns.\\n\\nI\'ll start by saying that their ordering system is user friendly however their coupon or deal set-up is less friendly. While I can have a staff member on a phone order apply applicable coupons the online system is less consistent sometimes allowing a coupon while others not. I am sure this could be my lack of understanding and that\'s why this didn\'t play into my review.\\n\\nThe service is often to be desires, I feel often when entering the location I\'ve ordered from to pick up my order there is often a lack of front counter communication. On this most recent order I waited for 15 minutes after receiving a text update that my order was ready before any of the 5 visible staff members acknowledged me, while I do believe someone said hello the second I walked in I didn\'t see who that person was. I watched as they were all working on something and so I wasn\'t feeling ignored only they they were busy. Because of the size and open plan of the location all their conversations were visible and it seemed less professional and more engaging in back and forth. Again this isn\'t a big issue as weekend pizza is a busier time than say a Wednesday night.\\n\\nThe reason for the 2 star on the service is the lack of any talk at all, asked my name saw my order was paid gave me my pizzas and went back to the kitchen area. I was unable to request parmasean or red pepper or napkins or plates. My continued standing at the counter was primarily ignored until I resigned to the fact that I had these things at home and could just make due.\\n\\n3 stars is an expected experience neither amazing nor sub par, I do feel there could be a bit more focus on the customer experience ESPECIALLY since they\'ve taken to requesting tips on pick up orders when all that is being done is just making of the food. Service to the person you\'re asking a gratuity of could be stepped up and care could be taken with any person walking through their door...... however it\'s not outside of business normality for pizza establishments in this area.\",\"time\":1692997466,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Joe Seely\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113500605632116158895\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUX-C3OAjjHMgvJB1wYzZBmu3shebf7PfcW0ZQwwGd6Y9A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"As always, food was delicious.  However, there was a sign on the sidewalk and building that said buy one get one 50%off.\\nThe guy inside said that it is only on Mondays. Well, the sign doesn\'t say that at all, and why is the sign out on the sidewalk on Tuesday?\\nFor this reason, I would not recommend going here as I feel like I got screwed.\\n\\nI received a replay saying it is stated on the signs that the deal is only on Mondays.\\nI don\'t see it (see attached photos)\",\"time\":1680808174,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Joshua Weightman\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106510318252955036722\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXB-FB0tC0iV7YV2NP_y5cERIBizUU09qsIu3H92huEJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"With two employees covering register, preparing dough and making pizzas on a busy night, they could have had more help.\\n\\nThe pizza was ordered to be half one style and half the other...it was more like 75% and 25%, and the 25% that was meant to be veggie garden hardly had anything on it. We were very disappointed at the quality of food received.\\n\\nMy wait time was more than triple than originally quoted, and several other customers showed their own discomfort.\\n\\nI highly recommend further action is taken to avoid this in the future.\",\"time\":1647413729,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kevin Taylor\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105720371697475065100\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLYdt8XCBs5YsfiJJK8sjigFmywEP_qcroeL-dJf0c=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"Are you serious??  I am nervous to think about what the hell really happened to my Works specialty pizza.   We drove down to St George to bury my Mother in Law.  I had just spent 5 hours in the car with my family and my brother in law.  I was really looking forward to this pizza.   Came away from this experience super disappointed.   You should probably just go pick up pizza from the other St George location.\",\"time\":1655083378,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kody Q\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117708136890154103245\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocL6T_rP53flQVvzuRVu2ZVyvevWycqgZaiazlAQhGEP=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"We went into the store and ordered two pizzas.  Before we left we checked our order and one was wrong.  I asked the night manager if they would make us the correct pizza.  He said he had heard something else and would not unless we paid.  I asked if he was serious and he said yes.  I asked if it was worth it to get a review about what happened and then he said \\\"ok, bye you can leave\\\" and turned around and walked off basically telling me to get out of the store.  I even asked the other person with me what I ordered and they said he got it wrong.  When I tried to talk to him about it he just went in the back and would not talk.  I had to leave with the wrong order.  Papa Johns has a satisfaction guarantee, but he would not honor it unless I was willing to pay.\",\"time\":1680842235,\"translated\":false}],\"secondary_opening_hours\":[{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"1030\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"1030\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1030\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1030\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"2300\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-21\",\"day\":4,\"time\":\"1030\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"0100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-22\",\"day\":5,\"time\":\"1030\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"0100\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-23\",\"day\":6,\"time\":\"1030\"}}],\"type\":\"DELIVERY\",\"weekday_text\":[\"Monday: 10:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200911:00\\u202fPM\",\"Tuesday: 10:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200911:00\\u202fPM\",\"Wednesday: 10:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200911:00\\u202fPM\",\"Thursday: 10:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200911:00\\u202fPM\",\"Friday: 10:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20091:00\\u202fAM\",\"Saturday: 10:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u20091:00\\u202fAM\",\"Sunday: 10:30\\u202fAM\\u2009\\u2013\\u200911:00\\u202fPM\"]},{\"open_now\":true,\"periods\":[{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"2140\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-24\",\"day\":0,\"time\":\"1030\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"2140\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-18\",\"day\":1,\"time\":\"1030\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"2140\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-19\",\"day\":2,\"time\":\"1030\"}},{\"close\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"2140\"},\"open\":{\"date\":\"2023-09-20\",\"day\":3,\"time\":\"1030\"}