7fbgrC\",\"width\":2340},{\"height\":1080,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100106937764695020995\\\">Yessica Puertas<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhLgiSTcI1IFRLChXGm4OV4OUwEy72VKvppVrvbHKDoOs18HI_w6PZX8WG15wxP9Cjkeg_zD28QYcykQQifhHvGYCpH03I2Z99JGznCTzmqv1qlP19ddjROuhNSodCx6bwR-vefa3iXMzd1CFLU8g9-LQX368x_qx44dudtvsxbuO6c\",\"width\":1920},{\"height\":4160,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107679799622103042322\\\">Tamara<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zj7omJ7hm_ipJS5vaDSwerRjBXt6wcbfd6bFfqAMbaf4FO4LQcGqccLZmAiT1nsH98bCW2zewWzJgN1JtTvISHHqQRK1mSonWUijebZCnvrO1CA9Gcaelb_DOrlb17ZrzTvxc-6A6FU9KPesBLEUbs3QTrGYBi7_5o1mg_Hv4O2oL-7\",\"width\":2340},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114387088400011061540\\\">Christopher Cates<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhvdL_Q3KKLphJaXXvHkkbAOd9kiCIZr3UpwF4P58LpAv6Ats2eMBQof1qnFDVWnrycxQWQ1b_uLpZq4VvaGpaAwAmd1a0gILKzfpRR_MFItaaUqwI0c6lisZtf-n5h9_3071TiEsLzbMGTcEVUmG7cVA65WGw6RkNIf9MMWdM4I77Q\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJJyZ69aNbyoARti61zKYwaEY\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"4FGJ+FR Washington, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85984FGJ+FR\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.3,\"reference\":\"ChIJJyZ69aNbyoARti61zKYwaEY\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Christopher Cates\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114387088400011061540\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXEUXr6m6c6OX7wEeyy6gLwO0LqgL59GAY5a37gAtCLFf4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"12 months ago\",\"text\":\"I\\u2019m a plant based eater and so is my family, therefore when I order us subway, I order it with \\u201cmore\\u201d veggies and I rarely have an occasion where it\\u2019s not right. Except for lunch today, we all actually got LESS. This is my wrap, it\\u2019s very empty than normal even though I ordered MORE and it\\u2019s all over the receipt for the entire order. I called twice and was left on hold for several minutes, I wanted to be credited back for the food I didn\\u2019t receive. He said they follow a guide on the amount of food and all of my order was per that guide. I said, I eat at subway all over Utah and the US, this is the least amount of food I\\u2019ve ever gottten on my wrap and our sandwiches EVER! He said the best he could do is give me a free sandwich, I said no thanks! I won\\u2019t be doing business with this location EVER again!\",\"time\":1663706027,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Joshua Youngbluth\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110771483486846329734\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV_Eh8LWxVgNVfZtsnswCNJyDDx5KP9-dZgUx94lxMA_2w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"Always out of stock of what ever you want... Bread is stale. Cucumbers nasty almost translucent. Poorly managed if I was the owner of this franchise I would be ashamed. Also over priced compared to other subways in the area....\",\"time\":1639699807,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Madison Hendrickson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116880177740209205921\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIKFA3TEdGVP5Fz5qX4P6sri7_GlRiEDYW88ZO2eSyK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Our food was gross. The veggies were soggy and the meat was disgusting. I do not recommend dinning here I know I never will.\",\"time\":1688320266,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Cassandra Finch\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118405793013795247358\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLJX9JI4hZzdVrqEEHeq_SIZlKmzvZfbF5hhl7Ni8Ni=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"10 months ago\",\"text\":\"Terrible slow service, the sandwiches were made incorrectly through and through, so little meat, little cheese, our of everything, completely overpriced. The staff complains of being tired and unmotivated the entire time. The incompetence at this location is just straight unacceptable and unbelievable.\",\"time\":1667592530,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lynn Geiser\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112685123952569372697\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLe3syZO-G9TtuVQrHKTpySh1E0EvJs5taySfvx7CLl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"I was on my way into Walmart and really needed a cold water they only had one water bottle in the cooler and it looked like it had been thrown on the floor a dozen times so I went to the counter just to get a soda then I mentioned to the guy at the counter about the water bottle he just rolled his eyes at me. So I got a Sprite Which I couldn\'t believe $2.27 for a small soda I can get a 6-inch sub with meat on it vegetables for $4.69 so that\'s ridiculous there was no customer service no friendliness I don\'t know I never get a soda I don\'t know where the cups are didn\'t tell me where the cups were just very unpleasant experience\",\"time\":1657498842,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"foo