,{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112617960921077876827\\\">Andrea Cook<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zj9bDw39SD_sZiYOM8X7ysUQveikF6IXZSeMPIThIuuqeUZ5r8OFeh4Z7jcRJArucgbMjpbjTYfiKBVTE1NsZsmpHt_TeGt7bbIN_wd6MCeMZJMCjMFPoCBgdSZoi8nXjBOCYYSd-NRBx0AH2NHs80IC-7OeH07-YgrnKFkbFs30NHA\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ1ag99ntEyoARbqN-cTKnOQM\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"49CF+XH St. George, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"859849CF+XH\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJ1ag99ntEyoARbqN-cTKnOQM\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"brenden neumeier\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113753825291306969393\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUMwy8N1rB6BpL58Lf6pCVo4o_jB1V9VShPzRkwEbfpHfs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"I door dash, I showed up to pick up an order and the sandwich artist was making an order for another dasher. He took his time and made them very slow. Once he was done he then informed me that it was going to be another 15 minutes before the breads were ready, this was at 10 am. I had waited for 10 minutes at the location before I was informed this and had to un-assign the order and move on to another. This affects our metrics so we can\\u2019t make as much money per hour. I wish I had be informed about the bread as soon as I had gotten there so I could have moved on to another order.\",\"time\":1683821511,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Andrew Howard\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107388452667143680735\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXNbWzyDsZ1K2q09AaF_5FXaeunkHpPNeM7i1Vovl5Y3w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"I don\\u2019t know who made this Sandwich or what demon possessed it before it got a priest to give it a exorcism but this is the worst looking sandwich I have ever seen how did they manage to get cucumbers out of the sandwich and into the middle of the sandwich wrapper if I wanted a meal that was ran over already I would have went to McDonald\\u2019s.they even threw condiments that I didn\\u2019t even want on it.\",\"time\":1689722854,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Andrea Cook\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112617960921077876827\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWAdSS-Nzn271HAqyT4tcfvnZl--Y639H9r8IebfIK2SPM-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 years ago\",\"text\":\"Definitely one of the worst subways I\\u2019ve been to. Ordered online and 20 minutes later when we got there, it still wasn\\u2019t finished, and I was the only one in the building. Our sandwiches looked like the two girls just threw everything on there, plus the order wasn\\u2019t even correct. Cold food, not professional, overall just a really poor experience.\",\"time\":1557020541,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Steve C\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113987789686960785994\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIqu_ik6GkawWljQ2sYT98EJfvIrlqCNUzq7rEM6wea=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Very fast service. Good value compared to other fast food places and sandwiches were made exactly as ordered.\",\"time\":1681975884,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Phulcanelli\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109862800306141798456\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocI5LhAThmcus6eY74SYWvisElILmcvMOOG3z2URue5E=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"Ok - quest for the Holy Graal of Phillys in this here town you all.  ... and thus had to try Subway for a baseline. Ok .. We all know the Subway Philly is generic (relatively speaking ) and not a true contender vs. a true  PHILLY restaurant that specializes....  With that in mind - service here was great and friendly. We did our best to make a classic Philly, but obviously certain things are not available as the tradition goes.  But overall the sandwich was enjoyable and unlike my last experience\\/review I was careful to not overload on the mayo.  Yup - Subway ain\'t bad and of course good price point.  Yeeeee Ha !  Gave extra star just for the friendly service... otherwise sandwich 3 star.  Peace out.\",\"time\":1676515557,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=232400690880619374\",\"user_ratings_total\":105,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"1973 West Sunset Boulevard, St. George\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.com\\/united-states\\/ut\\/st-george\\/1973-west-sunset-blvd?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=30708&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ4OTU1NDgtNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:58','2023-09-19 05:55:58'),(88,'Little Caesars Pizza','googleplaces','ChIJF6GhmaBbyoAR-s5JsGCUDOQ',94,'Carry-out chain featuring chicken wings, signature breadsticks & pizza tossed from housemade dough.',10,0.20,0,0,