n\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWFw5QH_Uv-xScEUTccm4png6bRHHPVEIltbIB04pCS-u0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"It\'s Little Ceasars. I\'m not sure why the ratings are so bad. Yes, once in a while, they run behind, who doesn\'t now. The staff has always been helpful and friendly to us. The app has always been in sync with our orders. We love the cool machine that you can use by yourself. They are always well stocked. It\'s kept clean. This location has many designated parking spots directly in front of it, so you can get in and out quickly.\",\"time\":1690607651,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Justin \\u201cMujica\\u201d Bailey-Rockefeller\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112670812080276047412\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWtmYB_KjRzg424JwaVGQxClSed3fBcVvFGNAPBW3C9h2yi=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Little Caesars, oh so neat,\\nPizza pie that can\'t be beat,\\nNo temple recommend to show,\\nBut their food still steals the show.\\n\\nHot-N-Ready, always there,\\nNo pre-order, no need to stare,\\nWings and breadsticks, toppings too, Create-your-own for a pizza new.\\n\\nAffordable and quick to please,\\nA go-to for busy bees,\\nNo matter the lack of \\\"proof\\\",\\nTheir food is still a delicious TRUTH\\n\\nLittle Caesars, a tasty treat, A delicious pizza you must eat,\\nDon\'t let the temple recommend,\\nKeep you away from this delicious SIN.\",\"time\":1680042968,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Stormy Oller\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108034433947585352004\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXHddOZtNbl2to1tDGYKVudQz33bqTAfvSxStfZvyG7zWo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"9 months ago\",\"text\":\"Always running behind. Employees too busy eating and chatting to get things done. No estimated wait times given when orders aren\'t ready. Horrible service all around.\\nAttached we have a photo of an employee sitting on a food surface having a nice chat. The second photo is an employees lunch on another food prep surface that he\'s too busy eating to acknowledge his elderly front counter guest.\",\"time\":1670195373,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Emily P\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115442580058853504162\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocK4dvqE-f-Mid33Na64o6oHsFQGWRGNgVSriyVnCEY8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"Sept 2 went in to pick up our order... used to love little Caesars but this location, a lot lately, has been dishing out pizza like this. No we didn\'t order thin crust. First photo is the back of the pizza\",\"time\":1662347597,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Madison Hart\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100324512301523907401\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLdW8WPoKCxfTlycExFv__j5XounnxNTmIuLgMkJRgK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"The best place! Whoever was working last night is a Saint. They were 4 minutes past close and the worker offered to let me come in anyways. I told him I felt bad and that it was okay. Next thing I know he\'s running out the door to give us pizza! Thank you SO MUCH\",\"time\":1685941964,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunc