_AZWFHT-RDzWRlsI3oFb\",\"width\":1960}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJT0iT5JlEyoARhmlumXjJ3Yg\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"49FX+WF St. George, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"859849FX+WF\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.8,\"reference\":\"ChIJT0iT5JlEyoARhmlumXjJ3Yg\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Mark Baumbach\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104875650161161898624\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIt9kUnGWxcrVJjQ8lpB0fvSJQAnFsv5AOrZY9-kcYH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"A dreadful experience this time. We popped in for food. The selection was poor at 7:30 at night.. Ordered 2 bigger meals. The cashier charged me for four. When I questioned it, she  realized the error and said I had to wait 15 minutes for the manager to return. Ridiculous. No apology. No attempt to take  responsibility. I was actually asked to step aside so they could deal with the next customer.\\n\\nAll of the meats were dried out. The vegetables undercooked. But what really ticks me off is the lack of an apology.\",\"time\":1684858674,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Slowstroll\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104189121018371441923\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXL8NAS3gl86h1Su9zWeYIjO8-OvWKl5f9tMY1cxW3sVg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Love this place! Food has been very flavorful and good portions each time I have visited. Aaric the manager and all of his staff are very friendly and welcoming.\",\"time\":1692994350,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Malcolm Widener\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111704214385555476823\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXryR_CsnUjsNL-8SQPzTQSuWUQCSEXxwY6POkaxcwuMQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"The food was good, but I\\u2019ve gone multiple times when they\\u2019ve told me that they only have one or two entree options left. This has been several hours before closing time as well. The line can take quite a long time and even if you place an order online the pickup times are inaccurate. Store always looks dirty when I\\u2019m there as well. All that said, I will still be coming back because the food is good and the prices are reasonable\",\"time\":1687240515,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lynn Nelson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109144409449269496262\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJlVh-BYbqjHT6nRVkDjR_ObOF0ZmbgNGBGZbg0rSs8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Should have checked the poor reviews first.  Ordered on the app so it would be ready to pick up. Showed up 8 minutes after they said it would ready and the hadn\'t even started my order. Then they tell me it will be 5 minute wait to make the Kung pay. So I chose something else but half the entrees were out. Then to top it off they gave me no utensils though I asked for them. The employees were not apologetic and could care less.\",\"time\":1689820726,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Amanda Ballif\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107447818194334882646\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU1MmKqzJVgCnJ8vCOm2Mbld4VykWjCWpmBTlspsex5-9oq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"As I was getting my food, a worker in a mask, a very dirty mask, was putting his wallet on a cutting board and trying to get out some money. He had his gloves on still and seemed just really acting unusually. Masks are being outlawed in Banks and other places because there are people who are trying to get away with stuff by wearing them. It just gave me a really weird feeling to be in there knowing that there was all of this going on.\",\"time\":1693005222,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=9862260278818662790\",\"user_ratings_total\":534,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"1091 N. Bluff St. Space# 104, St. George\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.pandaexpress.com\\/locations\\/ut\\/saint-george\\/1091-n-bluff-st-space-104\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:55:59','2023-09-19 05:55:59'),(90,'Chick-fil-A','googleplaces','ChIJg5NVOCFbyoARvgOUCWDtPCc',96,'Fast-food chain serving chicken sandwiches & nuggets along with salads & sides.',10,0.20,1,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.1067243,\"lng\":-113.5551554},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.10818688029151,\"lng\":-113.5538144197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.10548891970851,\"lng\":-113.5565123802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Chick-fil-A\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\