4\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Adam Hadjis\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101895298979665586138\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUWlXQQS2EG7l4e2SHx8sPDbcaZ9NK7RtxbfxTnhkBUVsY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Horrible customer service!!! Why are we trying to be like Chick-fil-a with tablets outside in a microscopic parking lot??? On top of that there is no clear direction for traffic flow, and don\\u2019t even try to park your vehicle during lunch. Your disrespectful employee taking orders outside today was more than rude to my wife. He\\u2019s lucky I wasn\\u2019t in the car with her because he would have gotten a rude AWAKENING!!! I suggest you train your staff to HELP patrons figure out where to go and how you want the flow of traffic to work. Here\\u2019s another idea, put out some cones or A-frame signs to direct traffic, not some punk kid with an iPad and zero people skills.\",\"time\":1679684616,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Peter Lynch\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114109557925644496495\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW90Tpjnv2xPa6DKt0G5hNAE7CMMSOWlOPix24ofhQk2Q8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"Small JJ\'s with no real indoor seating.  Does offer outdoor seating which is good about 9-10 months of the year so not too bad.  It does have a drive up, not super noticeable, drive around to the rear of the building to place order.  I went inside to order, as the commercials go, \\\"Freaky Fast\\\" service probably a minute at most, sandwich was fine, very typical of the brand.  Would certainly go again when in the area and looking for a sandwich.\",\"time\":1675199542,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Bryan Alexander\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106331758687394684846\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIOofiHirEa4_GGh7PG9qk_lHIToA3pBV95DH3taoHm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 years ago\",\"text\":\"For a fast healthy choice its a really good place. I have not been disappointed until now. I wanted something other then soda and really didn\'t want water. However there was lemonade and it was far from lemonade and says it right on it! Please get some other types of juices that are real juice! Please....\",\"time\":1536183246,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Paul Whitmer\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117573849467596414493\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXn1SpX7YuAdm9IRAv0Eu6YiAGxXEIGfKS4c5FHmri4sl0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 years ago\",\"text\":\"I do enjoy the sandwiches from Jimmy.  I try and remember to ask for the guts...you\'ll have to try it, unless you are carb counting.  High quality whichever one I go to...so far.\",\"time\":1573587918,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tina Mcquivey\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101654511967919754937\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIc-60AxJcBEN5SEEMgtHDGxB5l6LKNLw9XSQ_8YzA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"It\'s usually  pretty good  but they was out of the bread I like and cheese I ordered 4 sandwiches.\",\"time\":1681824396,\"translated\":false}],\"secon