hoto_reference\":\"ATJ83zhqHP_aVMq2Yi63p9VZjnVl_vfvqfTDIQdgKJqLNM89m_inLj_67kklST7ieCSTVz1OK_obRYtgNEC-tmsSRAhKCiCXV4H6Qud86sroFwEx0U3ByktkEIGiVPA-zeGGj7UoQa-BI4SZOAvKZ1AMZCzwZ6yB8T4YxGE6EixmO5_HiH_q\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110062444690370623925\\\">David Shvartsman<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziKJqfJHjat7rvq0RMpQm_2guLvPuShXFuuEzDWWzKrELIF_qGwgn1gxBEUzRA1YqQ2hKoAV563y7YnH62KBqXFDKdQO2cox2IYjH-l7MrgmPEFyH3Ahc_-ETRdY8u8xrxduxB9X7Yp88oDGAA-zRFBfG77gPg4kC6E9Aw4sbW_iZs8\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":2184,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104320314123687985241\\\">Tony DeJesus<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgdTLUS2qsvCPnuOxrElRFuI-HlBbe33CsHQwPC0FEV9yxAQ2tiz_jCTg516kQ58kDJ1XDhlOJI0t_0J4FOXIETg0h42-_J5SaK-9P4kUvTwG5y7dfWv-WAv31gEbsIJPKrm5tbfK7QIkiEfejHxrdCIN0LqlTIBHl6ZW-kZZJ6nT59\",\"width\":4608}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJaXJbGT_uyoARCMHewRxCVSE\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"6Q4V+5Q Virgin, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85986Q4V+5Q\"},\"rating\":4.4,\"reference\":\"ChIJaXJbGT_uyoARCMHewRxCVSE\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Adriana Perez\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100584058031198024099\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV4fchRB8iH3PGpwMk8hciLaw0kQg6mL7fOW3sagfc9v6k-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"This is a cute little stop on the way to Zion. They have a shop and a petting zoo that is very entertaining for small children.\\nThey also have an ice cream parlor inside; the ice cream was good but the attendant wasn\'t very friendly.\\nWe did the petting zoo and the animal looked unkempt, but it was still entertaining.\",\"time\":1694614535,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Josh Backes\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101756691761664961914\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKe2Ij_2drjxOEPuHsTzSFQ_Y8m3f4yF61jytJMykWM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Beautiful location but long line for the shuttles so go early. If you have a small child will be difficult to do any of the moderate trails. Wear appropriate shoes and attire it can be slippery if it rains.\",\"time\":1694017615,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Karina Bertelli\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103335231545270309970\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXtwIMWamgzhZiFI7zniCYTWcWAVeO8Y0ZNkDqQuTvDsSE4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"What a cool place to visit on your way to or from Zions! We stopped by on the way in and found so many fun treasures that we had to come back on the way out and buy gifts for all our family members! The staff was very friendly and knowledgeable. There is honestly something for everyone here. Rocks, knives, jewelry, toys, magnets, and even hot sauce!\\n\\nThe prices are a bit much on certain things, but it\'s expected due to location and such. They even have an ice cream shop where I got to try cactus ice cream for the first time. I didn\'t know what to expect, but it was creamy with a hint of \\\"plant?\\\" Haha\\n\\nThey even have a petting zoo up front that you pay 2 dollars to visit and pet the animals. As well as an \\\"old city\\\" that you can walk around and check out.\",\"time\":1685334222,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Erastos Evdoxiadis\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103471872578511279371\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU51_ggZ0oCmDoGHOWjfUaIG4_YCUPUOSoCI7rxUp89wg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"This was our first time to visit this place. We saw it on the side of the road. We paid a bit of money to go to the petting zoon they had, about $8, and it was fun. The store had interesting merchandise but as it goes with places of that type, it was very overpriced on many of the items. I would recommend visiting it.\",\"time\":1686938032,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Annetta Varner\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100967016618440934756\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVdbKBiSxdB_giEyZs4wCVZK5OD1TalqX_YFEswigwHhN1t=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Ice cream was great! My grandson loved feeding the animals out back, it was very reasonable.  Building were cute also.\",\"time\":1689863354,\"translated\":false}],\"types\":[\"tourist_attraction\",\"zoo\",\"jewelry_store\",\"restaurant\",\"store\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=2401898667551146248\",\"user_ratings_total\":1775,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"1000 W. Hwy 9, Virgin\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/fort-zion.business.site\\/?utm_source=gmb&utm_medium=referral\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:01','2023-09-19 05:56:01'),(97,'Bit & Spur Restaurant & Saloon','googleplaces','ChIJ3cBdWwLoyoAR4LBAcXDJRMA',103,'Popular cantina for contemporary Mexican & Southwestern fare plus a robust selection of craft beers.',15,0.20,1,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.1846801,\"lng\":-113.0031077},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.