dybNEdKtSRMDFYW56mf5G_zkOtBBWQyMcVO6DbANgXx-5_d7dylSf6AxaP6L_9XeVt51KWnUVDYSfG4q2BEuhtM9mGA2koKDMzfQRf6XxNG-VFnKZPrT0FE0Psi4mExMAB3HLkKwDaXw5LNi0t3IYfZrs7\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3456,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112698966407356811748\\\">Laraizag A<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgiuo8mrYvyuvhX5u_2YXs8frRIhXjP9N71RhHzzjAixBQ18NXMR5EhangSNCL3Z8UR71dGqlbp9eXGMBZDAO9vEfkvpugMu0Yxpczlor6FOU7uw_155L0xgU9Fe3zUaJurUN9pUb5VS97gDXlFCzUTorlw1CWBFLt274TBAnDCyoYk\",\"width\":4608},{\"height\":2268,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112698966407356811748\\\">Laraizag A<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhBw5FHWyiFWcLpIKh0KVvlOB8OS_KbB2cnxOfu34-T8O13YXRC4AfEGfER2R8mHG1Eig3p1k3QFXuHUaIej4R6SzXOmmgubx9fENawhdhFpeGVqeHRM0JiGItG6YQXrEI-34ECeXv5hzRJ_1GG2pSjDYowpn_a0zq5KWxGRjgnqV5m\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":900,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106095790106504260856\\\">Willy De Neef<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjTk4gNe3cOGf6bK0IttWeh7o6z_pYNsaiXt7j1mhN-I_-XZ7sOWfACWl6nPjAasqyUzc98jET96E1ytJ4aBUFkdlku3dXsPPzxiHncIADrj8SVKhnGVZpBNf08_NYh2PUMlIMslFGSFI5Ms5HRau_hltlerBLoDk86SCVX25j30p8c\",\"width\":1600},{\"height\":3456,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112698966407356811748\\\">Laraizag A<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zhW1tzSwQj6hyfxxlq8MnSZGK9t1GH1jcULK2w_cc53jqZHs6WOvxxQ8NFCvN-nm4MOwcF9HD5AhS2EfA-7zg5pFvjDVgJMT_O1aQh2-jvHJ75IpLYYudmnlJATGh1etajtDHRMPGrXNyqLAk6UI14nJKoocZ74AX_LDbs4dbNH7vNC\",\"width\":4608}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJGZ6c20vxyoARjz6QPWweI00\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"5PG2+GM Hurricane, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85985PG2+GM\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.9,\"reference\":\"ChIJGZ6c20vxyoARjz6QPWweI00\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"April Romine Sandry\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112205714922234961360\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVmk_10418Snr3g2UAcH79MrDnMmIdyDD63ulQk8-fGsQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"I\\u2019ve lived in Hurricane for almost a decade. Today was my first experience with the subway on state street. I\\u2019ve been to the one in Walmart and Springdale multiple times - but this one is closer to my residence (not sure why I haven\\u2019t stopped in here before?) The place was clean, the food was good, but the service was mediocre at best. The employee\\/shift manager training the new employee was snide and rude. Everything we asked for was \\u201cnot allowed\\u201d or of course an up charge. Which is totally fine!! I don\\u2019t mind paying for extra cheese or Italian bread instead of white. It was honestly just the way she spoke to me. Her demeanor and tone was rude, unfriendly, and unwelcoming. I\\u2019ve worked in customer service including the food industry, it makes a big difference the way you speak to people. Instead of saying, \\u201cyou can\\u2019t have that, it\\u2019s not allowed, and if I give it to you, I\\u2019ll get in trouble\\u201d. Try saying, \\u201cI\\u2019m sorry, but unfortunately we only offer white or wheat with that sandwich.\\u201d  I wasn\\u2019t asking for \\u201cfree\\u201d food or for you to be in trouble with your boss - I was merely asking to be supplied with the sandwich I asked for at WHATEVER cost you would sell it to anyone else. That\\u2019s it, that\\u2019s all. Honestly, I\\u2019d rather drive to Springdale for a sandwich because their employees are kind, respectful, and have better customer service.\",\"time\":1688758982,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Amy P\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107219835273239718649\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocK6DYbJzyLeuHT4dbVa3qtjtoRvqCjeDIETb2CLL_ct=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Order online and curbside pick up is my go to way to visit Subway. The sandwiches come out perfect each time\",\"time\":1694449834,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kiersten Williams\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112383269161296227249\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJDmibB_ozmcHlp-yzcKk49Cnoam-Olkqe8lJFltnPC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"We drove through the drive-through and nobody answered, there was no sign saying they weren\\u2019t taking orders that way or anything. Kind of annoying.\\n\\nSo we made an online order instead so we could just jump inside and grab it as we were in pjs already and not very presentable.\\n\\nThe girl that made our food was incredibly scattered and flustered with no one in line, and checked us out quickly. That\\u2019s fine. Got home and saw both sandwiches were missing ingredients, some ingredients were mixed up on the wrong sandwich, and the breads were wrong.\\n\\nI was very irritated by this point, but when I went back in, 2 boys were the only ones there and were very polite and made the sandwiches perfectly fine after that. They\\u2019re the only reason this review has any stars\\u2026\",\"time\":1685245296,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Marvelous Mareesha\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105073945962303114734\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWETbNi9hYwdtLaJyh0SJl8QPrU1TJL9YK9D4PCznNl2Tk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Honestly it was the young girl helping us tonight that made it she was there manning it all by herself and she moved fast and was incredibly friendly. My kids wanted me to back up just to thank her \\ud83d\\ude05\",\"time\":1693630185,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Susan Detton\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104186303564792983700\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXWUA5Qu3_6Srl8hpu-yISaTnYB-0wze0F3vNugzvDki5E=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Food all over the floor and tables. One of the sandwiches had meat only on one side. So soaked in sauce we ended up throwing them out. I would not recommend this place to anyone.!!!! When my husband opened his sandwich the bread was broken in pieces. She did\'t use a knife to cut it.\\nThe board of health needs to come in. I\'m never going back to that subway.\",\"time\":1685287265,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=5558319815343488655\",\"user_ratings_total\":435,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"525 West State Street, Hurricane\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.com\\/united-states\\/ut\\/hurricane\\/525-w-state-st?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=4056&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ5MTcwOTctNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:56:01','2023-09-19 05:56:01'),(99,'Zion Pizza & Noodle Co','googleplaces','ChIJL38pz6fCyoARAQCXkucmIkQ',105,'Mormon church turned intimate eatery with unique slate-stone-cooked p