s:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV_bPVnMjGupopUt2Y-AXvASL74L2jA3J4E-E_b_IKg8Nk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"Hike all day & then come grab the most delicious crispy yet airy crust pizza in Springdale\\u2026 yes please!  I suggest you do the same. The Fire sticks as an appy are genius!! Well done Zion pizza!! And the view.. cannot beat it.\",\"time\":1694562519,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Matthew P\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118190852717306961110\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV3JnGJJqu03W98flP9eRZkcwC_AzXQ42YvESSCKmJZ6Q1I=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Had a loooong drive from LA and after a quick scenic drive we stopped here for some epic pasta and calzone. The service was amazing and the artwork is stupendous.  The music and atmosphere is great with the subtle clanking of dishes, great music and quiet conversations. You won\'t regret stopping here and packing in some carbs.\",\"time\":1692413957,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Michael Ruelas\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105250018986059596931\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKE4l_VG8iTExJMc9Q_4oazlKkS-8r5VuAMUAOweIG_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"We were happy we chose to eat here. Once evening hit it was evident this was the place to dine based on how full it was: The food was great, and the atmosphere is perfect. Service took a hit because host supposedly text me that my table was ready but I never received the text. It wasn\\u2019t until I kept seeing people seated that arrived after me that I asked and we were sat. She said the text didn\\u2019t work, not sure what that means.\",\"time\":1690085496,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Tatianna Harris\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106920785735278747234\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU0y--wq4q85pyGfbvOsbqvzs1HOyLqLvxj9zINV7qqeMRs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"The Pizza is all the same size - medium, which is plenty for 2 people. They have unique options to choose from, all the ones we chose were delicious.\\nDraft beers are good as well. We tried the Wasatch Apricot Hefeweizen - light fruity notes, and refreshing. Good dinner spot.\",\"time\":1687579311,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Dubravko Vidacak\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/114424784219267790998\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUlaQRnI4AQy-7Qjf65che-sqXWfhvYn0eNgWrO6aNSIWs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Great atmosphere, even better pizza. They allow you to have a half and half mixed pizza. I had Canadian bacon and pineapple on one side , and anchovies and feta cheese on the other side. I believe I had 5 stars selection on toppings. Twist to the edge of pizza makes crust crunchy.\",\"time\":1690421687,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":false,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"bar\",\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"store\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=4909529319825932289\",\"user_ratings_total\":2322,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"868 Zion \\u2013 Mount Carmel Highway, Springdale\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.zionpizzanoodle.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:01','2023-09-19 05:56:01'),(100,'MeMe\'s Café','googleplaces','ChIJq6qqqtrAyoAR0A1o2G5rlQk',106,'Quaint, artsy cafe serving a range of eats from BBQ sandwiches to sweet & savory crepes.',15,0.20,NULL,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.18842,\"lng\":-113.000073},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.1897346302915,\"lng\":-112.9989548697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.1870366697085,\"lng\":-113.0016528302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/cafe-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/cafe_pinlet\",\"name\":\"MeMe\'s Caf\\u00e9\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":1600,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101990825149042016050\\\">MeMe&#39;s Caf\\u00e9<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjV571leKDnikfhcSZpCMVJVJErW9CFdWehrPc_Y7b8c8XzMnFgy1HfxBWJ2mLbw3RlJFg5vmhciC_SqdbxDPohViz_dHiY4YeVnq_fcNx8Z7w-WqAiagx12wG0xoTK1t4YX9lMLqiJGl6n-Y1CARHhi8AKFEHGLHsko7KVdkErNljG\",\"width\":1200}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJq6qqqtrAyoAR0A1o2G5rlQk\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"5XQX+9X Springdale, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85985XQX+9X\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJq6qqqtrAyoAR0A1o2G5rlQk\",\"scope\":\"GOOGLE\",\"types\":[\"cafe\",\"store\",\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"user_ratings_total\":2701,\"vicinity\":\"975 Zion Park Boulevard, Springdale\",\"details\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"975\",\"short_name\":\"975\",\"types\":[\"street_number\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Zion Park Boulevard\",\"short_name\":\"Zion Park Blvd\",\"types\":[\"route\"]},{\"lon