"global_code\":\"85985XQX+9X\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJq6qqqtrAyoAR0A1o2G5rlQk\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Hali Brewer\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113356097036829395060\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJ1coj8X5Wk_2ysTRaAiRANXj9PvP3IN28wKvSyUuTg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Absolutely delicious! The best food we have had in Utah! We came for lunch and got the pork Philly, Zion Cubano sandwich, and crispy cheesy potato bites. Everything was so good! The service was very fast and friendly! We will definitely be coming back for breakfast.\\n\\nEdit: crepes are delicious and the size of a dinner plate. 5\\/5\",\"time\":1693499962,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mary G\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100953835342779846666\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUCS6q3ON-ufOaeSnO2ux3omtviKNDqxI0MQuoEQlszfIk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"We really enjoyed eating here! The portions are very large and the wait staff are nice. Definitely recommend.\",\"time\":1691014894,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Larry B\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103879748369170766436\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJhcS4-_NV1pvuIg9su7IyXkUo2kl8lZrGLjc8Uq2JDwQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"I can say enough about this place, it\\u2019s literally amazing.  When inquiring about allergies for son, the staff took time to research safe options.\\n\\nThe food was absolutely delicious, truly the bees knees!!!\\n\\nThank you for being a great place!!!\",\"time\":1687303430,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jason Bridgford\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111430347229625042024\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIXP-SRAX13ocS_aNEdTRDSf3NmV6gVHQqZvMNRAzx8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"Stopped by for dinner based on reviews - including that it was a more affordable restaurant in an otherwise expensive town.\\n\\nFood is ordered and paid for at the counter and then delivered to your table. The restaurant was quiet when we sat down and food came out quickly.\\n\\nThe food was very good, I loved the curly fries and the many sauces on the table. All up it came to around $70 for a starter, two mains, a pint and a soda which whilst not cheap, was affordable for Springdale.\\n\\nUltimately a decent choice in Springdale when looking for reasonably affordable American food.\",\"time\":1692588462,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kevin Joseph\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105171154318574374783\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUmJ2k79Mk88Rekjzu9TVD6SNRzpNG2cuESxLWzFMfrzbk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Good coffee here.\\n\\nThe Savory crepes were pretty good. A little on the oily side but made well.\\n\\nThe staff was incredibly friendly too. I recommend this place.\",\"time\":1691857576,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"cafe\",\"store\",\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=690576241692511696\",\"user_ratings_total\":2701,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"975 Zion Park Boulevard, Springdale\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.memescafezion.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:02','2023-09-19 05:56:02'),(101,'Red Rock Grill','googleplaces','ChIJCeCZqDXCyoAR6hZLYuiDmEE',107,NULL,15,0.20,0,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.2512027,\"lng\":-112.9559644},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.25255168029151,\"lng\":-112.9546154197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.24985371970851,\"lng\":-112.9573133802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Red Rock Grill\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":2268,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118161699378577938707\\\">manuel garcia<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zg8q55wmHzgXDLGRykyo8k4h_mMKjbBg0bEOpqnLEzd1FlJ_7D0R32S-jXtTe_-49eSyI_eHpyj9sO16pal0Zu-D8zOuakmVCdBUEaDYRJfVkta0KeDcphfQp9f3-LXjNGwImhvbtfIxUVn_QVC_MWRe_KvwgHfQUXQz2jnZTB3o_ZZ\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJCeCZqDXCyoAR6hZLYuiDmEE\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"722V+FJ Springdale, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599722V+FJ\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":3.7,\"reference\":\"ChIJCeCZqDXCyoAR6hZLYuiDmEE\",\"scope\":\"GOOGLE\",\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"user_ratings_total\":253,\"vicinity\":\"1 Zion Lodge, Springdale\",\"details\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"1\",\"short_name\":\"1\",\"types\":[\"street_number\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Zion Lodge\