\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112235143278443175742\\\">Don Nelson<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zg-wW6JBjtu8gkegYEomY-e3mg1ucOAGA5gDCOfbM6NaEnqK9NJKXBy9_TAciaHazVkRW4jIkVVNYvFGvjdoNIaxhKkQ-DMY_bG99ot-NgAwq_K3uHZpylfo50MFWrPNgl7Gs3JpXVrBZRU7VRPQ7RR_I8Gjnoz6xxo3ankIhCw8t89\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111804370810148451588\\\">Masato Asahara<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zh0mxlRflhM-Gj5vAJSJRknXPpSIxspuVwM8Xu_DCpiC_lwiUZM3FQOiXQAnIDBV6NxDyqtgQC9IXYx1vuKSSOL3O9Fz2Omoci5YpwjYOu6G9rwtZtnwb3nkZclK4FnmIJDPyZE-6vvxhFrnNXNS7u6eGjqYt79XuH19NkRKMeoxHw\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":2268,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112294516512977848382\\\">The B4<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zh30OLZt1jPXqFBR614TBiA4n22GCaV_phpWsVM-YRrarbeR_TMM3dWIUaFytzQV8KeRLGxFrlv07NmAVgIxQHzbqGBpid1LApuPUgfeCrtv-zbEH8kGkTMpaZBpIuVRGurQEv2Nct4qPnjDm0uQYgotwrSS47Ceeo42dAZnV2ZOJHN\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105389134878868561434\\\">LIMA LIMA<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziseYce8GVsN-vhsA6nzE0PRA1W3pJV-RBxrkd1EtioPwTg9F8b8Rl9Vup86pWU2TEL7tiQgYv-I5vDaaXYQe30ZLX4C5sxrwR01kiGkFHA4oJ-1iiw_MKafK17UL8s9IIB3tlISgEoHUsj1JPMQzrtEhL3iqbtGxgNYJLrn1g98rZD\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":3024,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117309159571340926899\\\">Ethan Cheng<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjledmYEtrznEONUBraY1G0k81qSKBnnr1R-P-XTIztLnAAaVL-WaeMbWAWWHWgqs0UUAV8OcSOjNVtZ2rCaMe5FFacm0-jnUeeZ73-fs1raVVv6_nOSwgdhCR65T8yRHw-43SQZSuMCEkDC0QfAzfQ11FvS7q9RIXZoANgGeAyJVLW\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJCeCZqDXCyoAR6hZLYuiDmEE\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"722V+FJ Springdale, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599722V+FJ\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":3.7,\"reference\":\"ChIJCeCZqDXCyoAR6hZLYuiDmEE\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"betina workman\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112195424764137455688\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKJB45XbPvV1U66zJba5F7ygjbhH3e-OcNwTYYi6BqI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"The Zions Lodge has an old school National Parks Feel about it and so does the  in-house restaurant. The food is fine. The service was good and covered the basics.  There\\u2019s view and location are what makes this place worth the stop.\",\"time\":1687724580,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sam Bawahab\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113616123236992144988\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV9Wvc4cDiVzK0B14tCEwERY-CS1QNTB8OYeuaajhT_zVw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"Place had great view of Zion.  Food was okay.  We got burgers and chicken sandwiches for lunch.\\n\\nPricey since you are a captive customer.  I dont mind paying more but food better be good.\\n\\nNo table service.  You order and pay at the top of the stairs. Cashier will give you a number.  Wipe your own table down.  Then place your number on table and wait.  Food drop off at your table by server.\\n\\nPlace was under staff.  Staff too busy looking at their phones.  carpers needed to be swept.  We visited 1st week Jan 2023.  Maybe the slow season.\",\"time\":1678161771,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Valeria Ursu\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117321639265644130896\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXDWtwtT1t2obFwWiUAxwzTxst7u83T_uwTrPLCk_JFw8E=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Top tier! Had an incredible experience at this breathtakingly located restaurant for 4th of July. We came in as walk ins and had to wait for a bit to be seated but once we did we were treated with respect and kindness. We got a seat outside with incredible 360 views of red rocks, kids plying football outside and deer enjoying their dinner in front of the lodge. The food portions looked small but we\\u2019re so incredibly delicious and filling! Ordered trout and black bean burger that each came with 2 sides. We enjoyed a relaxing atmosphere and fully immersed ourselves in the experience of being first timers at Zion. The prices were reasonable and to our surprise someone paid for our dinner. Me and my fianc\\u00e9e who had just proposed 2 days before we got to enjoy this dinner we\\u2019re incredibly surprised and emotional. We are still till now incredibly in awe and grateful! Want to thank whoever did that for us! Just know that that was a really really touching gesture that we will remember for the rest of our lives.\",\"time\":1688602054,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Bill C\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111925651238661842923\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVqgLe_fBErY02GarpgHeMxZwtFPCSp_2Wg2bZ9i90f9mg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"The view is amazing when you dine on the patio. The food was pretty good. I had the pasta.\\n\\nThe service was nonexistent once you were served your meal. They never check on you afterwards and even when I had an empty glass on my table they would walk by you without checking or even looking at you.\\nThey were friendly when serving our initial drinks and food though.\",\"time\":1684617899,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jenny Chang\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111434167288827008727\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjV7VD4MIj9xp60McxmI2zJtnWY0Ho3TRxUvNrpbdJIZHtqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"8 months ago\",\"text\":\"We had just finished hiking Scout\\u2019s Lookout and needed a place to eat and fortunately Zion\\u2019s Lodge had a place to snag some food. We were there around 2-3 pm which was nice during the winter so it was not crowded. Great view from the window of the nearby red rock!\\n\\nThe chicken sandwich was okay. My partner liked it but I felt like it was just okay. The authentic Navajo taco was really delicious! I could tell they made it fresh! The Navajo taco was very big and incredibly filling! Depending on a person\\u2019s appetite, I think it could feed two people! Navajo taco had a lot of flavor!\\n\\nI noticed that we ran out of water quickly and needed to ask someone to refill our waters. Things like refilling waters\\/drinks are usually a good indicator if a restaurant is a 5 star or not because the service is attentive.\",\"time\":1673334231,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=4726672843030075114\",\"user_ratings_total\":253,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"1 Zion Lodge, Springdale\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/zionlodge.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:02','2023-09-19 05:56:02'),(102,'Subway','googleplaces','ChIJ_d0g7qLCyoARAU_K68oAvFw',108,'Casual counter-serve chain for build-your-own sandwiches & salads, with health-conscious options.',10,0.20,0,1,0,'{\"business_status\":