28-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"SCAM!!! Food was OK and the employees were friendly, but when I go to pay for 2 standard footlong subs the price was $35.53!! Borderline criminal pricing for a fast food chain, even the worker ackowledged the \'prices are insane here\'. I should have walked out without paying, but the subs were already made and I\'m not a grifter like the owner of this location. Being next to the park entrance does not justify the price tag when you could go sit down at any of the local restaurants instead and get a full meal with an appetizer for the same cost. The owner of this location should be stripped of their franchise license. Won\'t be going to a Subway for awhile because of this experience despite being a fairly frequent customer. Complete joke. Stay away!\",\"time\":1689109552,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"RJ Mitchell\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113102731719656093361\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJ4fzxyT75msfipPq1GNW-TZeTievecAWpglaKaMPTk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"They have good food and have a nice view of Zion when you sit down to eat. They did increase their prices since they\'re located outside of Zion. Expect to pay $15+ for a footlong.\",\"time\":1687869513,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Alisha\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110108413334137652795\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWDkQkcY7Nc4fUA-AYDb4ZOYYwut4bJ6VISODCEC0RP0rdx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"a year ago\",\"text\":\"I don\\u2019t know what was with this store, I didn\\u2019t like the subway. The staffs weren\\u2019t any friendly. We did a veggie patties with the salad and it was just cold, haven\\u2019t eaten a veggie patty that cold before.\",\"time\":1646624163,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jana Engle\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115272690766908146121\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXt_sXFE7pCL6dY3zmHW4AWIIpAMsKAK2iysffiRHTqVMwl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"11 months ago\",\"text\":\"Had the wood fired pizza from Zion Pizza, it was very yummy!. Was a bit spendy but it is a tourist area...\\nThe view from the patio\",\"time\":1663982347,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Noah J.\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117992663359883123006\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUJcX70wlcdmgfcsRHAT2c80U-rDeH9OwBMuxnCjpIo-u6Z=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"The lady was very friendly, but the prices are insanely high for a sandwich!\",\"time\":1675203628,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=6682216818650271489\",\"user_ratings_total\":225,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"180 Zion Park Boulevard, Springdale\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/restaurants.subway.com\\/united-states\\/ut\\/springdale\\/180-zion-park-blvd?utm_source=yxt-goog&utm_medium=local&utm_term=acq&utm_content=39561&utm_campaign=evergreen-2020&y_source=1_MTQ4OTU0MTMtNzE1LWxvY2F0aW9uLndlYnNpdGU=\",\"wheelchair_accessibl