eviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKKBOa9AE-9cZ3t7jv0IoBxTq_d03uxp1Lcyh2KngpP=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"The food was amazing! Our server, Shyanne gave stellar service. Today was her first day on her own but she seemed like a seasoned pro. Can\'t wait to go back and request her. The view...beautiful!! Highly recommend.\",\"time\":1691199976,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Pimporn B.\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100084686557093724763\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU__Jovw0rDafRXr9eyP5QKlRHSwuP3QpWkRhc9RljYU40=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"This is my second time here 5 years apart from my first visit. This restaurant is very special and I loved it the first time I was here. We sat outside with a very nice view and weather. The food is very delicious agreed by all five of us finishing everything to a very clean plate. The service was great as well. If I\\u2019m back in Zion again I would definitely come back here.\",\"time\":1686634765,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sam Wong\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117867159097661584407\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVDHQdxfZNOQdE-E1eL6CAZktoSSuP8XU898cZHnhbB1_yu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"If you happen to be in the zion area, I would recommend you to come here .\\nFood and service was just great.\\nWe had the best burata tomatoes ever. !!!\\nThe prime steak was also very good. ate the whole 16oz of it\\nAnd finished our meal with a quality homemade tiramisu.\\nand while having all that the view of the canyon mountains in the back is just magnificent.\",\"time\":1694314249,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Adrienne Key\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117332556326515425772\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVofW60dLor12yfx0qUtmKHLq6CX7X_rsPdAgnfTGpo3II=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"My husband and I stopped in here for dinner and we were not disappointed. We decided to sit inside because it was still pretty hot outside, but we still landed a gorgeous view from our seats. Our server was so sweet and attentive. When I asked about the giant pretzel (it wasn\\u2019t listen on the menu) she shared it was available which made me so happy! I love a good pretzel. For dinner we split the rib eye (it was huge) and ended with a mini chocolate mousse cake and a scoop of vanilla ice cream. The meal was a bit on the expensive side but you defiantly got what you paid for and we would come back 100%. Would recommend!\",\"time\":1689688945,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Xiaojing Ji\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112909255793264979426\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWns0lpHZbXitWKP7a1p9O7_O5GsBPFsyDSAd-giaaEtELT=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"I got Pork Porterhouse - the meat came in a huge portion with creamy mashed potatoes. The pork was juicy and flavorful, it went very well with seasonal vegetables & brussel sprouts on the top.\",\"time\":1694909607,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\