o_reference\":\"ATJ83zg9xE3QFRwUMblrcpxYMhy4RKZw3RttAIw_4Rxn62j62AYhtyYBmgP3YnHtKD9sg0GdkhjMW8cwz8Zfo2jO16cIRKcb5mQd40NOslPPQOCUOzLNJsHtakE2O3PbYjdgSPwVWrciT5kUfQADol_8u1FGDkiKiL3WQ3GkfGZkFK9f4kUN\",\"width\":4496},{\"height\":3744,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/106780938915383348983\\\">Flanigan&#39;s Resort and Spa Springdale UT - Hotel Zion National Park<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zi7mmIFxApU3pExydRQDtwJwdnlBYi76KNY2eaPkcdUoM_BzWLHeDzZ12FbWEbUqbKtP9FZWfaRrB18MoSbj4IXIIrc7bxEn9VHN-eUgJnJQLqib1jji19R6YUPBmaPOzdZI7PO5dIaw57z08HSWICvl6hi-hqRy-9sEVPmry4qF3gb\",\"width\":5616}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJre9-dqTCyoARd5Xy9_AhDwk\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"52V4+RJ Springdale, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"859952V4+RJ\"},\"rating\":4.6,\"reference\":\"ChIJre9-dqTCyoARd5Xy9_AhDwk\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"momocontramundum\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102404465058283408923\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXc2vjR5s4T3Wxqd_5CWgOWTHomf38S8mrcSddofzPOk9Xm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Beautiful hotel near Zion National Park.\\n\\nLarge, clean rooms, with a fridge, AC, and TV as well as a coffee maker. I believe I even saw a yoga mat in the room! Nice bathroom with good toiletries provided.\\n\\nThe gated pool is of a good size and it was not too crowded even during the heatwave of July, and it is placed away from the road, on a quiet hillside. Different types of sunbeds available. There is a small jacuzzi as well.\\n\\nThe place offers some free meditation\\/yoga sessions. There is also a spa with different kinds of treatments.\\n\\nThe staff at the front desk was approachable and the procedure at check-in smooth and easy. Parking on site.\",\"time\":1692368348,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mar Bre\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103430127219610488974\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKocxt19qoK920QAW-IkUJpm-4FdH8NfB3ZiNgkhSLj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Here to vacation at Zion N.P.  the staff members were friendly and helpful.  The room was clean, bed comfortable, and all furnishings in good order.  The bath was clean and in order.\\nThe outside of the hotel was extremely well kept. We would sit outside, and because of the layout and lush landscaping, it felt as if we were secluded and alone.  The pool was also very nice.  Unlike a previous \\\"negative nate\\\" I\'ll  be telling all my Texas friends about this great hotel.\",\"time\":1686915830,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Sheri Ognianov\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117196120348494872392\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUksi94oPQtU6KajKPisfHYAwQot5192Ollc1Cc7Gv3UsS9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Stayed here to visit Zion National Park for 5 nights.First what I loved. The location is amazing.  Short walk to Zion\'s National Park and some cute shops and great restaurants including their restaurant \\\"The Spotted Dog\\\".  Clean rooms, serviced daily, and super comfortable beds. That alone is reason to stay here. Now the bad...had a massage.  Others in my party said best they have had in awhile. Opposite for me. I would never book a massage here again. When checking in, you don\'t get that welcome feeling as you might expect.  There were some nice people but some who might rub you the wrong way. And I don\'t mean the massage. But just keep that in mind and go for it. Location was great and the beds comfortable. And Zion National Park amazing.\",\"time\":1685506643,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Bee OKay\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116802838535897990658\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocItw77-5AyuEyYQb93liOCAPnkC6ZEafzRyy46QVIqI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Wonderful grounds, clean facilities (I\\u2019m picky), we enjoyed the hot tub a few times and the great restaurant as well. We were there in April and the location was fantastic for us - I\\u2019m sure traffic could be a bit loud during busier times as it it in the main drag. The only disappointment was no incentive to upgrade was offered when we inquired  - just regular prices even tho much of the resort was empty. I take that as they simply don\\u2019t have to and will make their money in the long run.   We found ALL the staff to be extremely friendly.\",\"time\":1683155449,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Brianna Seaberg\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109433309861125163121\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWhq4HMM_eYzQnFA_wC33XzJ1NddIqMqa-wVhpdY7082z8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"BEST PLACE TO STAY NEAR ZION!! I had an absolutely wonderful stay at Flanigans Resort and Spa. The rooms were great, especially the gorgeous view of the mountains from the balcony. I loved how the resort had a wellness aspect to it, and every day they have a free wellness activity for guests. The Spotted Dog Cafe (the resort\'s restaurant) had excellent food and was right on property. The front desk was extremely helpful and gave us great tips for the area! I also got a Deep Canyon Massage at the spa and it was incredible after all of those long days hiking. The pool and labyrinth at the resort were my favorite amenities as well. Overall, HIGHLY recommend staying here when you go to Zion National Park\\/Springdale. 10\\/10 recommend!!\",\"time\":1684688719,\"translated\":false}],\"types\":[\"spa\",\"lodging\",\"hair_care\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"health\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=652777789827749239\",\"user_ratings_total\":436,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"450 Zion Park Boulevard, Springdale\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/flanigans.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":false}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:03','2023-09-19 05:56:03'),(107,'Little Caesars Pizza','googleplaces','ChIJYT8-kcn2yoARCe4HUYm0IMg',113,'Carry-out chain featuring chicken wings, signature breadsticks & pizza tossed from housemade dough.',10,0.20,0,0,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.1767474,\"lng\":-113.2940751},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.17801988029149,\"lng\":-113.2927296697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.17532191970849,\"lng\":-113.2954276302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Little Caesars Pizza\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":1800,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113783317380511115163\\\">hoaxonyou<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjVrBmbfgW4SxrJCuwnJhmD_KbCxf20ujmJ94vNjVT0_Zm0FpEO0HBkuj32MlSk12sH8A-IlLQfOKBe2L2W0IyzRx5wK8wz787dnOnrKHBmRFdd6Dp4eImcz00_jbf-ZpOPVKHE_Shqeyqdm7Pzegqz43ALqsR_4zuJ6IsvC-3fkfaj\",\"width\":4000}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJYT8-kcn2yoARCe4HUYm0IMg\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"5PG4+M9 Hurricane, UT, USA\",\"g