MVPNcTAZRO3wzFhUQds8VoBqyFv40JAtChYbmeDcqp5Fgmqw69OPY3YCBKpnH1k4aO42zGDB\",\"width\":2988},{\"height\":5344,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104024748504889422095\\\">Matthew VanDam<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zh3gUsDt9fd1ZLjc9V4Q_Dk32jMgAm-9W0wU6YVA9m7pozG0PduTk8KcCSFWeoEcGwzBtwjJRJQM7ilfd5l6LChO3riQjp4NYlxga6JtLm3M5mE8rz8E12_L7IbY_wzYKzEHjEmJN2zlndA1ia_FvuHZF1SNLHyWyLNQhiuoeT2hjvj\",\"width\":4008}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJYT8-kcn2yoARCe4HUYm0IMg\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"5PG4+M9 Hurricane, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85985PG4+M9\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":3.6,\"reference\":\"ChIJYT8-kcn2yoARCe4HUYm0IMg\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Tavish Snow\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102207973381477880332\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXEQqjX-PYr5vCse8dz6asjNxFWI6onsESnkceSkEwSsFo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"Not bad usually went there this week and there hot and ready was not hot. It was ice cold. There was hardly any cheese on it and when I tried heating it up it turned to concrete. My dog wouldn\'t even eat it. I think I\'d rather go to the grocery store and get a cheap Torino\'s pizza and cook it myself\\n..\",\"time\":1694754705,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Chantell Putnam\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103003350481521845676\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVTjwSh5DxTTvXz0A9CM6X_3SNpA6LjwpKv0x4TgrfFFA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Good pizza at one of the cheapest places you\\u2019ll find these days. Good value for your money, delicious and hot. There\\u2019s no indoor dining. Only take out whether you call ahead or walk in. We usually call ahead because it\\u2019s about 15-20 minutes on average to get it. The wait sucks, but the pizza is fresh and hot so it\\u2019s worth it if you plan ahead. Lots of parking available.\",\"time\":1686882751,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"M\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116368223634940044892\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUz3Vsg8lm1_gKYlDkBWMKO3pnc-OenTQOKqkDlRwRYQx0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"I just want to say that customer service is a dying art but not for the wonderful staff at Little Cesars in Hurricane. We were greeted with friendly smiles and prompt service. The young lady at the drive through saw my young son and offered him cookies. It\'s those little things that mean so much and keeps customers returning. \\u2764\\ufe0f The pizza was hot and tasted amazing. The price is always reasonable. Thank you so much!\",\"time\":1689134281,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"James Lahey\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107824969555694835106\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIlc6l8d9rmWwp54_Y8Wkhtgh5PuqOdW4btgtBEI-nk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"The staff is doing the best they can despite total neglect from franchise ownership. One of their ovens repeatedly goes out causing massive delays and customer frustration. After talking with multiple employees, I discovered that the owner has refused requests to replace the oven, or to get it properly fixed. This is very embarrassing for little caesars as a company, but even more for this specific franchise owner. I bet the oven at his\\/her house works just fine\\u2026.\",\"time\":1692407102,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Miriah Wixom\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/112671111847481800582\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjX47NK_6aOY8A1sRiabFCFOKodrnNoH2QJy1mHJfFR7QovX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Little Caesars is cheap pizza and that\\u2019s what you get. It\\u2019s good. They don\\u2019t always have the hot and ready, ready. So sometimes it\\u2019s a wait. The location is not the best if there is a wait, but it\\u2019s good cheep pizza.\",\"time\":1688508242,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":false,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"meal_takeaway\",\"meal_delivery\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=14420724508703321609\",\"user_ratings_total\":569,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"310 West State Street, Hurricane\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/littlecaesars.com\\/en-us\\/store\\/3097\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',0,'2023-09-19 05:56:03','2023-09-19 05:56:03'),(108,'Maverik Adventure\'s First Stop','googleplaces','ChIJ33rbROTzyoARQPdhapgoVBU',114,'Gas-station & convenience store chain, serving drinks & snacks from burritos to frozen yogurt.',8,0.20,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.2102072,\"lng\":-113.2712905},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.2115262802915,\"lng\":-113.2699425697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.2088283197085,\"lng\":-113.2726405302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/gas_station-71.png\",