4,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110827424056529299686\\\">Ken Lee<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zi6q-yfpnMwHudwtAULU39-n3caq-jEF_Od6AQvKyLqyUGBaPh3ykWw47ptugHAuMHLEt5i1QjK2DTLHoYxyl8D6B0XZOZHeC-MGTsFUKqLSuqoQhk4HsiZ1pdeF0gh80yX_jKwXh6fItf-AosVyMO57XIlTPzo2CUzKOK3IrxIHEEc\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJkQhrcKTCyoARyFEqcLWnykk\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"52V4+PW Springdale, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"859952V4+PW\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.4,\"reference\":\"ChIJkQhrcKTCyoARyFEqcLWnykk\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Scott Godown\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108132723302492907463\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXacSE7Xg8ZXM0mbLlc7OacmxX8wNjpnwIsoeSycH5Ncpg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Whiptail Grill is absolutely delicious! I had the pleasure of eating here with some friends and we all raved about how amazing the food is. Jesus took care of us throughout our lunch and was impactful in our menu perusing. He made recommendations that were thoughtfully tailored to our tastes. This food is art! Stunning displays of culinary perfection. High quality food with flavors that will have you yearning for more. Highly recommend eating here.\",\"time\":1691358335,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Juliana M\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111519905839104295764\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKDK_FsAxff0gYlltqg20Wa5zVJTazaD5Xbgx6YaFLI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Indoor or outside seating this is the place in town to eat. Prices are affordable and portions are HUGE! It is worth the wait (can be a bit around peak hours 5-7pm). It\\u2019s an old garage turned into a restaurant.\\n\\nOrdered the nachos ~ real cheese, homemade chips YUM!! Chips and salsa had a nice kick to them. The steak tacos (2) loaded with enough to make 3 tacos comes with rice and beans. Lastly, had the taco salad add chicken. As a newly chicken eater it was delicious and cooked perfectly. Taco salad was big enough for two to share and then some. We had so much food, took back still as delicious the next morning for breakfast.\\n\\nThis is a MUST stop when visiting Springdale especially after a day of hiking around Zion. Kid friendly\",\"time\":1687807735,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Chris Beaupre\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109777902561367475500\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKWR-3ykETe0i66fguuQSSXgN8s-PRTTGqbN6TKHnXf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"in the last week\",\"text\":\"Excellent restaurant!\\nThe staff is very friendly.  They worked fast too!  Drinks and food came out very promptly.\\nThe food was amazing!  I wanted to lick the bowls from the queso and salsa clean!  As you can see from the photos we damn near did...\\nThe Chipotle Chicken enchiladas were delicious!\\nThe grilled shrimp tacos are quite possibly the best I have ever tasted!\\nAll around a wonderful experience,\",\"time\":1694488401,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Mike Apperson\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118015206601365104261\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocI7Un-yj5E4vS9wVJZHvhx9gXBwnpnwmdpt_EhmhOvTqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"Great location on main drag. Seating inside or outside on Patio. Misters for most of patio in case too hot.\\nWe ordered The Whiptail Shrimp burrito, 2 orders of Carne Asada Tacos and a Southwest Chicken Salad. Most orders come w\\/ side of rice and black beans. Fernando was our waiter. He was constantly checking on us. He was a great server !\\nMenu had plenty of choices for all to enjoy.\\nWe would have done the patio, but with all the hot hikes & biking, we needed the a\\/c.\\n\\nWe will return ! Entrees approx. $15-20 + beverages\",\"time\":1694289890,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Brian Betsill\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109405739386249821565\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXOWWaohd1haxtsQVI-H_ucItcG9E8rqwKLdTwIOM4IdjeO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Great cocktails and every dish we had (between 6 of us) tasted great. The staff were very nice and the outdoor seating had decent cover. It was somewhat unexpected since it was right next to the campground and most places, in my opinion, that are near campsites\\/ hotels areas don\'t have the best food. Overall go enjoy the food and views!\",\"time\":1686314885,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=5317246707777032648\",\"user_ratings_total\":1827,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"445 Zion Park Boulevard, Springdale\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.whiptailgrillzion.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:04','2023-09-19 05:56:04'),(110,'Stage Coach Grille','googleplaces','ChIJF9WKeFjxyoARw8ro4TnPpKM',116,'Charming, wood-filled mainsta