o_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVO-gIGoXCgFCTtZhkYjUhAYvWSkSMHKKevPPKpWBFUUkVC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"This was a great restaurant to eat at after a long day of hiking in Zion. We were seated right away, and the service was great. We ordered a couple different dishes each and they were quite tasty. Their house made ranch was really delicious. The onion rings were really tasty as well. They have a good menu selection and generous servings.\",\"time\":1689654741,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jay Bean\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117881699179493252906\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVMMON4GPN3agNBDhEcwSZq6qKs_gf3wH-ifebfWiTxINms=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"My wife and I decided to try out the Stage Coach Grill in LaVerkin, Utah, for the first time, and we were blown away by the fantastic service and delicious food. The staff was incredibly helpful and attentive throughout our entire dinner, making our experience all the more enjoyable.\\n\\nWe started our meal with a delightful appetizer that set the tone for what was to come. I opted for the Chicken Overmill, and it was cooked to perfection, bursting with flavor. My wife went for the Salmon, and she couldn\'t stop raving about how succulent it was.\\n\\nThe only slight disappointment was the tiramisu, which was a tad dry. However, it did not overshadow the overall fantastic dining experience we had at Stage Coach Restaurant.\\n\\nWe are thrilled to have found this gem of a place so close to home and will undoubtedly be returning soon for more delicious meals and the warm hospitality that makes this restaurant stand out.\\n\\nHighly recommended - we can\'t wait to go again\",\"time\":1690679868,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Exel Seal\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101097659758456149995\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJgA9wH1cG65C_0ySVMfl-HLrDk-9in1tNxMoE5b3E5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Wish I had taken pictures now of our food.\\nOur server Mark was so nice, filled our water up 3-4 times.\\nExplain the menu to us with a lot of patience.\\nWe have been travelling the USA for 3 months now and this was our best meal and best service by far.\\nChips are cut on site.\\nVeggies were cooked perfectly.\\nI had the chicken steak and husband had the pork chop.\\nWe even looked at changing our travel plans to eat here tomorrow.\\n10\\/10\",\"time\":1689372280,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lois Laatsch\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/116021084769834743703\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjWPYj5HGiGJy0E5KuU-VSybdHEnwJ-qpJjunIp87R94O3Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"We had a wonderful breakfast at Stage Coach Grille yesterday.   It was so good, we did it again today.   It\'s only a 20 minute drive from Zion.  The food is very well prepared,  served hot and plenty of it.  The service is great too.\",\"time\":1690404627,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"paterjo\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102936517431979644747\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUAVrgE6lHRKq5f5PqiNjuQzC6TwatSoOIXaLSHtEwegQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"6 months ago\",\"text\":\"Really nice restaurant in Hurricane, UT, and I recommend making reservations in advance if you are coming on a weekend as during high tourist season they get extremely busy. I had a ribeye steak that was good and one of my friends had a excellent hamburger. The service was fairly good and the owner chatted with us for a few minutes which was nice, I had a good steak but thought $45 was high for the cut and taste.\",\"time\":1679278052,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_brunch\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_vegetarian_food\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"bar\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=11791777571873016515\",\"user_ratings_total\":3006,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"99 North State Street, La Verkin\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/thestagecoachgrille.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:04','2023-09-19 05:56:04'),(111,'Triple TJ\'s Café','googleplaces','ChIJ1V-Uhr_2yoAR68945UMBzh0',117,'Casual, family-owned fixture in a shopping mall since 2010 with American classics, plus beer & wine.',15,0.20,1,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.1758325,\"lng\":-113.3080869},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.1771993802915,\"lng\":-113.3067798697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.17450141970851,\"lng\":-113.3094778302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Triple TJ\'s Caf\\u00e9\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":false},\"photos\":[{\"height\":1960,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100258493681423954826\\\">Triple TJ&#39;s Caf\\u00e9<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83ziMnsh