to_reference\":\"ATJ83zhyJJj8uApfWhfmaYhFaF3EaSe4eLHTZNMqqydKB2HJuLOBT-raq_01gNDjTANrqj8i3cVnXg5LKImauPSUjKQ4nux1gc8K94MlCjK380MSLlhTsKW3-AagXGNZaWuyxYLOON_7a_-4fFlDP_Ty3PjFG7kS3vCh29O7g7Wmi2cjpncf\",\"width\":4032}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ1V-Uhr_2yoAR68945UMBzh0\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"5MGR+8Q Hurricane, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85985MGR+8Q\"},\"price_level\":2,\"rating\":4.5,\"reference\":\"ChIJ1V-Uhr_2yoAR68945UMBzh0\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"adriane s\\u0101ra price\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111685335274136747974\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXxmBvIXFtDN2G1_rE4MTc14l-IFe5GVg9tK-QTOzldmoyo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"7 months ago\",\"text\":\"Let\'s hit this running, get the ribs. I swear you will NOT be disappointed and you will NOT be sad you spent the $$ for them. They legit fall off the bone. Okay review over. Just kidding...\\n\\nOkay so the corn was good, mashed potatoes they were well paired with the ribs. The star of the plate though was the ribs.\\n\\nMy husband ordered the spicey chicken sandwich and fries he enjoyed it, wished he had cheese with the sandwich (he likes cheese with almost everything ha ha). The breaded chicken breast had buffalo sauce and was really tender.\",\"time\":1675564878,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Kathleen Bradshaw\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/100739162698584377443\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocK2-nbMqaHX4z2gZkc_pTeQvSjz9JKGZHhcvb3DygIj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"I\'ve been here several times, when visiting the area. It\'s  a great local dive for a quiet lunch. The food is great and the service wonderful. The walls are filled with professional photography  of the surrounding area. It\'s almost like an art galley with all the art to look at!  It\'s just beautiful!  The other day when I was there with my sister I had the Turkey Club on a sandwich croissant with homemade potato salad!  The waitress was friendly and kept our drinks refilled and even offered to give us a to-go- drink when we were done eating!   I will eat here at least once whenever I\'m in town!\",\"time\":1689272174,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Brian Preston\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/111854434139108949336\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUWebK9jCRQU-PGTm78-wzqK0RTo8rSxmigDBUTk_0H2BQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"Very well organized and close to everything in Hurricane, the Triple TJ\' Cafe offers very tasty meals to locals and guests in a clean, well decorated setting.\",\"time\":1684554451,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"C Higley\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109987315763868769448\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW7GjXEq5HkmLu61z2vUUwqfzxez8Tx1D87cNN-j7hV7rg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"11 months ago\",\"text\":\"Delicious! Has a homemade feel (not mass produced\\/ previously frozen). Juicy chicken! The spicy chicken sandwich is my favorite. Crispy fries with fry sauce! The menu has a variety of items to choose from. Every time I\\u2019ve come in they are friendly and the food never disappoints. They also have gluten free options listed right on the menu!\",\"time\":1665179579,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Rob Bonham\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/105063976607393322173\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVpm7d5iyCaP3qzy6ZFyOKxUhZe2wvcXTfcF6ovlj_mRwA_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"This is a small Cafe located in a strip mall in Hurricane UT. We went there for lunch to try it out. The club sandwich was really good but the French fries were amazing! They have the perfect amount of batter and cooked to perfection. We also had raspberry, white chocolate cheesecake.  That was really good too\",\"time\":1682888292,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"cafe\",\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=2147655463426641899\",\"user_ratings_total\":612,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"1141 State Street, Hurricane\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/tripletjscafe.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:04','2023-09-19 05:56:04'),(112,'Castle Dome Café','googleplaces','ChIJmTufwZPCyoARtXsZrfGS0MU',118,'Burgers, sandwiches & beers are served at this simple snack spot with patio seating & park views.',8,0.20,0,1,1,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.2516988,\"lng\":-112.9559173},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.2530477802915,\"lng\":-112.9545683197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.2503498197085,\"lng\":-112.9572662802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Castle Dome Caf\\u00e9\",\"opening_hours\":{\"o