idth\":4032},{\"height\":3264,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/109769970771684502625\\\">julie S<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zh5pTw5mGTxH9-Im6vWG40id-F7UYzOJX_hyOBOzPSD-pcH-IxnAsYj0zePe7qdtznuIFxL2wI7f0HSytyrCmqLlecpyslyOA1QvElAqPRCVRSfbq5j22Xs0RQaXdzpUFNeWsJT4Y_VQEcwK5iwHxkrRnlLRNZlb2Hx4KZT1zMVnhW9\",\"width\":2448}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJmTufwZPCyoARtXsZrfGS0MU\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"722V+MJ Springdale, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"8599722V+MJ\"},\"rating\":3.3,\"reference\":\"ChIJmTufwZPCyoARtXsZrfGS0MU\",\"reservable\":true,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Nes Borne\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117654323500286223711\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW2P3KqvkRhNv6fYm9u5TZ0NGTyb5bKuopxhQaODqd5pz8j=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"Overpriced food, bland taste, but hey - more cost effective than the other grill. Also, only option if you did not pack. If they can improve the food then the price would be reasonable. So if you can pack, better alternative.\",\"time\":1689036726,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Matt Smith\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108881665115882545154\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjW3mvQCCQwEzYCSyN0PRdpzK6SKcy_7TOxVU4S865Tfef4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Look.  The view is amazing.  The food is overpriced, but I would expect that.  The cashiers were friendly and efficient.  Now to food quality, my burger was cold and old.  Sol old I would think the grill cook made it 3 hours earlier and then got sent home.  My fries were also cold and old.  Lowest quality fries as well.  My wife had a salad and the chicken was still partially frozen on the salad.  She said the chicken was the lowest quality she has ever had.  Save your money for something in town.  It amazing me that the park can\'t see how food quality would be important.  I own 13 restaurants and I would be ashamed to serve the garbage we had to eat.\",\"time\":1684722489,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Christopher Sanders\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104065888344488403893\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJX9T9AX1kXMaAFKktDxd7GOtO6GHkSSC8rxSDdePqK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"I ordered a bacon cheeseburger.  I\'d like to say that this was the worst burger I\'ve ever eaten but calling it a burger would be giving this \\\"food\\\" more credit than it deserves.  It was cold, dry, and overcooked.  Find somewhere else to eat and don\'t waste your money here.\",\"time\":1687975293,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"The Foodie Architect\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101720553180737354833\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjU-G6WiVe_428AwyfSxjr2EBrMF0bD0XRUrvfAaV1fYJg0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"The food is pretty bad here. But you are here for the views.\",\"time\":1688082623,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"\\u05e8\\u05d5\\u05d0\\u05d9 \\u05d5\\u05d0\\u05dc\\u05e2\\u05d3 \\u05d2\\u05d9\\u05dc\\u05ea\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/101890072803560023691\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKOscMRzjhNfWPUXI2sx3oUls1bVnqepZWpAJRjQ33V=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":1,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"I would give them ZERO STARS if it was possible. Usually, I don\'t rate places, but when they refused to serve me a plain burger or sandwich, I could not ignore this horrible experience, modifing food is a basic step to have a service method, employees are too lazy to modify food requests.\\nSave your time and go to eat in another place in Springdale\",\"time\":1690066885,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":true,\"serves_breakfast\":true,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"point_of_interest\",\"food\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=14254054387316521909\",\"user_ratings_total\":81,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"United States\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/www.zionlodge.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:04','2023-09-19 05:56:04'),(113,'Dairy Queen Grill & Chill','googleplaces','ChIJZxsGb7_2yoARUq-OYIe24Fk',119,'Soft-serve ice cream & signature shakes top the menu at this classic burger & fries fast-food chain.',10,0.20,NULL,1,NULL,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.1768895,\"lng\":-113.3019778},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.17824108029149,\"lng\":-113.3005171197085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.17554311970849,\"lng\":-113.3032150802915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"Dairy Queen Grill & Chill\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":true},\"photos\":[{\"height\":2268,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/113707547434737588489\\\">Vergel Harker<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgL20PVc89KrLZzI0kfqcHmS_z617Tu