ALGHupLKFQm8--fhv1K\",\"width\":4032},{\"height\":2592,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108104271654015153699\\\">Abhishek Gupta<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjFQMUNc9-szb_ZrMmJi-UoZPNXwqppai7Jjc94Aba0JxB82J_yBgGRWGi_dIXdB_aKYkq7OAdJ9rRCgidBmHSregaifa9Bh5GI6UCIcCVZNqbts_NrTBfcycXaV3eOPUPbZQgOo5s2FpG5o_gcvWH-MxsA7JP5Il2LhhmIz7UOe3MO\",\"width\":1944},{\"height\":2592,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108104271654015153699\\\">Abhishek Gupta<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjZefhs7rOlhetU4ZH1eLywE259TY_o7VaZYjvdy0VXU_TDRoi1-kzLSiJZRcRKUBnDd4pUuuK3JUoKbrjwmpcQbhVoiB8-I2-sH5AyCKMYfsl-WNFCIs60ZSiScyk5bPAK219fXkaKQOpmumSbCwpjKKvCFkezfakiouAEluiaT6aI\",\"width\":1944}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJZxsGb7_2yoARUq-OYIe24Fk\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"5MGX+Q6 Hurricane, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85985MGX+Q6\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":4.3,\"reference\":\"ChIJZxsGb7_2yoARUq-OYIe24Fk\",\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Jake B.\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118355748715052427152\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocJsSNHCZhMKoq33cNOKIDM3xM2SZovP9Xk5HeQUGB3-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"We had a great experience dining in the lobby here. Karis (hopefully correct spelling) overheard one of our kids wishing he had gotten a bowl for his medium cone, because he couldn\\u2019t keep up with eating it before it melted. She was emptying the trash and completely stopped what she was doing and went to get one for him. It was really appreciated, thank you!\",\"time\":1691186663,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Anthony Brown\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104845343057544872427\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocKi3DYcJqON_zNWNKzxhCeNmq7oPB74rCXy2mtf-0Pu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":2,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"This store goes down as the first worst store experiences I have ever had, and it al comes down to an arrogant and disrespectful manager named Jaru. My family and I visited this location to have dinner and ice cream. I ordered a swirled dipped cone for my dessert, and this manager brought it out to me himself. I cannot believe my eyes when he handed it to me, and the ice cream was soft, formed and overlapping the cone. I Commented to the young man That the ice cream was not up to Dairy Queen standards. His reply to me was \\u201cI don\\u2019t make them!\\u201c The ice cream was soft, and it fell apart before I could even eat it. I was so disgusted with it, and I threw it away and went to the manager To explain my concern, and instead of being apologetic and understanding, I was met with rudeness and the worst customer service I\\u2019ve had in years. Jaru told me that it taste the same and continued to be me with rude comments as I tried to speak to a different manager, and request my money back. Even after being told to be quiet and go away, he continued to embarrass me I was very upfront with  my feelings, and I told him that he shouldn\\u2019t be a manager and that he had poor customer service.\",\"time\":1693805156,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lora Reber\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/110202789907889725328\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVGzDoRkEwE9CZojIlEBoRb3mw6TPER5Oo1zHjCyt5pW_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":3,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 weeks ago\",\"text\":\"We went through the drive thru. Ordered 2 blizzard 2 meals with drinks. I\'m the only one in the car,they hand me 2 drinks, then one blizzard with no lid so asked for lids they set one on top of the blizzard, its melting so I\'m trying to put the lid on its running down the side. I ask for a Carrier. They put the lid on the other melting blizzard put in carrier and hand it to me.  I get home with pretty much milk shakes.  Have really been disappointed in the blizzards lately.  They make them as soon as you order, but when you have 5 cars in front of you they are melted before you get home\",\"time\":1693323047,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"BEN GEHMLICH\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/103149107894684945088\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjUEjT8k-2FtHD_9QV_pURzFhcos8NJSqhtFLHvnpVEnhnw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":4,\"relative_time_description\":\"5 months ago\",\"text\":\"Went on a Saturday night, place was packed. Lucky to get a seat.\\nStaff was great; quick and polite. They made a custom sundae order for my wife without issues. Snickers blizzard was amazing. They brought the treats to us at our table, only took a few minutes.\\nOverall it seemed like a very good DQ. Will come back.\",\"time\":1680662016,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Jess Lm\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102261878235805132071\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocIlrnWdc-c0ucXkP5MfSR7LoRFjmFK0O3QuxhR5sYP_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"We love this location, every time we come in there\'s a gentleman named Tamari that goes above and beyond for our table. He is courteous, attentive, polite, and friendly. This young man works hard and always has a smile on face. You don\'t normally see young men his age ready and happy to work, this young man is an exception. Great work, Tamari. Great job DQ staff! Food is consistent and ice cream is always great!\",\"time\":1688476818,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"store\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=6476376956715577170\",\"user_ratings_total\":1230,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"754 West State Street, Hurricane\",\"website\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dairyqueen.com\\/en-us\\/locations\\/ut\\/hurricane\\/754-w-state-st\\/7095\\/?utm_source=organic&utm_campaign=yext%2F&y_source=1_ODk5NjgxMC03MTUtbG9jYXRpb24ud2Vic2l0ZQ%3D%3D\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:05','2023-09-19 05:56:05'),(114,'The Pizza Wagon','googleplaces','ChIJ--RHg8f2yoARbUCNbsTDYWE',120,'A pizza oven attached to a truck offering an array of classic & creative toppings for take-out only.',10,0.20,1,1,0,'{\"business_status\":\"OPERATIONAL\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":37.17596169999999,\"lng\":-113.3019527},\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":37.17758288029149,\"lng\":-113.3005356697085},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":37.1748849197085,\"lng\":-113.3032336302915}}},\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v1\\/png_71\\/restaurant-71.png\",\"icon_background_color\":\"#FF9E67\",\"icon_mask_base_uri\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.gstatic.com\\/mapfiles\\/place_api\\/icons\\/v2\\/restaurant_pinlet\",\"name\":\"The Pizza Wagon\",\"opening_hours\":{\"open_now\":false},\"photos\":[{\"height\":4000,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/118101694385533754475\\\">Jeremy Andra<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zimixGDI3bgJ95D8t9JJZFHTMi9O28eiEpYr2sZK0LyQYjUzigo4JHTJ-F6-tNv658loZDJXzqtI6EETCYXmojH6tp8PpSA9OYcswFGpQoWVi4_pTkq8r96gRnHOqmwXHL-b6uJwLjZ7GYLFuEfWIhYbHfITubQaESV61AeT_xN2JE\",\"width\":3000}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ--RHg8f2y