Stockton Walbeck<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zijLX8-9gPAeePX0G_mho8v1d9ROXrrX_W_DbWA6f1tsR-Uz9TE7q8wziugLjRXvVczLRYys7MnTn9d7XykE5LOP0Hs0T_-zuM49_xccFMWNkS9YD8kgjXpRxj8V3V-6Qx3GCMb-UhYWAinr_aVZHonmbp9tT4nO9iTsebUbSuw9zs0\",\"width\":3024},{\"height\":2252,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/102466555827233876183\\\">Paul Lewis<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zgiuQBGiMW4q0QzHo5PB_HcEzm_uncx6dCun32Z_mIWIVsBzyV9Jjqm_xLDThYy7NvE9Y5gkst-oJoVcAxAptfxBqBAPBnD6G-a_NgqC0gF2bUXU7VxlKQJ5qSa0pp0mj6i39gt9nE1qXrQvFHDVoiJ-LojZekaB-cw6ftI89_rN1A8\",\"width\":4000},{\"height\":4000,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/104682972193835677811\\\">Fred Earls<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zinTzXApAuWJ2Q7NEIKYod8QzMzcI7GGKYlwQoHKTksUZaegeu1iex_4r6oJe-YLeWRSAn2xVL-Yv8uqTEIJHwT7l6712OtbjvQx0LFhZvpEFELKJw5fPNhn4mQ6czT0kKjNF56u71JYjPjsCAthHi3fJNdRQIvLEWWs5UvKeHC-h0\",\"width\":6016},{\"height\":4032,\"html_attributions\":[\"<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/117934778609925359323\\\">Brent Gildner<\\/a>\"],\"photo_reference\":\"ATJ83zjg1xbA_cyI8k-nFc0esekdMyIS4VdS8CY_lCM8NVNQZrhUrP39N8RduvaIQnlA6nvDNJwObYrGCo2G2WQo9KP93XdmoNPPmDiDAms4-ChqwGX1Vub2RP3ZbdCqtbtDjKY_GVox-uY_32toOq4lXI-F_BD-EiRiSFQY_74Z9aNn8mZW\",\"width\":3024}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ--RHg8f2yoARbUCNbsTDYWE\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"5MGX+96 Hurricane, UT, USA\",\"global_code\":\"85985MGX+96\"},\"price_level\":1,\"rating\":4.8,\"reference\":\"ChIJ--RHg8f2yoARbUCNbsTDYWE\",\"reservable\":false,\"reviews\":[{\"author_name\":\"Ryan Wantland\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107686159356309023924\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVMHB9xQRVYwpodDpxxT9z2tjIDTx-9HWxRq1-et2x6Obc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a week ago\",\"text\":\"We love Pizza Wagon.  Every pizza we have tried on their menu is delicious.  One pizza is enough for two people but because they\\u2019re so reasonably priced, we each get our own.  Grab some drinks and hang out at one of the tables in the parking lot while they cook your pizza!  The only negative is the wait can be quite lengthy, especially after 4:00pm.\\n\\nThe best pizza in the St George area, period.\",\"time\":1694269980,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Scott Godown\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/108132723302492907463\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjXacSE7Xg8ZXM0mbLlc7OacmxX8wNjpnwIsoeSycH5Ncpg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"4 months ago\",\"text\":\"The Pizza Wagon did not disappoint! Super tasty pies and relatively quick cool times. Delicious thin crust cooked in a wood fired pizza oven. Toppings and options were plentiful. So glad we stopped in to try it.\",\"time\":1682814234,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Eric Campbell\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107213978439837702024\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVQU0zB8WZEd5BuszxAzG6A49Z75m2x2u8kvGt2Qt-m5dg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"a month ago\",\"text\":\"Amazing pizza place. We were staying in the windgate hotel right across the street so we decided to stop by. They are only open Thursday-Saturday. Make sure to call early and get your order in, they get very busy and the wait for your pizza can get up to 1-2 hours. The price is great and the quality of the pizza is amazing. They cook it right there in front of you in a 1000 degree pizza oven!\",\"time\":1690351216,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Lisa Kees\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/115592916718442893939\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a\\/ACg8ocLHDpKBqxpww0oQ44_6Yv2aE7is-Ps9KEb4RY9hRyCW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"2 months ago\",\"text\":\"The reviews of The Pizza Wagon did not disappoint! You want to place your order sooner than later because you get put on a wait list. Ordered at 3pm and picked the pies up at 7:50.  Delicious thin crust cooked in a wood fired pizza oven. Toppings and options were plentiful. Happy we stopped in to try it.\",\"time\":1688241611,\"translated\":false},{\"author_name\":\"Stockton Walbeck\",\"author_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/contrib\\/107522373025737230394\\/reviews\",\"language\":\"en\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"profile_photo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\\/a-\\/ALV-UjVQsdcx6G5ps36irnQZWBE9_9AOfxqNvdWgToavesjHVn4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\",\"rating\":5,\"relative_time_description\":\"3 months ago\",\"text\":\"Love that this is a little shack run by a family and they can pump out such high quality pizzas. Loved it! The hurricane pizza was my favorite. Apparently it\\u2019s a secret menu item. Real good though! Probably not as good as Rigattis pizza which is in St. George but loved the dough and the perfect amount of char on the crust.\",\"time\":1687055516,\"translated\":false}],\"serves_beer\":false,\"serves_breakfast\":false,\"serves_brunch\":false,\"serves_dinner\":true,\"serves_lunch\":true,\"serves_wine\":false,\"takeout\":true,\"types\":[\"restaurant\",\"food\",\"point_of_interest\",\"establishment\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/?cid=7017104942855700589\",\"user_ratings_total\":585,\"utc_offset\":-360,\"vicinity\":\"765 West State Street, Hurricane\",\"website\":\"http:\\/\\/dixiepizzawagon.com\\/\",\"wheelchair_accessible_entrance\":true}}',1,'2023-09-19 05:56:05','2023-09-19 05:56:05');
